<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JOB" style="id">- Toma Bible</book>
  <para style="h">Zɔɓe</para>
  <para style="toc1">Zɔɓe Ná-Sɛʋɛi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Zɔɓe</para>
  <para style="toc3">Zɔɓ</para>
  <para style="mt1">Zɔɓe</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ná-Sɛʋɛi</para>
  <para style="imt">Sɛʋɛi lɔɔzeizuʋɛ ma woo mɔungiti</para>
  <para style="ip">Sɛʋɛi nii ɠa zunui ta ná-faa zuɠulazu, nii é ɠɛni ga telebo nu, daaseigi ga Zɔɓe. Zunui naa wola ɓɔlɔni, kɛlɛ é la koto ɠɛɛni GALA daalɔɠɔma, é ʋa naa ʋeelala. Nu nɔpɛ ge la Zɔɓe Ná-Sɛʋɛi ɠɛɛ nui ɠwɛɛ, nu la ɓalaa kɛɛ yeeɠɛɠalai ɠwɛɛ, kɛlɛ ɗa ka ga Zɔɓe ná-eteai ziɛni mɛmɛwolaiti ta-ziɛgi zu, ʋelei Abalaame la, tɔɔzei sii ma ɠonagi ɠɛɛni ga kona ungila puunaanigɔ (140). Faaɠwɛ nu wolaiti ti la laani da ga Zɔɓe ɓɔɠɔ ɠa é sɛʋɛi nii ɠɛai. Ti ɠisiɛʋɛ ga nu ɠili ta, nii nu la kwɛɛ, naa ɠa é sɛʋɛai, é ɠisiɛai ga toɠa ga faa ʋagɔ ga é Zɔɓe ná-wɔlɔwɔlɔ vai zuɠula taɠiligaa ma.</para>
  <para style="ip">Zɔɓe Ná-Sɛʋɛi ɠa ɓɔɛzu é ʋilɛ kpɔlɔi ʋa. Zobogi veeni Setana ya ga é Zɔɓe ɓɔlɔ, tɔɔzei é ɠisiɛni ga naa a la ɠɛ ga zaɓu Zɔɓe looɠo lɛbiyai vee vai ʋa GALA bɛ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JOB 1:11">1:11</ref></char>). Sɛʋɛi wɔɔlɔzuʋɛ kpein ka Zɔɓe ta bɔɔlaiti ta-yɛpɛi zuɠulazu, é lo ná-kpɔlɔi ma ungi ʋa. Zɔɓe bɔɔlaiti ta-ɠisiɛi ɠɛni kotoi ta ɠa é kɛai, kɛlɛ Zɔɓe mu ge laani da ga toɠa ga sɔbalala nu. Naa ʋoluma, GALA ge ɓɔɛni Zɔɓe ʋɔ, kɛlɛ é la Zɔɓe ná-kpɔlɔi ma ungi lɛɛni la pɛ. Zɔɓe kwɛɛgai ma ga GALA ka zoo fai pɛ kɛɛzu, ʋelei é pɔ la, ta nu vulu ɠila kpalaa ge la zooga GALA kɛɛ vaa ʋapagiti gaaɠaazu, é GALA ná-tuyai zɔlɔɔni ʋolu, é sɔlɔɔ ganii mɔinmɔin ta doun mɔinmɔin sɔlɔɔ.</para>
  <para style="iot">Unsosuʋɛ</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Fai niiti Setana ti wuzeɠeni Zɔɓe laalɔɠɔma, ti ɠɛai ga naa ná-kpɔlɔi ma ungi (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JOB 1:1-2:13">1:1—2:13</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Zɔɓe ta bɔɔlaiti ta-ɓɔɛzuɠulaiti é lo ná-kpɔlɔi ʋa (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JOB 3:1-37:24">3:1—37:24</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">3. GALA ge ɓɔɛni Zɔɓe ʋɔ, Zɔɓe ma ge gooɠaaʋote (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JOB 38:1-42:6">38:1—42:6</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">4. Zɔɓe ná-eteai ma zeidai, ta ʋelei GALA ge tuyai looni la bɛ gaaɓelasu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JOB 42:7-17">42:7-17</ref></char>).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JOB 1"/>
  <para style="s">Zɔɓe ná-suɠɔɠɔ mɔungi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 1:1"/>Zunui ta ɠɛni Use yooi zu, daaseigi ɠɛni ga Zɔɓe. É ɠɛni ga zunui nii peelalazu la ba, é zɔle, é ɠɛni luazu GALA ba, é ɗa maaɠooza faa ɲɔi ɠɛɛ vai ʋa. <verse eid="JOB 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 1:2"/>Zunu loun lɔfela ɠa é sɔlɔɔni ta anzanu loun saʋagɔ. <verse eid="JOB 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 1:3"/>Ná-toganii ɠɛni ga baalagi ta bolii waadɔfela (7.000), ta ɲɔmɛi waasaʋagɔ (3.000), ta wozawoli nikɛ waagila (1.000), naa ʋɛɛ soovale saa undɔɔlugɔ (500) ʋa. Botiɠɛ nui ɠɛni zea ga bɔɔlɔa. Zunui naa ɠa é ɠɛni ga sɔɓelama nu wolai, zooi naati su ti Zuludɛn folo ɠulazu ʋelei.<verse eid="JOB 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 1:4"/>Ná-doun zunuiti ti ɓena ɓɔɠɔ loli, ti ɗa fɛtii ɠula ta-ʋɛlɛiti bu, naa ɓena ɠɛ ga seɠezeɠedai, ti ɠɛni ti-ʋaazeela saʋagɔiti tolisu, ti laami ʋɔɔma, ti ɓɔɔle. <verse eid="JOB 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 1:5"/>Siɛgi zu naama vɛti voloiti gaa a la ɓelana la, Zɔɓe ɠɛni ná-dointi tolisu, ti ʋa, nii a kɛ é zalaɠai ɠula ti ʋɛ, ti ɲade. É ɓena wuzeɠe ga sobuzobui, é gala zalaɠai ɠula ti ɠilagilagi ná-faa zu. Mazɔlɔɔ é ɠɛni ɠɛɛzu ɓɔɠɔ ma: «Tanisu dòinti ti faaɠaazagi ta ɠɛɛʋɛ, ti GALA koto ti-yiimaʋɛ.» Ʋele ɠana nɔ Zɔɓe ɠɛni kɛɛzu la ɠɔ.<verse eid="JOB 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 1:6"/>Yeeta, GALA ná-geezuɠeelaiti ti ʋaani, ti lo Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazu maaɓɔgi zu. Setana, nii é ga maalɔɔ nui, naa ʋaani tɔ ɓalaa ti zaama. <verse eid="JOB 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 1:7"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠɛni Setana ma: «Ɗa zeɠezu mini?» Naa gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Gè ɠɛa eteai zuɓizɛzu, gè ɗa ziɛziɛ.» <verse eid="JOB 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 1:8"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠɛni ma: «È nà-botiɠɛ nui Zɔɓe zumɔgɛ nɛi? Nu nɔpɛ ge la ga tɔun kɛʋele eteai zu, zunu ʋe peelalazu la ba, é zɔle, zunu ʋe é luazu GALA ba, é ɗa maaɠooza faa ɲɔi ɠɛɛ vai ʋa.» <verse eid="JOB 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 1:9"/>Setana gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Zɔɓe ɠa luazu GALA ba nɔ lɛin ɓaa? <verse eid="JOB 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 1:10"/>Ɗa ɓaazu maazu, pele ungi pɛ ma, eɠɛ a ɠɛ sasa zu, tɔ-o, ná-pɛlɛyeɠei-yo, zeaɠɔligiti-yo È zeavai pɛ suɓɛtɛʋɛ, ná-toganiiti gaawɔɔlɔa zooi zu. <verse eid="JOB 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 1:11"/>Kɛlɛ yeevɔɔɠu lɛɛ zeaɠɔligiti ba, ta ná-nuiti, ɗa pɛtɛ ni é la è ɠotoni gaamanɔ.» <verse eid="JOB 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 1:12"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠɛni la Setana ma: «Kɔli pagɔi kpein ka ɗa-zobogi wu, ta ná-nuiti, kɛlɛ mina yeevɔɔɠu tɔ ɓɔɠɔi ɓusɛi ʋa.» Naazu ɠa Setana zeɠeni Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɔ bɛ.<verse eid="JOB 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 1:13"/>Yeeta, Zɔɓe ná-doun zunuiti ta ná-doun anzanuiti ti ɠɛni daamii wosu, ti ɗa dɔɔi ɓɔle ʋɔɔma, ti-liɛ zunu mɔungi ʋɔ bɛ. <verse eid="JOB 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 1:14"/>Keela ɠila ge ʋaani é Zɔɓe ɠa, é daazeeli ma ga: «Nikɛiti zɛgɛ nɔ wozai wolizu, soovale saaiti ti ɗa laami ti ɠoba, <verse eid="JOB 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 1:15"/>Saɓa nuiti tooʋɛ ti zu, ti li ga tiye. Ti ɗa-wotiɠɛ nuiti kpein paaʋɛ ga boɠa zɔkpɔi. Nà ɠila kpe ka kùlaai, gè ʋa gè naama vai laazeeli è ma.»<verse eid="JOB 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 1:16"/>É yɛni nɔ ɓɔɛzu, keelai taɠili ge ʋaani, é ɠɛ ma: «Geeɓadɛi looʋɛ ɗa-ʋaala kpulugiti su, ta ɗa-wotiɠɛ nuiti. É ti pɛ galaʋɛ. Nà ɠila kpe ka kùlaai, gè ʋa gè naama vai laazeeli è ma.»<verse eid="JOB 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 1:17"/>É yɛni nɔ ɓɔɛzu, keelai taɠili ge ʋaani, é ɠɛ ma: «Ɓaɓilɔne nuiti ma ɓulugi ɠɛɛʋɛ ga seizu saʋagɔ, ti ʋa, ti loo ɲɔmɛiti su, ti li ga tiye. Ti ɗa-wotiɠɛ nuiti paaʋɛ ga boɠa zɔkpɔi. Nà ɠila kpe ka kùlaai, gè ʋa gè naama vai laazeeli è ma.»<verse eid="JOB 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 1:18"/>É yɛni nɔ ɓɔɛzu, keelai taɠili ge ʋa, é ɠɛ ma: «È-loun zunuiti ta è-loun anzanuiti zɛgɛ nɔ daamii wosu, ti ɗa dɔɔi ɓɔle, ti-liɛ zunu mɔungi ʋɔ bɛ, <verse eid="JOB 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 1:19"/>fiilɛ wola ɠila kpe kulaʋɛ ga teʋebai zu ʋele, é loɠa pɛlɛi ma zeki naanigɔiti ba, é wolo è-lointi ma. Ti pɛ ti zaaʋɛ. Nà ɠila kpe ka kùlaai, gè ʋa gè naama vai laazeeli è ma.»<verse eid="JOB 1:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 1:20"/>Zɔɓe wuzeɠeni, é ná-seɠe wolai ʋali ga kidaaʋiligi maaʋele ma, é nɔungi ɓuye, é laaʋɛɛ zooi ma, é nɔkɔ. <verse eid="JOB 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 1:21"/>É ɠɛni ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 1:21">«Kàbei ɠa kùlaai la dèe ɠoozu, kàbei ɠa gè ɠalesu ma la.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 1:21">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI feeni, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI seɠea ʋolu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 1:21">Lɛbiyai ɠa Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ!»<verse eid="JOB 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 1:22"/>Naama maanɔɠɔiti kpein saama, Zɔɓe la ɠɛni koto ɠɛɛni, é la faa ɲɔu nɔpɛ daani GALA unma.<verse eid="JOB 1:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JOB 2"/>
  <para style="s">Zɔɓe ná-suɠɔɠɔ felesiɛi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 2:1"/>Yeeta mɔnɔ, GALA ná-geezuɠeelaiti ti ʋaani, ti lo Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazu maaɓɔgi zu. Setana ʋaani tɔ ɓalaa ti zaama, é lo Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazu maaɓɔgi zu. <verse eid="JOB 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 2:2"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠɛni Setana ma: «Ɗa zeɠezu mini?» Naa gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Gè ɠɛa eteai zuɓizɛzu, gè ɗa ziɛziɛ.» <verse eid="JOB 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 2:3"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠɛni ma: «È nà-botiɠɛ nui Zɔɓe zumɔni nɛi? Nu nɔpɛ ge la ga tɔun kɛʋele eteai zu, zunu ʋe peelalazu la ba, é zɔle, zunu ʋe é luazu GALA ba, é ɗa maaɠooza faa ɲɔi ɠɛɛ vai ʋa. Toɠa loni kpaan ná-telebodai zu. È dìiʋɛ koloɠolo fai ma nɔ wafuun.» <verse eid="JOB 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 2:4"/>Setana gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Falibo ka fai kpein ba, nui ɠa ɠɛlɛ zeaɠɔligi kpein ba, zɛnvui ɠizo fai zu. <verse eid="JOB 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 2:5"/>Kɛlɛ yeevɔɔɠu lɛɛ kpusɛi ʋa, ma zuai ta ma ɠaeiti, ɗa pɛtɛ ni é la è ɠotoni gaamanɔ.» <verse eid="JOB 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 2:6"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠɛni Setana ma: «Toɠa ɗa-zobogi wu, kɛlɛ makɛ zɛnvui ma.»<verse eid="JOB 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 2:7"/>Názu ɠa Setana zeɠeni la Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɔ bɛ. É divolo seeɓɛ ɲɔi ʋɛɛ Zɔɓe ʋa, é zo kɔɠɔaʋɛ, é lɛ nɔungi zu. <verse eid="JOB 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 2:8"/>Zɔɓe zeini zuʋu ziɠigi zaama, é diɠi zaɠai ta zeɠeni, é ɗa ɓɔɠɔ maawɔin da.<verse eid="JOB 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 2:9"/>Anzai ɠɛni ma: «Ɗa loni nɔ kpaan ɗa-lelebodai zu! GALA koto mu, è za!» <verse eid="JOB 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 2:10"/>Kɛlɛ é ɠɛni naa ma: «Ɗa ɓɔɛzu eɠɛ anzanui nii ɠi ge la ma. Da yeezeizu undaanɛɛi wu ga GALA ná-vebɛanii, lee vaa zu da ɠɛlɛ maanɔɠɔi ʋa?»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 2:10">Naama maanɔɠɔi kpein saama, Zɔɓe la ɠɛni koto ɠɛni ga daaʋɛ.<verse eid="JOB 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zɔɓe bɔɔla saʋagɔiti ta-laalimai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 2:11"/>Zɔɓe bɔɔla saʋagɔiti ti naama maanɔɠɔ vai kpein mɛnini, nii é zeelini ma. Ti zeɠeni ta-yooiti su ti ɠilagilagi, tiya ɠa ti ga: Elifaze nii é ga Teman nui, ta Ɓilidade nii é ga Suɠa nui, ta Sofaal Naama nui. Ti deveni ga ti li ti laali ma, ti ziilaa. <verse eid="JOB 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 2:12"/>Siɛgi zu ti ɠɛni la ɠoozama, ti ka, ti la ɠɛni ɠwɛɛsu ɠaani ba. Ti wɔlɔni, ti ɗa wola zɔngɔ, ti ta-zeɠe wolaiti baliʋali ga kidaaʋiligi maaʋele ma, ti fufiligi lɛ geezu, é vaza ti unma. <verse eid="JOB 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 2:13"/>Ti zeini koba zooi ma, eyɛsu folo lɔfela, kpidi lɔfela. Nu nɔpɛ ge la woo ɲɛ gila kpalaa boni ma, mazɔlɔɔ ti kwɛɛni kpezekele ʋelei ná-kpɔlɔi wɔɔlɔni la.<verse eid="JOB 2:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JOB 3"/>
  <para style="s">Zɔɓe ná-kpaazaɠa wooiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 3:1"/>Naa ʋoluma, Zɔɓe laalaoni, é sɔlɔɔ foloi ɠoto. <verse eid="JOB 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 3:2"/>É kpɔɛi lɔɔzeini, é ɠɛ ma:<verse eid="JOB 3:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 3:3"/>«Foloi naa ɠoloɠolo, yeei gè zɔlɔɔni da,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:3">ta kpidii nii é ɠɛni ma: ‹Zunu loun ma wo ge zeɠea!›<verse eid="JOB 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 3:4"/>Foloi naa, é ɠɛ ga kuai.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:4">GALA nii é geezuʋɛ, é mina yiizoolɛ la,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:4">wozakala ge mina volo su.<verse eid="JOB 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 3:5"/>Kuai ta kpidi ɓɔii ti seɠe ga tɔnɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:5">tonaɓiingiti ti yɛ zɛlɛni maazu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:5">foloi ma lɔmɔzɔɔgi maalua!<verse eid="JOB 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 3:6"/>Kpidii naa ma, é ɠɛ ga kpidii nii tɛigai é leʋe ti pɛ ba!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:6">Gaa mina lu konagi ma voloiti saama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:6">é mina lɔ alugi ná-gaalugiti su.<verse eid="JOB 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 3:7"/>Ungo, kpidii naa zuɲakai yɛ de,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:7">koozunɛ woo mina ɠɛ su!<verse eid="JOB 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 3:8"/>Ungo, naama ɓidii maayo ge zeɠe nui naati bɛ ta ɗa foloiti koto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:8">ta niiti ti ziɛ wu zua maayikiai lolisu!<verse eid="JOB 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 3:9"/>Kuai ná-sobu zomideɠaiti maalɔɔɠu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:9">é ɠito wozakalagi ʋa, kɛlɛ naa mina ʋa pɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:9">é mina geelaalaosuʋɛ ɠaazuɠɔlɔgiti buuɠa!<verse eid="JOB 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 3:10"/>Mazɔlɔɔ é la naama ɠogi laaɠuluni, nii é sɔ̀lɔɔni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:10">ɓaa é ʋa pele leʋe nà-maanɔɠɔi luɠɔ!<verse eid="JOB 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 3:11"/>«Lee vaa zu gè la zaani aisa gè ʋa zɔlɔɔ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:11">Lee vaa zu gè la zaani sɔ̀lɔɔsuʋɛ?<verse eid="JOB 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 3:12"/>Lee vaa zu gè nu ɲiibi felegɔiti sɔlɔɔgai, ti yeezei bù,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:12">ta dèe ɲiimiiti zɛ̀gai ti ɓɔlezu, gè ɠula su?<verse eid="JOB 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 3:13"/>Niizu nà la ɠɛ niina laani dɔin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:13">gè ɠɛ ɲiizu, gè ɗa looɠo<verse eid="JOB 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 3:14"/>ga masagiti ta etea nu wolaiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:14">niiti ti ɠizɛsu aniiti togai ʋolu, niiti ti ɠoloɠologa ɠɛni de,<verse eid="JOB 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 3:15"/>ta kundiɠiiti, zanugi ti ya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:15">ti ta-ʋɛlɛiti daavesu ga walii.<verse eid="JOB 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 3:16"/>Ɓaa gè mina ɠula etea, eɠɛ doin saai sɔlɔɔsuʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:16">ɓaa eɠɛ doungoiti niiti ti la ɠaazulaani folo ma.<verse eid="JOB 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 3:17"/>Kabai zu, faa ɲɔu nuiti ta looɠo niina ga zɔiti kpɔlɔa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:17">niiti ti ɓɔlɔai, ta zoo ti lago looɠo.<verse eid="JOB 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 3:18"/>Kasoɠa nuiti ziilɛiʋɛ ná,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:18">ti la mɔ ta-wɛlɛma nuiti daawoo ɠila kpalaa mɛnisu.<verse eid="JOB 3:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 3:19"/>Ɓolomadɔɠɔiti ta seizumaanɛgiti ta ná,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:19">duɔi viega, é ɠula maliɠii ya.<verse eid="JOB 3:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 3:20"/>Lee vaa zu wozakalagi veezu maanɔɠɔ nui ya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:20">ta zɛnvui veezu naati zea, niiti ti ziiɓɔlɔi zu?<verse eid="JOB 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 3:21"/>Ti ɗa saai maaɓɔun, naa ma ge la ʋaazu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:21">ti ɗa gaiziɛ é leʋe naavoloi ʋa.<verse eid="JOB 3:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 3:22"/>A la ɠɛ ti ʋɛ ga undaanɛ vaa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:22">ti ɠoozunɛ gola ni ta la ta-ɠabayeɠeiti sɔlɔɔ.<verse eid="JOB 3:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 3:23"/>Nà ga zunui nii é la liizu ɠwɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:23">tama GALA ge kàtagɛ eɠɛ nà ɠɛ sasa ʋolu.<verse eid="JOB 3:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 3:24"/>Kpàla gooiti ti ɠɛa ga nà-daamianigi ʋotogi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:24">Nà-kpee wooi nà-taɓai zu, naati kɛɛʋɛ eɠɛ ziɛi é yeizu.<verse eid="JOB 3:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 3:25"/>Nii dùai ba, naa ɠa é sɔ̀lɔɔgai.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:25">Nii gè inɛinɛni ba, naa ɠa seeliai mà.<verse eid="JOB 3:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 3:26"/>Gè la gaanɛɛi zu, ɓaa ziilɛigi, ɓaa dooɠogi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:26">kɛlɛ kpɔlɔi nɔ ɠa gè daawu yeenɔpɛ.»<verse eid="JOB 3:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JOB 4"/>
  <para style="s">Elifaze ná-kpɔɛzuɠula mɔungi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 4:1"/>Teman nui Elifaze kpɔɛi zeɠeni, é ɠɛ ma:<verse eid="JOB 4:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 4:2"/>«Nu ɠa zoo nɛi é woo ɲɛ gila bo è ma? È wola iɲɔteʋeʋɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:2">Kɛlɛ ɓɛ ɠa zoo é maaɠɛ kpɔ?<verse eid="JOB 4:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 4:3"/>Wɛlɛ, ɗa ɠa è ɠɛa nu mɔinmɔin kalasu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:3">è ti iɲɔdɔ, tɛigiti ti-yee zuɓɔlɔni.<verse eid="JOB 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 4:4"/>È ɓɔɛ wooiti ti ɠɛni naama nui wuzeɠezu nii é ɠɛni loozu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:4">è ɗa naati sɛbɛlɔ, niiti ti-ɲiibiiti suɓɔlɔai.<verse eid="JOB 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 4:5"/>Niizu ɗa ɠa è iɲɔ ge leʋea siɛgi zu maanɔɠɔi è ma la!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:5">Tɛi ɗa ɠa pilɛgai è ʋa, è ɠɛa unga wuulee!<verse eid="JOB 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 4:6"/>Ɗa-ɠidaaleʋei è bo ga GALA ma, naa laade é ʋa ɠɛ ga ɗa-ladalai ma ungi ɓaa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:6">Ɗa-lelebodai la ga ɗa-ɠitogi ɓaa?<verse eid="JOB 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 4:7"/>Ɠisiɛ lɛɛ, sɔbalala nui ɓɛgele ɠa undaaʋiliga?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:7">Sɔle nui ɓɛɛni ka ti zuɠoloɠologa?<verse eid="JOB 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 4:8"/>Ʋelegi gè ɠidaa bu la,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:8">zɔiti ti telebotalai ta nimizai vazasu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:8">ta ɗa ti-ɠaawaai ɠula.<verse eid="JOB 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 4:9"/>GALA daa viilɛi ɠa ɗa ti undaaʋili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:9">toɠa ɗa ti ɠala ná-ziiɠaawanai zu.<verse eid="JOB 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 4:10"/>GALA ka ɗa zalaiti daaɠulu, ta ɠɛna zikɔa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:10">é zala ɓokpagiti ɲiigaiti galeɠale.<verse eid="JOB 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 4:11"/>Daamiani balagi ɠa ɗa zalai ʋaa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:11">zala yiʋoiti ti vaza.<verse eid="JOB 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 4:12"/>«Wooi ta zeelini mà dɔɔɠuzu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:12">gòiyeɠe ma woo goi mɛnini, é ɗa wo vaa,<verse eid="JOB 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 4:13"/>segi zu, kpidii, siɛgi zu kisiɛiti supuai la,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:13">siɛgi zu ɲiimɛni wolai leʋeai la ga nuɓusɛiti.<verse eid="JOB 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 4:14"/>Gè ɓalini ga duai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:14">kàeiti su ɠɛ yɔɔɠɛ.<verse eid="JOB 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 4:15"/>Fiilɛi ta ma zii ʋuuni gàazuʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:15">é kɔɔlɛ ɓooi yei ga ze.<verse eid="JOB 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 4:16"/>Nui ta ɠɛni loni gàazu, gè la ɠɛni baaɠulaba ɠwɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:16">kulakɛlɛmai naa ɠɛni gàazu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:16">Gè woo goi ta mɛnini, é ɗa wo vaa, é ɠɛ ma:<verse eid="JOB 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 4:17"/>‹Nuɓusɛi ɠa lelebo nɛi ɓaa GALA gaazu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:17">Nui ɠa zoo nɛi é ɲade Kpɛtɛ Nui ɠaazu?›<verse eid="JOB 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 4:18"/>Ni GALA ge la zooga é ʋa ʋoluzei tɔ ɓɔɠɔi ná-botiɠɛ nuiti ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:18">ni é kaka fai ɠaa ná-geezuɠeelaiti su,<verse eid="JOB 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 4:19"/>toɠa zoo ɠale ʋoluzeizu nuɓusɛiti ba, ti ɓɛtɛai nɔ ga penɛi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:19">ti ga fufiligi, nu a kpɔnɛkɛlɛ eɠɛ ɓaɠaɓaɠai.<verse eid="JOB 4:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 4:20"/>É zo sobui ma, é ʋa li kpɔkɔi ʋɔ, ti ɠɛa ga fufiligi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:20">ti ɲɛɛlɛ eyɛsu ɠɔ, nu ɠi ge la loa ti zu.<verse eid="JOB 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 4:21"/>Ti-yɛnvui ma ɠalui leʋea ga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:21">ti za, ti la ɠimalai zɔlɔɔni.»<verse eid="JOB 4:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JOB 5"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 5:1"/>«Wooɠula lɛɛ, è pɛtɛ ni nu ɠa è wooɠaaʋote.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:1">Geezuɠeela ɲadegaiti su, ɓɛgele ɠa ɗa wooɠula ma?<verse eid="JOB 5:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 5:2"/>Mazɔlɔɔ ziiɠulagi ɠa a ɗa ɠimalala nui ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:2">ziiɠaawanai ɠa ɗa faaɠaaɠalala nui undaaʋili.<verse eid="JOB 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 5:3"/>Gaamazu, gè ɠimalala nui ɠaani, sape ɗa ziɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:3">su la ɠɛni ɠoozani, gè niima ɠotoi looni ná-pɛlɛyeɠei ma:<verse eid="JOB 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 5:4"/>‹Ná-dointi ti mina ʋoluzeizu nɔpɛ sɔlɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:4">ta ti ʋeelalana tukpɔɠaaleʋezuʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:4">nu mina zɔlɔɔ é ʋa ti maavaawo!<verse eid="JOB 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 5:5"/>Nii a faza, naama lɔnɔgi ɠɛ ga taɠiligaa tɔnɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:5">ti li, ti so, anɛɛ ni ɠaingiti ta ná!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:5">Unsuɲɔu nuiti ti ʋa, ti loo zeaɠɔligiti su!›<verse eid="JOB 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 5:6"/>«Maanɔɠɔi la ʋɔnɔga é ʋa ɠula fufiligi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:6">kpɔlɔi la wuzeɠea é ʋa ɠula pɔlɔi ʋa.<verse eid="JOB 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 5:7"/>Mazɔlɔɔ nui ɠa zɔlɔɔsu kpɔlɔi zɔlɔɔ fai ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:7">eɠɛʋelei abuɓeɓelai a ɗa wuzeɠe koʋe fai ma la.<verse eid="JOB 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 5:8"/>«Ni nà ɠɛni de, GALA nɔ ɠa nà la ʋoluzei ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:8">ungo, GALA ka nà la nà-faiti daazeeli ma.<verse eid="JOB 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 5:9"/>Niiti é ti ɠɛɛzu, naati ta ga faa wolaiti, nu la ti ɠaaɠa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:9">nu la zooga è ʋa ná-laavɔɔ vaiti gaalu.<verse eid="JOB 5:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 5:10"/>Tɔ ɠa a ɗa tonai ʋu eteai zu ná pɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:10">é dɔɓɔi kpein kɔ ga ziɛi.<verse eid="JOB 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 5:11"/>Niiti ti maayeiɗai, toɠa naati buzeɠe, ti ɠaaɠooza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:11">niiti ti yiizoolɛai, toɠa naati unmɔɔ, é ti ɠula.<verse eid="JOB 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 5:12"/>Toɠa ɗa naati ta-vaazeikpasuiti suɠoloɠolo, niiti ti ga keleɠele nu ɲɔiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:12">ti-yeeiti ti la zooga ti ʋa ɓɔ ti ʋa, ti ʋa li luɠɔma.<verse eid="JOB 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 5:13"/>Toɠa ɗa ɠima nuiti so ga balii, nii é ga ta-ɠeleɠele ɲɔi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:13">ta-lɛnɛ ɲɔiti ti la faa ʋaa.<verse eid="JOB 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 5:14"/>Ta ɗa ziɠa kpidii ʋa folo ɓekpegi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:14">ti ɗa yeeʋɛɛ mɛmɛ folo gaalɔgai.<verse eid="JOB 5:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 5:15"/>GALA ka ɗa bala nui ɠula ti-laaʋɛ ma woɠa zɔkpɔi laawu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:15">toɠa ɗa maawɔin nui ɠizo, é kula zobobɛ nuiti zea.<verse eid="JOB 5:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 5:16"/>Kito ka maawɔin nui ʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:16">ta toɠa ɗa faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nuiti pɛ daaɠulu.<verse eid="JOB 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 5:17"/>«Naa ɠa é ba deɠɛmu, undaanɛ nui ɠa ga naa, zɔi GALA ge maaɠolozu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:17">Mina ɠɛlɛ Zɛbɛi-Pɛ-Maliɠii ná-maaɠoloi ʋa.<verse eid="JOB 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 5:18"/>Mazɔlɔɔ GALA ka nu ɓɔlɔ, é è ɠɛdɛ ɓalaa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:18">Ni a nu maawanana, tɔ ɓɔɠɔi ɠa a kpe.<verse eid="JOB 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 5:19"/>Kidaaʋili seizu lɔzita zu, toɠa è ɠula ti zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:19">dɔfelasiɛi zu, faa ɲɔu la zeelia è ma.<verse eid="JOB 5:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 5:20"/>Pului ma ziɛgi zu, toɠa è ɠizo saai ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:20">kɔɔi ɓɔi ʋa, toɠa è-yɛnvui makɛ.<verse eid="JOB 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 5:21"/>Ɗa lɔɔɠuzu zɔlɔɔ nu nɛgi ná-kpakɔi ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:21">è la lua faa zuɠoloɠologi ʋa é ʋaazu.<verse eid="JOB 5:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 5:22"/>Ɗa ɲɛɛɠula faa zuɠoloɠologi ta pului zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:22">è la luaa dɔɓɔ zuaiti ba.<verse eid="JOB 5:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 5:23"/>Mazɔlɔɔ minazeɠe ka ɠɛ wo yɔɠɔzu wa dɔɓɔzu ɠɔtuiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:23">ta ziilɛigi ɠa ɠɛ wo yɔɠɔzu wa dɔɓɔ zuaiti.<verse eid="JOB 5:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 5:24"/>Ziilɛigi ɠa ɠɛ ɗa-ʋɛlɛi wu ná pɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:24">siɛgi zu è wɛlɛzu la ɗa-logani ɓulugiti ma sasai zu, gaa la ʋalaga ta ʋa.<verse eid="JOB 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 5:25"/>Ɗa pɛtɛ ga ɗa-ʋɛlɛyeɠei ɠaa ɠa wɔɔlɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:25">è-mavofodaiti ti ʋɔnɔ eɠɛ dɔɓɔzu lufaiti.<verse eid="JOB 5:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 5:26"/>Ɗa yei kabai zu ga pɔlɔzaɠadai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:26">eɠɛ molo ɠili wolai nii daavegai.<verse eid="JOB 5:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 5:27"/>Wɛlɛ, naa ɠa gi ɠidaai bu gola, tɔ ɠana.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:27">Woilo niima vaiti ma, è ɗɔnɔ zɔlɔɔ ti zu.»<verse eid="JOB 5:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JOB 6"/>
  <para style="s">Zɔɓe Elifaze wooɠaaʋote fai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 6:1"/>Zɔɓe gooɠaaʋoteni naazu, é ɠɛ ma:<verse eid="JOB 6:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 6:2"/>«Ee, ni nà-ziiɓɔlɔi a la zoo ɠɔɠɔsu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:2">ni a la zoo ɠɛɛzu nà-maanɔɠɔi kpein ge zei ʋɔɔma kiloi ɠa.<verse eid="JOB 6:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 6:3"/>Ti ɠɛa wuizu, ti leʋe kpoloɗɛi ma ɲaɠaegi ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:3">naa ɠa é kpɔ̀ɛ wooi lateʋesu.<verse eid="JOB 6:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 6:4"/>Ungo, GALA Zɛbɛi-Pɛ-Maliɠii bɔ̀a ga ná-mɛɛinti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:4">ti ma wanai zìi laavega,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:4">GALA ná-maalua vaiti ta ɠɛʋele ɓɛtɛzu kɔɔɠɔ vai zu dàalɔɠɔma.<verse eid="JOB 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 6:5"/>Dɔɓɔ zoovalegi ɠa ɗa zikɔ nɛi ɓaa, siɛgi zu é tufa wundu lɛnugi miizu la?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:5">Nikɛi ɠa ɗa zikɔ nɛi ɓaa, siɛgi zu é ná-tufai ɠakalaʋɛ la?<verse eid="JOB 6:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 6:6"/>Nu ɠa zoo nɛi anii miizu, é la nɛɛni kpolo la ba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:6">Nɛɛzu ɠa nɛi tɛɛ ɠain ma ɗɛ ɠolegi ʋa ɓaa?<verse eid="JOB 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 6:7"/>Nii mɔungi gè ɠɛni ɠɛlɛzu ba, naa ɠa niina é ga dàamianigi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:7">Ná ɠa é ga dàamianigi, anɛɛ ni wɔin la mà.<verse eid="JOB 6:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 6:8"/>«Wɔin ɠa mà gola ga gè gooɠaaʋotegi zɔlɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:8">GALA ge va bu, é naa ɠɛ bɛ̀, nii kìtogai ba.<verse eid="JOB 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 6:9"/>GALA ge va bu é dɛ̀ɛvɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:9">é yeei maale, é mà vaa ɠaaɓela!<verse eid="JOB 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 6:10"/>Nà kuai wo ga koozunɛɛi nà-kpɔlɔi zu nii kpela ge la ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:10">ziilɛi faa ɠaaɓelagi nà la sɔlɔɔ, naa ɠa é ga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:10">gè mina GALA ɲadegai ná-deveiti yaava.<verse eid="JOB 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 6:11"/>«Leeni ɠa gè ɠitosu ba, zɛbɛ nɔpɛ ge la mɔ bà?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:11">Leeni ɠa gè yɛnvuzu ma mɔnɔ, ʋelela ʋele la mɔ bɛ̀?<verse eid="JOB 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 6:12"/>Nà ga kɔtui ɓaa, gè ʋa zobo sɔlɔɔ fai pɛ ma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:12">Kpùsɛi ɠa ga kɔlu ɓɔigi ɓaa?<verse eid="JOB 6:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 6:13"/>Kpɔba la mɔ bɛ̀, ɓaa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:13">Kpɔbai zɔlɔɔsuʋɛ pɛ maa la ɠoozani bà ɓaa?<verse eid="JOB 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 6:14"/>«Nui nii é taɓai zu, maanɛɛʋɛ bɔɔlaiti ti ta-wooɠɛɠiladai tago ɠula kɛlɛma bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:14">anɛɛ ni a la looɠo lɛbiya veezu Zɛbɛi-Pɛ-Maliɠii GALA bɛ.<verse eid="JOB 6:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 6:15"/>Bɔ̀ɔlaiti ti yàava eɠɛ kɔtuɗɛi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:15">eɠɛ kɔtuɗɛi ta, daazuʋɛ vɔai.<verse eid="JOB 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 6:16"/>Siɛgi zu ziɛ ɓuungi ta kɔɔlɛ vukɔi ti ɠaawuunsu da,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:16">toɠa ɗa yei ga ziɛ ɓɔlɔi.<verse eid="JOB 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 6:17"/>Kɛlɛ die sei ziɛgi zu, ta ɗa vɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:17">foɠoi a ɠulana, ti vɔ su gaamanɔ.<verse eid="JOB 6:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 6:18"/>Siɛ wo nu ɓulugiti kpɔɔle wɔin ti ma, ta zeɠezu ná-pelei ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:18">ti ʋu teʋebai zu, ti loo ya.<verse eid="JOB 6:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 6:19"/>Tema yaaɠoiti ta ziɛi ɠaiziɛzu ga ɠaazuʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:19">Saɓa ziɛ wo nu ɓulugiti kigi ɠa ti ʋa.<verse eid="JOB 6:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 6:20"/>Kɛlɛ ti unfeni, tɔɔzei ti ɠitoni ti ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:20">ti yɛni unfegi zu, siɛgi zu ti zeelini la ná.<verse eid="JOB 6:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 6:21"/>Zekana wo la niina nɔ̀un tetema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:21">wo nà-kidaaʋili fai ɠaa, wo lua.<verse eid="JOB 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 6:22"/>Gè wo valiʋɛ nɛi ɓaa, ga: ‹À faanɛɛ ɠɛ bɛ̀,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:22">wo ta ɠula wo-ɠɔligiti ba nɔ̀un bɛ,<verse eid="JOB 6:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 6:23"/>nii a kɛ wo kùla sili nui ya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:23">wo ùnmɔɔ, wo kùla tooma nui ya›?<verse eid="JOB 6:23"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 6:24"/>«À kàla dɛɛ, kɛ̀ʋele ɓɛtɛʋɛ ga gè maaɠɛ kpɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:24">à bo dɛɛ mà, ɓɛgele ɠa kàkagai su?<verse eid="JOB 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 6:25"/>Kpɔɛ gaamai la ɗa ga nu nɔpɛ maawana.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:25">Kɛlɛ leeni ɠa wa-yelilomaiti ti dɛɛzu?<verse eid="JOB 6:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 6:26"/>Wo wɔinʋɛ ga wo zelii lo kpɔɛzuɠula ɲakaiti ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:26">wooiti kitotala nui ti ʋiligai fiilɛi zu?<verse eid="JOB 6:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 6:27"/>Wa zoo wo kpakutoomai ɠɛ ga podoin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:27">wa yɛ kɛɛzu, eyɛsu wo wo-wɔɔla ɓɔɔɓɔgi ʋɔdi.<verse eid="JOB 6:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 6:28"/>Kɛlɛ, anɛɛ naa ʋe, à so dɛɛ ma, wo wɛlɛ gàazu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:28">À bo dɛɛ mà, ni zɛɛ ɠa gè bosu.<verse eid="JOB 6:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 6:29"/>À wɛlɛ lɛɛ bà: Yaava vaa la ade yɔɠɔzu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:29">À wɛlɛ lɛɛ bà ʋolu: Nà-sɔbalalai ɠulaʋɛ kɛlɛma niima vai tɛi su.<verse eid="JOB 6:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 6:30"/>Telebotala vaa ɠa nɛi nɛ̀gi ma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:30">Wa kaazu ga gè la maanɔɠɔi ma ɠaawanai ɠaaɠaazu ɓaa?»<verse eid="JOB 6:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JOB 7"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 7:1"/>«Nii deveai nuɓusɛi ma eteai zu, kpaaʋɛ eɠɛ salaʋusulai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:1">sii ma voloiti kulaʋɛ eɠɛ nui é zalai ɠaiziɛzu.<verse eid="JOB 7:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 7:2"/>Eɠɛ duɔi é foloi ɠa, é niinigi maaɓɔunsu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:2">ta eɠɛ botiɠɛ nui é zalai maaɓɔunsu,<verse eid="JOB 7:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 7:3"/>zekana gè la, gè alugiti kɛa taɓai zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:3">nà kpidiiti kɛɛzu nɔ kpɔlɔi zu.<verse eid="JOB 7:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 7:4"/>Nà laana nɔ feya, nà ɗa ɠisiɛ ga: ‹Nà wuzeɠe siɛ kpɛgele zu?›</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:4">Siɛgi zu kpidii zuɠoozazu la, dàa ɠa vesu ga kɛunga wuuleegi eyɛsu geelaalao.<verse eid="JOB 7:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 7:5"/>Koegi ʋua kpùsɛi ʋa ná pɛ, kɔ̀lɔgi ɓaa ga pɔlɔi ɠɛʋelei,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:5">kɔ̀lɔgi ɗa ʋaliʋali, é ɗa ɠula ɓɔɠɔ ʋa.<verse eid="JOB 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 7:6"/>Nà-eteai ɠa leʋesu ga maavilɛ, é leʋe seɠe vɛlɛ nui ná-keingi ʋa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:6">Toɠa liizu, é ɓe, kito nɔpɛ ge la ɠɛa ná.<verse eid="JOB 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 7:7"/>«Ee, GALA, ɠizɛ su ga zɛ̀nvui ɠa ga fiilɛi nɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:7">gàazuʋɛ la mɔ undaanɛɛi ɠaa ʋolu eyɛsu ɠɔ.<verse eid="JOB 7:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 7:8"/>È-ɠaazuɠɛzɛi è ɠɛa wɛlɛzu mà la, naa la mɔ zooga é ʋa kà,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:8">siɛgi zu è wɛlɛzu la, gè la mɔ ɠɛa ná.<verse eid="JOB 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 7:9"/>Tonaɓiingi ɠa ɗa ɲɛɛlɛ, é li,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:9">zekana é la, zɔi é yeizu gɔvɛalaazu, é la mɔ lɛa ʋolu.<verse eid="JOB 7:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 7:10"/>É la mɔ ɠalega ma ʋolu, é ʋa ʋa ná-pɛlɛi wu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:10">ta yeema ma seizuʋɛ ɓɔɠɔi.<verse eid="JOB 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 7:11"/>«Naa ɠa é ba, gè la mɔ maaɠɛsu kpɔ ʋolu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:11">zɛ̀nvui ɠa kidaaʋiligi laawu, kɛni mu gè ɓɔɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:11">Nà kpalagi wosu nà-ziiɓɔlɔi laawu.<verse eid="JOB 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 7:12"/>Nà ga kpoloɗɛi ɓaa, ɓaa kpoloɗɛ wu zua wolai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:12">è nua ʋilɛsu dàalɔɠɔma ga ti ɗa wɛlɛ mà?<verse eid="JOB 7:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 7:13"/>Siɛgi zu gè ɠɛɛzu ma la: ‹Nà-betei ɠa gàanɛɛnɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:13">dàazuʋɛ ɠa ɓɔ bà ta zeɠe nà-taɓai ʋa,›<verse eid="JOB 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 7:14"/>naazu ɠa è màaluazu la ga se wuulewuulegi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:14">è gàalua ga kulakɛlɛmaiti.<verse eid="JOB 7:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 7:15"/>Wɔ̀inʋɛ ga è dɔ̀ɔɓa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:15">Ungo, saai vizɔgɛ mà, gè ʋa lia yɛsu ga mà ɠaei nɔ!<verse eid="JOB 7:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 7:16"/>Faa kula ɠɛa, gè la yɛga ná ɠɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:16">zɛ̀nvui la ga ani nɔpɛ, zɛ̀ ná dɔin.<verse eid="JOB 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 7:17"/>«Nuɓusɛi ɠa ga leeni, è ʋa wola ɠigaiziɛ ná-faa zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:17">ta ná-fai wola ʋa ɠɛ è-yii ma,<verse eid="JOB 7:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 7:18"/>è ʋa ɗa ná-fai wuuʋɛtɛ sobu-o-sobu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:18">ta è ɗa ʋa poluɠulazu yeeɠɛɠalai pɛ su?<verse eid="JOB 7:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 7:19"/>Siɛgi ɓɛgele ɠa è-ɠaazuʋɛ zeɠezu la bà?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:19">Siɛgi ɓɛgele ɠa è ɓesu la bà, gè dàaɗɛi ɓɔle?<verse eid="JOB 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 7:20"/>Tɔun, anɛɛ ni gè koto ɠɛɛni, leeni ɠa gè kɛai ga ɗe, ɗɛi è wɛlɛzu nuɓusɛiti ma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:20">Leeni vaa zu è daalogai nà nɔ bà?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:20">Gè ɠɛa ga kasɔ, ɓaa?<verse eid="JOB 7:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 7:21"/>Leeni vaa zu è la nà-tɔ koloɠologiti suvaayɛsu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:21">è ʋa ɓudɛ nà-faaɠaaza golai maazu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:21">Mazɔlɔɔ nágo ʋe na, gè ʋa la fufiligi zu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:21">Ɗa gàiziɛ, kɛlɛ gè la mɔ ɠɛa ná.»<verse eid="JOB 7:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JOB 8"/>
  <para style="s">Ɓilidade ná-kpɔɛzuɠula mɔungi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 8:1"/>Suɠa nui Ɓilidade kpɔɛi zeɠeni, é ɠɛ ma:<verse eid="JOB 8:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 8:2"/>«Ɗa yɛsu niima ɓɔɛzuɠulaiti bosu eyɛsu yeelɛ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:2">Tɔngɔlɔ fiilɛ ɓɔɛi naati maa ɠa leʋezu yeelɛ?<verse eid="JOB 8:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 8:3"/>È laaʋɛ da gaamazu ga GALA ka ɗa telebodai valibo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:3">ɓaa Zɛbɛi-Pɛ-Maliɠii ɠa ɗa sɔle fai maaʋe?<verse eid="JOB 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 8:4"/>Ni è-loun zunuiti ti kotoi ɠɛa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:4">é ta-lɔ koloɠologiti salaa ti ma.<verse eid="JOB 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 8:5"/>Kɛlɛ ɗɔun, ni ɗa GALA gaiziɛzu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:5">è kpɔbai ɠaiziɛ Zɛbɛi-Pɛ-Maliɠii ya,<verse eid="JOB 8:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 8:6"/>ni peelalazu la è ʋa, è zɔlegɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:6">gaamazu, naazu toɠa ɠaaɓa è ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:6">é tosuʋɛ ve è ya nii soloogai è ma.<verse eid="JOB 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 8:7"/>È ɠɛʋele mɔungi è ɠɛni su, naa ɠa lɔi è ɠaazu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:7">ɗa pokɔɠɔna ma niinɛi ma ɗa ɠɛ su.<verse eid="JOB 8:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 8:8"/>Deɠɛmu, nuiti ti etea ziaa è luɠɔ, naati gaazaɠa dɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:8">è ɠida faiti bu niiti ti-mɛmɛwolani ti ziaai ti zu.<verse eid="JOB 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 8:9"/>Mazɔlɔɔ ade zɔlɔɔgɛ wogi nɔ, ade la faa nɔpɛ kwɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:9">tɔɔzei de-zii ma voloiti eteai zu, ta leʋesu eɠɛ niinigi.<verse eid="JOB 8:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 8:10"/>Kɛwolaiti ta ɠigi ve è ya, ti è ɠala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:10">ti kula naa zu, nii ti ziaa su.<verse eid="JOB 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 8:11"/>«Tɛmui la ʋɔnɔga ni kpetei ɠɔmaʋɛ la de,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:11">seeligi la ʋɔnɔga ni dɛilɛigi la ná.<verse eid="JOB 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 8:12"/>Anɛɛ ni puaʋɛ, nu la teʋeni ga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:12">ziɛi maa a leʋena, é vɔ tufai zɔiti tuɠɔ.<verse eid="JOB 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 8:13"/>Zekana a ɗa ɠɛ la ga naati, niiti ti yeemazu GALA ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:13">faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nui ná-kitogi ɠa ɠoloɠolo.<verse eid="JOB 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 8:14"/>Kitosuʋɛ ɠa ɠoloɠolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:14">ná-ladalai ɠa nɔ ga ziingo lɛdɛi ɠɛʋele.<verse eid="JOB 8:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 8:15"/>Siɛgi zu ti ʋoluzeizu la ta-ʋɛlɛi ʋa, naa ɠa ɗa ɲiikpi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:15">ta ɠaaɓaana ga ti zɛlɛ da, é la yɛga loni.<verse eid="JOB 8:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 8:16"/>Ti ɠɛɛʋɛ eɠɛ siinziin ganigi, ziɛi su foloi ɠa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:16">é ma ɓekegiti maalesu kpelei maazu.<verse eid="JOB 8:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 8:17"/>Toɠa ma zapeiti dɔɔzu kɔtuiti zɔɠɔzuʋɛti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:17">ti pele zɔlɔɔ, eyɛsu ti yei fasai wuʋɛ.<verse eid="JOB 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 8:18"/>Ta folona seizuʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:18">ná ɠa kɛ eɠɛ kaipa é la ɠɛni kwɛɛ.<verse eid="JOB 8:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 8:19"/>Wɛlɛ koozunɛɛi ʋa, nii é sɔlɔɔsu ná-pelei zu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:19">Taɠili ka ʋɔnɔ potogi zu zooi ma.<verse eid="JOB 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 8:20"/>«Ɓa-o, GALA ge la sɔbalala nui ʋiliga ya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:20">é la ɓɔga faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nuiti ba.<verse eid="JOB 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 8:21"/>Nágo ʋe na, é ʋa é è laave ga ɲɛɛ wɔin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:21">è-lakɔlɔgiti ti ɗa zeze ga koozunɛ wooiti.<verse eid="JOB 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 8:22"/>Niiti ti è wɔinzeɠezu, unfegi ɠa naati maaɓɔle.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:22">Nu ɲɔiti ta-zeɠe ɠotaiti ta ɲɛɛlɛ.»<verse eid="JOB 8:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JOB 9"/>
  <para style="s">Zɔɓe Ɓilidade wooɠaaʋote fai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 9:1"/>Zɔɓe gooɠaaʋoteni naazu, é ɠɛ ma:<verse eid="JOB 9:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 9:2"/>«Gaamazu, gè kwɛɛ ga zekana é la.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:2">Nui ɠa lelebo ɠale GALA gaazu?<verse eid="JOB 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 9:3"/>Ni nu ɠa pɔ é maaɠaali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:3">é la zooga é ʋa gooɠaaʋote<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:3 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">é la zooga é ʋa gooɠaaʋote</char><char style="ft" closed="false">: Tati pelei taɠili ɓalaa ka ga nii: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">GALA ge la gooɠaaʋotega</char></note> gila pa fe woo waagilagi (1.000) zaama.<verse eid="JOB 9:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 9:4"/>GALA ka nɔnɔ ga ɠimalai, ná-zobogi zuɓaaʋɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:4">Ɓɛ ɠa a sakpe, é ʋa ɓe ma zalai zɔlɔɔsu?<verse eid="JOB 9:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 9:5"/>Toɠa ɗa gizeiti seɠe ti-losuʋɛ, ti la loa ga ná,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:5">é ti loka ná-ziiɠaawanai zu.<verse eid="JOB 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 9:6"/>Toɠa ɗa zooi ɓali ma wuulaagiti maazu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:6">ma lɔkpalaiti ti ɲiikpi.<verse eid="JOB 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 9:7"/>A ɓɔɛna foloi ʋɔ, foloi la ɠulaa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:7">Toɠa zoo pele ɓesasu somideɠaiti tuɠɔ ga ti volo.<verse eid="JOB 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 9:8"/>Tɔ ɠila ka a ɗa geeɠɔlɔgi zuvie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:8">tɔ ɠa a ɗa ziɛ kpoloɗɛi ɠaaɠoozazuʋɛti maazu.<verse eid="JOB 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 9:9"/>Tɔ ɠa é geezu ʋoo golaiti kpɛtɛai, ti laa ga:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:9">‹Wuluse Golai›, ta ‹Wɔliyɔn›, ta ‹Peleyadegiti›,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:9">ta poogi é lɛkpɛma ʋelei nu yeezazuʋɛ.<verse eid="JOB 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 9:10"/>Nii é kɛɛzu, naa wɔɔlɔʋɛ, nu la gaaɠaa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:10">ná-laavɔɔ vaiti gaa la luga.<verse eid="JOB 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 9:11"/>«Ni é ɠɛni leʋesu kòbaʋɛ, gè la ɠɛni kaa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:11">naa ʋolu, a la maaɠooza, gè la ɠɛni loa ga ná.<verse eid="JOB 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 9:12"/>Nii a so ga zɛbɛi, ɓɛ ɠa a kula zea?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:12">Ɓɛ ɠa a zoo é ɠɛ ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:12">‹Leeni ɠa è kɛɛzu?›<verse eid="JOB 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 9:13"/>GALA ge la ná-ziiɠaawanai zuzoga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:13">Ziɛ wu zua ɲɔiti Laɠaɓe ta polu ani ɓulugi, ta yɛ laani kɔɠɔwu.<verse eid="JOB 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 9:14"/>«Nɔ̀un nà zoo gè gooɠaaʋote ɠale?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:14">Wooi ɓɛgeleni ka nà yiimazeɠe ga tiye, gè ʋa ti wo ma?<verse eid="JOB 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 9:15"/>Anɛɛ ni gaamai ɠa zèa, gè la zooga gè ʋa gooɠaaʋote nɔpɛ fe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:15">Kɛni nɔ gè maawɔinɠai ɠaiziɛ nà-tukpɔɠaaleʋe nui ya.<verse eid="JOB 9:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 9:16"/>Anɛɛ ni nà wooɠulana ma, é gòoɠaaʋote,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:16">anɛɛ naa ʋe, gè la zooga gè ʋa la da ga toɠa gòomɛnisu.<verse eid="JOB 9:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 9:17"/>É tèʋegɛ fiilɛ wolai zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:17">É màawanazuʋɛ mɔin, un ge la ba.<verse eid="JOB 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 9:18"/>É la vaazu bu, gè ʋa yɛnvu laaɠula.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:18">Toɠa dɛ nɔ zìimaʋɛ laavesu ga ani wanai.<verse eid="JOB 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 9:19"/>Ni nà lona daawu, ná-zɛbɛi wɔɔlɔʋɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:19">Nà ɠɛɛna gè ɓɔɠɔ maalobo?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:19">Ɓɛ ɠa a toli tukpɔɠaaleʋezuʋɛ?<verse eid="JOB 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 9:20"/>Anɛɛ ni gaamai ɠa zèa, toɠa pèelala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:20">gè kpɔɛ nɔpɛ suɠula ʋa, toɠa pèelala anɛɛ ni nà ga sɔbalala nu.<verse eid="JOB 9:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 9:21"/>Tama, nà ga sɔbalala nu! Kɛlɛ gè la yiizoolɛzu ga ɓɔɠɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:21">zɛnvui wɔinzeɠea mà.<verse eid="JOB 9:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 9:22"/>Ti pɛ ta ga faa ɠila nɔ nɔ̀un bɛ, naa ɠa é ba, nà zoo gè ɠɛ ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:22">‹GALA ka ɗa sɔbalala nui ɠoloɠolo, ta nu ɲɔi ɓalaa.›<verse eid="JOB 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 9:23"/>Siɛgi zu faaɓaagi ʋaazu la, é sɔbalala nui ʋaa nɔ kpe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:23">GALA ka ɗa ɲɛɛɠula sɔbalala nuiti ta-ʋoluɠulaiti su.<verse eid="JOB 9:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 9:24"/>Siɛgi zu zooi lɔɔzu la nu ɲɔiti ta-zobogi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:24">toɠa ɗa tukpɔɠaaleʋe nuiti gaazuɠole.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:24">Mazɔlɔɔ ni tɔ laade, ɓɛ ɠili ka a naa ɠɛ?<verse eid="JOB 9:24"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 9:25"/>«Nà-foloiti ti leʋega fala, eɠɛ kpizɛ wo nui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:25">ti ʋela, ti la undaanɛɛi zɔlɔɔni.<verse eid="JOB 9:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 9:26"/>Ti leʋe gaamanɔ eɠɛ tɛmu ɓatoi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:26">eɠɛ koɠɛi é yeizu, é zeɠe geezuʋɛ, é loo ná-daamianigi ma.<verse eid="JOB 9:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 9:27"/>Nà ɠɛna ma: ‹Kɛni gè yeema nà-ziizoolɛiti ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:27">gè ɠaazuʋɛ valibo, gè tɔɔzei ga ɲɛɛi woga,›<verse eid="JOB 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 9:28"/>màa ɠa ɓalizu nà-kpɔlɔiti kpein faa zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:28">mazɔlɔɔ è la sòga ga nui sɔ ge la ba.<verse eid="JOB 9:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 9:29"/>Nà la leve ga sɔba nu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:29">Leeni vaa zu gè ɓɔɠɔ ɓɔlɔzu wafuun?<verse eid="JOB 9:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 9:30"/>Anɛɛ ni nà màagbazu ga kɔɔlɛ vukɔi ma ɗɛi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:30">gè zèeiti gaagba ga tɔbɔgi,<verse eid="JOB 9:30"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 9:31"/>ɗa dɔ̀ palaʋalai zu gaamanɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:31">gè ɲɔu nà-seɠeiti gaazu.<verse eid="JOB 9:31"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 9:32"/>«Mazɔlɔɔ é la ga nuɓusɛ ga kɛ̀ʋele nii nà zoo gooɠaaʋotesu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:32">ɓaa gi ʋa ɠomi tukpɔɠaaleʋezuʋɛ.<verse eid="JOB 9:32"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 9:33"/>Ni nu ɠɛni gi felegɔ yɔɠɔzu ga zaamazunui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:33">nii a zoo é dɔɔzɔɠɔzui wo,<verse eid="JOB 9:33"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 9:34"/>GALA ge ná-tukpɔi zeɠe màazu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:34">ná-maalua vaiti ti ɓe, ti mina mɔ kpɔ̀lɔ,<verse eid="JOB 9:34"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 9:35"/>nà zoo gè ɓɔɛ pɔ, gè la lua ba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:35">Kɛlɛ kɛɛɠeleɠele ge la ná, nà ɠila nɔ ɠa gè ɓɔɠɔ ʋa.»<verse eid="JOB 9:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JOB 10"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 10:1"/>«Zɛnvui wɔinzeɠea mà,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:1">gè la mɔ kpàla gooiti dɔɔɠuzu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:1">ziiɓɔlɔi é zìimaʋɛ laavegai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:1">nà naa ɠulazu kɛlɛma.<verse eid="JOB 10:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 10:2"/>Gè ɠɛ GALA ma: ‹Mina pèelala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:2">dɛɛ lɛɛ ga ze, leeni vaa zu, è sàkpesu!›<verse eid="JOB 10:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 10:3"/>È yiima vai ɠa ga è kpɔ̀lɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:3">è ɗa-ɓɛtɛanii ʋɛlɛʋili, nii è-yeei kpɛtɛai?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:3">Faa ʋagɔ ɠana nɛi ɓaa, è nu ɲɔiti ta-vaazeikpasuiti maalobo?<verse eid="JOB 10:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 10:4"/>Kpusɛi ma ɠaazuɠɛzɛiti nɔ ɠa ti è ʋa ɓaa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:4">Ɗa-wozaɠaai ɠa ga nuɓusɛiti ta-wozaɠaai ɠɛʋele nɔ ɓaa?<verse eid="JOB 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 10:5"/>È-zii ma voloiti su ɠa ɓuɠazu ga nuɓusɛiti tɔnɔi ɠɛʋele ɓaa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:5">ɗa-ɠonagiti ti ɠɛ ga nui nɔnɔiti kɛʋele,<verse eid="JOB 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 10:6"/>ga è ʋa nà-faaɠaazagiti gaiziɛ ʋolu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:6">ga è nà-kotoiti kula kɛlɛma?<verse eid="JOB 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 10:7"/>Anɛɛ naa ʋe, è kwɛni ga gè la ga sɔba nu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:7">Nu nɔpɛ ge la ná, nii a kùla è ya.<verse eid="JOB 10:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 10:8"/>«Ɗa ɠa è kpɛ̀tɛni, è-yeeiti ti kpùun ʋɔɔma ɲɛgɛlɛin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:8">tama, ɗa ɠa è kòloɠolosu niina!<verse eid="JOB 10:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 10:9"/>Nà è maanɛɛnɛzu, ɠizɛ su ga è kpɛ̀tɛni eɠɛ penɛi ɠɛʋele.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:9">Ɗa pɔ niizu è gàaɠale ma fufiligi zu?<verse eid="JOB 10:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 10:10"/>È kpɛ̀tɛni dèe ɠoozu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:10">eɠɛʋelei nu nɔnɔi ɠaaɲiizu la pɔlɔ liɠii zu.<verse eid="JOB 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 10:11"/>È màaɠiliʋɛ ga kɔlɔgi ta ma zuai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:11">è fɛ̀lɛʋɛ ga kàeiti ta ɲàtaiti.<verse eid="JOB 10:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 10:12"/>Ɗa ɠa è zɛnvui vea bɛ̀, è ɗa-wooɠɛɠiladai ɠula kɛlɛma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:12">è ɓaa vai màazu, naa ɠa é nà-fiilɛi makɛga.<verse eid="JOB 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 10:13"/>«Kɛlɛ wɛlɛ nii è makɛni è-yiimaʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:13">gè naa ɠwɛɛga niizu, nii è ɠɛni ɠigaiziɛzu.<verse eid="JOB 10:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 10:14"/>Ni nà koto ɠɛɛna, ɗa pɛtɛsu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:14">è la sòsu ga sɔbalala nu nà-faaɠaazagiti faa zu.<verse eid="JOB 10:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 10:15"/>Ni nà ga sɔba nu, maanɔɠɔ ɠa tùɠɔ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:15">Ni peelalazu la bà, anɛɛ naa ʋe, gè la zooga gè ʋa nɔ̀ungi wuzeɠe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:15">nɛ̀igi unfegi ta nimizai kula ɠɛai ga ze.<verse eid="JOB 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 10:16"/>Kɛlɛ nà nɔ̀ungi wuzeɠena nɔ feya, ɗa ɠa è kpɛ̀ɛzu eɠɛ zalai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:16">ɗa dòɠazu mɔnɔ ga ɗa-laavɔɔ vaiti.<verse eid="JOB 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 10:17"/>Ɗa sòpele niinɛi ɠaiziɛzu nɔ kenein,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:17">ta nɔ ɠa é ɓɔsu ɗa-yiiɠaawanai ʋa dàalɔɠɔma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:17">Kɔɔʋɛbɛi ɗa ɓɔɠɔ maavalibo sò fai ma.<verse eid="JOB 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 10:18"/>«Leeni vaa zu è kùlani dèe ɠoozu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:18">Nà la za ná, nu ɠaazu nɔpɛ ge la ɓena la mà.<verse eid="JOB 10:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 10:19"/>Nà la ɠula nɔ dèe ɠoozu, gè sakpa nɔ kabayeɠei zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:19">nà la ɠɛ eɠɛ naati, niiti ti la etea ɠaani.<verse eid="JOB 10:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 10:20"/>Sìi ma voloiti maa la ʋɛlɛni niina ɓaa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:20">È ɓe bà deɠɛmu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:20">È zeɠe kòba, gè ɓɔɠɔ lago iɲɔdɔ,<verse eid="JOB 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 10:21"/>aisa gè ʋa li, gè la mɔ ɠalesu ma ʋolu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:21">kpidi yooi zu, kpidi ɓɔii zu,<verse eid="JOB 10:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 10:22"/>zooi ná zu, ʋɛ geelaalaosuʋɛ ná ga kpidii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:22">ʋɛ kpidi ɓɔii zeini ná faazupui pɛ unda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:22">ʋɛ wozakalagi ɠɛai ná eɠɛ kuai.»<verse eid="JOB 10:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JOB 11"/>
  <para style="s">Sofaal ná-kpɔɛzuɠula mɔungi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 11:1"/>Sofaal nii é zeɠezu Naama, naa kpɔɛi zeɠeni, é ɠɛ ma:<verse eid="JOB 11:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 11:2"/>«Gooɠaaʋote ge la zɔlɔɔga kpɔɛzuɠula mɔinmɔingi niiti bɛ ɓaa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:2">Daawɔɔlɔi ɠa a kɛ nu gaama zɔlɔɔ ɓaa?<verse eid="JOB 11:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 11:3"/>Ɗa-ɓɔɛzuɠula wafuungiti ta nuɓusɛiti maaɠɛ kpɔ ɓaa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:3">Ɗa ɲɛɛɠula nuɓusɛi zu, ti la è unfega, nɛi?<verse eid="JOB 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 11:4"/>È boni ɠite, è ɠɛ ma: ‹Nii gè bosu, gaamai ʋe, ɲàdegɛ è ɠaazu.›<verse eid="JOB 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 11:5"/>Ee, ni é nɛɛni GALA bɛ, é ɓɔɛ è ʋɔ tɔ ɓɔɠɔi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:5">é lakɔlɔgi wuzeɠe, é ɓɔɛ è ʋɔ!<verse eid="JOB 11:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 11:6"/>A la ná-ɠimalai ma lɔɔɠuzu vai lɛɛna ga ɗe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:6">mazɔlɔɔ gola ɠaaɠoozaʋɛ ada-ɠeleɠelegi ʋa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:6">Ɗa la suɠwɛɛ naazu, ga GALA zeemaʋɛ ɗa-vaaɠaazagi ɠilazu ma.<verse eid="JOB 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 11:7"/>«Ɗa zoo nɛi, è GALA ná-faiti kpomaʋɛti kwɛɛ ɓaa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:7">Ɓaa è Zɛbɛi-Pɛ-Maliɠii ná-daazeeli vaiti kwɛɛ?<verse eid="JOB 11:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 11:8"/>Gaaɠoozaʋɛ ga geeɠɔlɔgi ɠɛʋele, leeni ɠa ɗa kɛ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:8">Kpomaʋɛ ɠoozaʋɛ gɔvɛalaazu ɓomaʋɛ ʋa, leeni ɠa ɗa kwɛɛ naa zu?<verse eid="JOB 11:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 11:9"/>Sakpai ɠoozaʋɛ eteai ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:9">kogi wɔɔlɔ kpoloɗɛi ʋa.<verse eid="JOB 11:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 11:10"/>Ni GALA ga ɠɛna leʋega, é yeeʋɛɛ nu ma, é pili kaso ɠa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:10">ɓaa é toli tukpɔɠaaleʋezuʋɛ, ɓɛ ɠa a ɠɛlɛ lii vai ʋa?<verse eid="JOB 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 11:11"/>Mazɔlɔɔ GALA ge nu ɲakaiti kwɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:11">é faa ɲɔi ɠwɛɛ, ʋɛ é ná, kpɛdɛ la ba ga é gaiziɛ.<verse eid="JOB 11:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 11:12"/>Kɛlɛ faaɠaaɠalala nui a ɠɛna ɠeleɠelega,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:12">kɛni voloi dɔɓɔzu zoovale ziʋoi zɔlɔɔsu da ga maaɠoloai.<verse eid="JOB 11:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 11:13"/>«Ɗɔun ɗa, naa ɠa é ba, è-yii lati GALA ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:13">è maanɛɛnɛ, è yeeiti maale pɔ pelei.<verse eid="JOB 11:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 11:14"/>Ni è-yeeiti nɔɠɔʋɛ ga faa ɲɔi, ti ɠaagba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:14">è mina seizu ve telebotalai ʋɛ.<verse eid="JOB 11:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 11:15"/>Ɗa ungi wuzeɠe názu, unfe ge la su,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:15">ɗa lo kpaan, è la lua ani nɔpɛ ba.<verse eid="JOB 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 11:16"/>Ɗa yeema ɗa-ɓɔlɔi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:16">È-ɠigi a loona su, toɠa ɠɛ eɠɛ ziɛi zeiɗai ná.<verse eid="JOB 11:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 11:17"/>Ɗa-eteai zu ɠa ɠala, é leʋe folo gaalɔgai ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:17">kpidii volo eɠɛ geelaalaosuʋɛ.<verse eid="JOB 11:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 11:18"/>È-yiimaʋɛ laa ɠa ve ga ladalai, mazɔlɔɔ kitogi ɠa ɠɛ è ʋɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:18">Ɗa wɛlɛ è-maaɠoolii zu, è la gaanɛ zu.<verse eid="JOB 11:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 11:19"/>Nu nɔpɛ ge la ʋaa é ʋa ɗa-looɠogi zuɠoloɠolo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:19">Nu mɔinmɔin ka ʋa è ʋɔ, ti kpɔbai ɠaiziɛ.<verse eid="JOB 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 11:20"/>Kɛlɛ nu ɲɔiti gaaɓelagi ɠa ga ti-ɠaazuʋɛ za su,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:20">ti-lɔɔɠuzu la ɠɛa ná,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:20">ta-ɠito gila kpegi ɠa ɠɛ ga ti za.»<verse eid="JOB 11:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JOB 12"/>
  <para style="s">Zɔɓe Sofaal wooɠaaʋote fai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 12:1"/>Zɔɓe gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma:<verse eid="JOB 12:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 12:2"/>«Kɛɛʋɛ eɠɛ wo ɠɛa ga nuɓusɛi ná-faaɠwɛgi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:2">kɛni wa ɠimalai wo za ʋɔɔma.<verse eid="JOB 12:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 12:3"/>Anɛɛ naa ʋe, kèleɠelegɛ ga wo ɠɛʋele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:3">gè la kula bu wo ʋɛ ga tago ɓalaa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:3">É ɓudɛ naa maazu, ɓɛ ɠa é la naa ɠwɛɛ, nii wo bogai?<verse eid="JOB 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 12:4"/>Gè ɠɛa bɔ̀ɔlaiti bɛ ga ɲɛɛɠulasu anii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:4">nɛ̀i gè wooɠulazu GALA ma, ga é gòoɠaaʋote,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:4">telebo nui, zunui é ga lada nui, naa ɠa é ga ɲɛɛɠulasui ma ungi.<verse eid="JOB 12:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 12:5"/>«Niiti ti ta-eteai ziɛzu gaanɛ zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:5">naati kisu vai ɠa ga maanɔɠɔi ta bɛlɛɠulabai ɠa é naati tuɠɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:5">niiti ti-ɠɔɠɔi ɓunɛsu.<verse eid="JOB 12:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 12:6"/>Kɛlɛ tooma nuiti ta ɠoozunɛɛzu ta-ʋɛlɛiti bu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:6">zɔiti ti GALA daazuɠɔlizu, naati ta gaanɛ zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:6">ti la gala kili kwɛɛ, kɛni ti-zɛbɛi.<verse eid="JOB 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 12:7"/>«Dɔɓɔ zuaiti gaazaɠa dɛɛ, ta è ɠala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:7">ta wɔniiti, ta ɠi fe è ʋɛ.<verse eid="JOB 12:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 12:8"/>Yɛpɛ lɛɛ zooi ʋɔ, toɠa è ɠala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:8">ta kpoloɗɛi wu ɠaleiti, ta faa mɔinmɔin bo è ma.<verse eid="JOB 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 12:9"/>Naama aniiti kpein saama, ma ɓɛgele ɠa é la suɠwɛɛ ga GALA ka é ti ɓɛtɛa?<verse eid="JOB 12:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 12:10"/>Fuluanii kpein zɛnvui ɠa zoni zeezaamaʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:10">ta nu vului kpein zɛnvui.<verse eid="JOB 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 12:11"/>Nu woiyeɠei ɠa ɗa wooiti zɔɠɔzuɠula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:11">eɠɛʋelei nu laaɠoozuʋɛ a ɗa daamianigi ma nɛɛi yɔɠɔzuɠula la.<verse eid="JOB 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 12:12"/>Ɠimalai ɠa ɗa ɠɛ kɛwola wɔlɔiti zea,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:12">keleɠelegi ɠa sii zuɠoozai zu.<verse eid="JOB 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 12:13"/>Ɠimalai ta zobogi ti lɔɔɠuʋɛ GALA koozu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:13">Tɔ ɠa po ge ga soofaalai ta keleɠelegi.<verse eid="JOB 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 12:14"/>«Nu la naa loga ʋolu, nii GALA ge golozu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:14">Zɔi é pilisu kasoi ɠa, nu la naa ʋilɛga.<verse eid="JOB 12:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 12:15"/>A yeeʋilina ziɛiti su, é ti zo, fɔɔvɔgi ɠa ʋa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:15">A yeeɓena ti ʋa, é ti ʋilɛ, eteai ɠa ɠoloɠolo.<verse eid="JOB 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 12:16"/>Zɛbɛi ɠa zea, ta ɠimalai.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:16">Ni nui ta a ɓɔɠɔ loona ya, ɓaa é nui ta ɠaka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:16">toɠa naati kpein sosu ga ná-zobogi.<verse eid="JOB 12:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 12:17"/>Toɠa ɗa li ga zou lɛnɛbo nuiti duɔlai zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:17">é nuɓusɛiti ta-ɠundiɠiiti dɔ ɠimalala vai zu.<verse eid="JOB 12:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 12:18"/>Toɠa ɗa masagiti ta-zobogi ɠula ti ya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:18">é ti maaɠili ga duɔla zeɠei.<verse eid="JOB 12:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 12:19"/>Toɠa ɗa li ga zalaɠa ɠula nuiti duɔlai zu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:19">Zobobɛ nuiti ti zeiɗai, toɠa ɗa ta-masa kpɔkpɔgi loka.<verse eid="JOB 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 12:20"/>É kpɔɛi ɠula kpɔɛ wo nu wolaiti da.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:20">É kɛwola wɔlɔiti bala faa wuuɓɛɛi ma.<verse eid="JOB 12:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 12:21"/>Toɠa ɗa bɛlɛɠulabai ʋilɛ seizumaanɛgiti polu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:21">Toɠa ɗa faaɓaa nu wolaiti ta-ɠɔɔɠɔ zɔɔlai ɠula ti ya.<verse eid="JOB 12:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 12:22"/>Toɠa ɗa kpidii ɓomaʋɛ vaiti kula kɛlɛma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:22">é kpidi ɓɔii la foloi ɠa.<verse eid="JOB 12:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 12:23"/>Toɠa ɗa ziiti gaawɔɔlɔ, naa ʋolu é ti undaaʋili.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:23">Toɠa ɗa ta-masadai zuɓaɠo, naa ʋolu é ti zo, é li ga tiye ɠoozama.<verse eid="JOB 12:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 12:24"/>Toɠa ɗa ɠigi ɠula nuɓusɛiti ta-ɠundiɠiiti zea,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:24">é ti ʋilɛ ɠɔɠɔma teʋebai zu, ʋɛ pele la ná.<verse eid="JOB 12:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 12:25"/>Ta ɗa yeeʋɛɛ mɛmɛ kpidii zu, wozakala ge la ná,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:25">é ti ʋilɛ ɠɔɠɔma eɠɛ nui niiti dɔɔzogai.»<verse eid="JOB 12:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JOB 13"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 13:1"/>«Ungo, gaamazu, naati kpein, gè ti ɠaani ga nà ɓɔɠɔi gàazuʋɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:1">Gè ti mɛnini ga nà ɓɔɠɔi gòiyeɠeiti, gè ti ɠaaɠa ga pagɔ.<verse eid="JOB 13:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 13:2"/>Nii wo kwɛɛ, gè naa ɠwɛɛ nà ɓalaa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:2">gè la kula bu wo ʋɛ ga tago ɓalaa.<verse eid="JOB 13:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 13:3"/>«Kɛlɛ Zɛbɛi-Pɛ-Maliɠii ɠa gè wɔinni gè ɓɔɛ pɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:3">GALA ɓɔɠɔi ɠakalaʋɛ ɠa gè pɔ gè ɓɔɠɔ maalobo ná.<verse eid="JOB 13:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 13:4"/>Wɔun wa, bɔ̀ɔlaiti, zɛɛi ɠa wo kpɛtɛzu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:4">wo kpein wa ga zɛɛ zale ɠula nuiti.<verse eid="JOB 13:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 13:5"/>A la vizɔ wo ma, wo maaɠɛ kpɔ suɠila!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:5">Wa la ɠɛ ga ɠima nuiti.<verse eid="JOB 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 13:6"/>Nà wo maanɛɛnɛzu, à woilo nà-kpaazaɠa wooi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:6">wo ɠida tùkpɔ wooiti bu.<verse eid="JOB 13:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 13:7"/>Wa ɠisiɛzu ga GALA ka wo botii ɠɛɛzu bɛ ga faa maaʋegai?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:7">Wa maalobosu ga kazemazu vaiti ɓaa?<verse eid="JOB 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 13:8"/>Wa pɔ wo lo GALA polu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:8">Wa pɔ wo daalukpɔi lo bɛ?<verse eid="JOB 13:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 13:9"/>Ni a ɠɛna é wo vɛɠɛlɛfɛɠɛlɛ, toɠa ɠɛ nɛi ga faa ʋagɔ wo ʋɛ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:9">Nu la GALA yaava, eɠɛʋelei nu a nui yaava la.<verse eid="JOB 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 13:10"/>Gaamazu, toɠa zeliiti to wo ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:10">ni topolu ɠa wo kɛɛzu dɔɔɠuzu.<verse eid="JOB 13:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 13:11"/>Wo la luazu GALA ná-maayikii ʋa ɓaa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:11">Maaluai é bosu, naa la wo zasuɓalizu ɓaa?<verse eid="JOB 13:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 13:12"/>Kalagi niiti wo lɛɛzu ti ma kenein kenein, ta-ɠulanumai wola lɔiʋɛ eɠɛ zuʋui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:12">wa-wooɠaaʋotegiti ta ga aniiti ti ɓɛtɛai ga penɛi.<verse eid="JOB 13:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 13:13"/>«À maaɠɛ dɛɛ kpɔ, wo ɓe bà! Nà ɠa gè pɔ gè ɓɔɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:13">Nii a ɠɛ ga ze, naa ɠɛ ga ze.<verse eid="JOB 13:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 13:14"/>Nà ziiɠulakoozui ɠɛɛzu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:14">gè ɠikula zɛ̀nvui zu.<verse eid="JOB 13:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 13:15"/>GALA ge pàa, ni naa ɠa é pɔ, kito nɔpɛ ge la mɔ bɛ̀.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:15">Kɛlɛ tɔun gaazu, nà sìɛ ʋelei maalobo.<verse eid="JOB 13:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 13:16"/>Tɔun vɔlɔ, naama ɠɛʋelei mu ka zoo é kìzo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:16">Mazɔlɔɔ woovele nu nɔpɛ ge la lɔɔzu zɔlɔɔga tɔun pɔ bɛ.<verse eid="JOB 13:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 13:17"/>À woilo naa ma fɔɔn, nii gè ʋaazu bosu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:17">À ɠida bu, gòoiti poluʋɛ lɔ wo woizu ga pagɔ.<verse eid="JOB 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 13:18"/>Mazɔlɔɔ kɛ̀ʋele ɓɛtɛʋɛ ga gè ɓɔɠɔ maalobo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:18">Gè kwɛɛ ga nà-gaamai ʋe.<verse eid="JOB 13:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 13:19"/>Ɓɛ ɠa é wɔinni é sàkpe názu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:19">Kɛ̀ʋele ɓɛtɛʋɛ, ni gè la ʋeeni, gè maaɠɛ kpɔ ta gè za.<verse eid="JOB 13:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 13:20"/>«Nà-GALAGI, faa felegɔ nɔ ɠa gè ɠɛ è kɛ bɛ̀,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:20">nà zoo naazu gè ɠula kɛlɛma è ʋɛ.<verse eid="JOB 13:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 13:21"/>Mɔunpa, è-yeei é wuizu mà gola, naa zeɠe màazu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:21">mina mɔ ɓe maalua ɠasɔi ʋa, é ʋa gàalua.<verse eid="JOB 13:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 13:22"/>Naa ʋolu, ɓɔɛ pɔ̀, nà è wooɠaaʋote,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:22">ɓaa mu nà ɓɔɛ, è gòoɠaaʋote.<verse eid="JOB 13:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 13:23"/>Faaɠaaza golai, dielegɔ ɠa gè kɛai, ta kotoi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:23">Nà-kotoiti dɛɛ ga ze, ta nà-tɔ koloɠologiti.<verse eid="JOB 13:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 13:24"/>Leeni vaa zu è ɠaazulɔɔɠuzu bà,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:24">è ɗa pɛ̀tɛ ga è zili nu?<verse eid="JOB 13:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 13:25"/>Ɗa pɔ è daai ɲiikpi, nii é ɓalizu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:25">Ɗa pɔ è ʋilɛ daa vɔɔi ʋolu, è kpɛ?<verse eid="JOB 13:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 13:26"/>Mazɔlɔɔ ɗa tùkpɔɠaaleʋezu ga woo wanaiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:26">è ɗa nà-nu niinɛlai ma vaaɠaaza golai ma ɠasɔiti da ùnma.<verse eid="JOB 13:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 13:27"/>È kɔ̀ɠɔ felegɔiti pɛ gilia ga kɔlui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:27">è ɠaazulo bà kpaan sìɛ ʋeleiti pɛ su,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:27">è ɗa kɔ̀ɠɔʋo gaiziɛ.<verse eid="JOB 13:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 13:28"/>Nuɓusɛi zu ɠa lulusu, eɠɛ gului duulai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:28">eɠɛ seɠei ɓaɠaɓaɠai miizu.»<verse eid="JOB 13:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JOB 14"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 14:1"/>«Nui nii sɔlɔɔgai anzanui ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:1">ná-foloiti kwɛteʋeʋɛ, ti zulaave ga kpɔlɔi.<verse eid="JOB 14:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 14:2"/>Toɠa ɠɛɛzu eɠɛ tufa ʋuai é ɠulazu, naa ʋolu é vɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:2">Toɠa leʋesu eɠɛ niinigi, é la loga.<verse eid="JOB 14:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 14:3"/>Tɔ ɠa è ɠaazulaalaogai, è to ba!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:3">Ɗa tòlisu tukpɔɠaaleʋezuʋɛ!<verse eid="JOB 14:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 14:4"/>Ɓɛ ɠa a zoo é ani ʋagɔi ɠula ani ɠɔzɔi zu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:4">Ma nu ɠila kpalaa ge la ná.<verse eid="JOB 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 14:5"/>Tɛi è ná-foloiti tiegɔi leʋea ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:5">ɗa ɠa è ná-alugi liegɔi leʋea ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:5">è ná-konagi liegɔiti kwɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:5">tɔɔzei è ná-eteai ɠwɛteʋeʋɛ, é la ɓudɛa maazu pɛ,<verse eid="JOB 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 14:6"/>ɠaazu lati, è seɠe ba, é lago looɠo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:6">ga é ziilɛi sɔlɔɔ ɓalaa, naa ɠɛ ná-folo luʋai ma zalai zu.<verse eid="JOB 14:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 14:7"/>«Kito ka ɗa ɠɛ ná, gulu wolai ná-fai zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:7">ni nu a pɔna, toɠa ɗa ʋɔnɔ ba ʋolu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:7">ma ʋɔnɔbaiti ti la ʋala ba pɛ.<verse eid="JOB 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 14:8"/>Anɛɛ ni ma zapei ɠa wɔlɔzu zooi wu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:8">ma zapei luula dɔɔɠuai fufiligi zu,<verse eid="JOB 14:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 14:9"/>toɠa ɗa wundu su ʋolu, a ziɛi zɔlɔɔna nɔ feya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:9">é ɓeke eɠɛ siinziin gani niinɛ.<verse eid="JOB 14:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 14:10"/>Kɛlɛ nui a zaana, toɠa yɛsu laani ga ma ʋoomai.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:10">Nuɓusɛi yii a loona, mini ɠa é ná?<verse eid="JOB 14:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 14:11"/>Yeeta, kpoloɗɛi ɠa vɔ su,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:11">ziɛ wolaiti ti maalɔi, ti vɔ su.<verse eid="JOB 14:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 14:12"/>Zekana, nui a ɠɛna ga too nu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:12">é la mɔ wuzeɠea ʋolu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:12">é la mɔ wuunga ɓɔɠɔ ʋɛ, eyɛsu geeɠɔlɔgiti ti ɲɛɛlɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:12">é la ɠulaa ná-ɲiimɛnii zu.<verse eid="JOB 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 14:13"/>Ni nɔ ee, nà-GALAGI, ɗa la kɛɛna, è dɔ̀ɔɠu gɔvɛalaazu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:13">è màkɛ ná, eyɛsu naama voloi zeeli, ɗa-yiiɠaawanai leʋesu da!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:13">Ni nɔ ɗa la ku lo bɛ̀, ta leʋena, è ʋa ɠizɛ sù.<verse eid="JOB 14:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 14:14"/>Kɛlɛ nui a zaana, toɠa vulu su ʋolu, é zɛnvui wo?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:14">Nà la ɠɛ maaɓɔungi wosu nà-botiɠɛ voloiti pɛ su,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:14">eyɛsu pòtogi ʋa.<verse eid="JOB 14:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 14:15"/>Ɗa la tòlina, nà la è wooɠaaʋote naazu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:15">siɛgi zu ɗa wɔinna la ga è kà, nɛ̀i è kpɛ̀tɛai.<verse eid="JOB 14:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 14:16"/>Kɛlɛ tɔun, ɗa niina kɔ̀ɠɔi ʋilɛda ɠilagilagi pɛ gaalusu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:16">ɗa ʋaazu ɓesu ɠidaazu nà-kotoiti bu.<verse eid="JOB 14:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 14:17"/>Ɗa nà-tɔ koloɠologiti dɔɔɠu ɓɔlɔ ɠila su è daaɠulu kpe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:17">è nà-faaɠaaza golai maalɔɔɠu ga penɛ ɠaaɠiligi.<verse eid="JOB 14:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 14:18"/>Anɛɛ naa ʋe, gizei ɠa ɗa ɓusɛ, é vaza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:18">fasai zeɠe losuʋɛ.<verse eid="JOB 14:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 14:19"/>Ziɛiti ta ɗa kɔtuiti sumi, ti ma veinfeingi ɗa yei ga pɔlɔ ʋagɔi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:19">Zekana é la, ɗa nui ná-kitogi ɠoloɠolo.<verse eid="JOB 14:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 14:20"/>Ɗa ɗa gaavala zooi ma, é li, é la ɠalega ma ʋolu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:20">Ɗa gaazulo pelei valibona, è kpɛ maaɠooza.<verse eid="JOB 14:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 14:21"/>Ta ná-dointi kpaɠozu, é la mɔ naa ta ɠwɛɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:21">Ta ti ʋɛlɛʋɛlɛsu, é la mɔ naa ta ɠaaɠaazu.<verse eid="JOB 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 14:22"/>Tɔ ɠila nɔ ɠa é taɓai zɔlɔɔsu ɓusɛi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:22">Tɔ ɠila nɔ ɠa é ziiɓɔlɔi ɠaalu mɛnisu zɛnvui zu.»<verse eid="JOB 14:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JOB 15"/>
  <para style="s">Elifaze ná-kpɔɛzuɠulai velesiɛi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 15:1"/>Teman nui Elifaze kpɔɛi zeɠeni, é ɠɛ ma:<verse eid="JOB 15:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 15:2"/>«Ɠima nui ɠa zoo nɛi é ɓɔɛ eɠɛ nɔ fiilɛi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:2">É ɠoozuʋɛ laave ga folo ɠulazu ʋele viilɛi?<verse eid="JOB 15:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 15:3"/>Kpɔɛ wafuungiti ka a ɓɔɠɔ maalobo da,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:3">ta kpɔɛ mɔinmɔingi nii é la faa ʋaa?<verse eid="JOB 15:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 15:4"/>Ɗa GALA bɔɔlɔ vai ɠaaʋalasu ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:4">è kisiɛ ʋagɔi kpein gaaʋala ba GALA gaazu.<verse eid="JOB 15:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 15:5"/>Mazɔlɔɔ ɗa-vaaɠaazagi ɠa é losu è-laaʋɛ luɠɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:5">è yiimazeɠe ga keleɠele ɲɔu nuiti kpɔɛ ʋelei.<verse eid="JOB 15:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 15:6"/>Nɔ̀un nà laade, kɛlɛ è-laaʋɛ ɓɔɠɔi ɠa é è ʋeelalazu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:6">È-lakɔlɔgiti ka ti zeele wooi veezu è laalɔɠɔma.<verse eid="JOB 15:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 15:7"/>Ɗa ɠa è ga nu mɔungi sɔlɔɔgai eteai zu ɓaa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:7">È folo ɠaaʋɛ gizeiti tuɠɔ?<verse eid="JOB 15:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 15:8"/>È naa mɛnini, nii é woni GALA ná-maaɓɔgi zu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:8">È ɠimalai latini, è kɛ ga ɗa ɠila ɗɔnɔ?<verse eid="JOB 15:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 15:9"/>Leeni ɠa è kwɛɛ, nii gi la kwɛɛ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:9">Faaɠaaɠai ɓɛgele ɠa é è ya, nii é la gi ya?<verse eid="JOB 15:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 15:10"/>Undeɠa ɠolegiti ta gi zaama, kɛwola wɔlɔiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:10">ta-voloi mɔinɗai é leʋe è-ɠɛɛ nɔnɔi ʋa!<verse eid="JOB 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 15:11"/>GALA ná-gaanɛɛnɛ wooiti ta è ɠaazu ga faa go ɓaa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:11">ta sɛsɛbo kpɔɛiti ti wosu è ma?<verse eid="JOB 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 15:12"/>Miná ɠa è-yii liizu ga ɗe ná?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:12">Gaazuziɛsui è kɛɛzu, naa ɠa leeni lɛɛzu?<verse eid="JOB 15:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 15:13"/>Ɗa zoosu è yiiɠaawana GALA ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:13">è-laaʋɛ ɗa naa ɠɛɠala vaiti bo!<verse eid="JOB 15:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 15:14"/>Nu vului ɠa zoo ɠale é ɲade?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:14">Nii sɔlɔɔgai anzanui ʋa, naa ɠa zoo ɠale é zɔle?<verse eid="JOB 15:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 15:15"/>Anɛɛ geezuɠeela ɲadegaiti, GALA ge la laani ti la,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:15">geeɠɔlɔgi la ɲadeni gaazu.<verse eid="JOB 15:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 15:16"/>Nuɓusɛi nɔnɔi ɠa ga lee, nii ɲɔuɗai, é ɠɔzɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:16">nui nii é faa ɲɔi ɓɔlezu eɠɛ ziɛi!<verse eid="JOB 15:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 15:17"/>Nà è ɠalasu, woilo gòoi ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:17">Nii gè kaa, naa ɠa gè ʋaazu bosu è ma,<verse eid="JOB 15:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 15:18"/>nii ɠima nuiti ti daazeelini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:18">nii ti la ɠɛni dɔɔɠuni, ti sɔlɔɔni ti-ɠɛɛni zea.<verse eid="JOB 15:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 15:19"/>Tiya ɠila nɔ ɠa zooi veeni ti ya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:19">Wɛɛn la ɠɛni dɛ leʋeni ti zaama.<verse eid="JOB 15:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 15:20"/>«Faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nui ɠa ɗa lɔ kpɔlɔi nɔ zu sii ma voloiti pɛ su.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:20">Konagiti ti makɛgai sili masagi ʋɛ, ti ɠaalugɛ.<verse eid="JOB 15:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 15:21"/>Zɔngɔ wooi é nu maaluazu, naa ɠa wosu goizu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:21">Ziilɛigi ma ziɛgi zu ɠa faa zuɠoloɠolo nui lɔɔzu la unga.<verse eid="JOB 15:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 15:22"/>É la laani da ga kuai ɠa ɓudɛzu maazu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:22">ki ka ba ga kulafiliba zaai ɠa gaiziɛzu.<verse eid="JOB 15:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 15:23"/>Toɠa leʋeteʋesu, mini ɠa a daamianigi ɠa ná?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:23">É kwɛɛ é ɠɛ folo ɲɔiti ta ɠɛʋele ɓɛtɛzu bɛ.<verse eid="JOB 15:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 15:24"/>Ʋoluɠulai ta ziiɓɔlɔi ta maaluazu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:24">ti zeeli ma eɠɛ masagi nii kɛʋele ɓɛtɛai ga é li kɔɔmaʋɛ.<verse eid="JOB 15:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 15:25"/>Mazɔlɔɔ é yeeɓuunni GALA daalɔɠɔma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:25">é wuzeɠeni Zɛbɛi-Pɛ-Maliɠii laalɔɠɔma.<verse eid="JOB 15:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 15:26"/>É ɠɔgi loga, é ɗa li laalɛɛzu GALA bu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:26">é ɓɔɠɔ makɛgai ga ná-kɔɔɠɔ zɛpɛgi.<verse eid="JOB 15:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 15:27"/>Ma wulɔi gaazuʋɛ maalɔɔɠuai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:27">saamaʋɛti buiɗɛi ma ga ma wulɔiti.<verse eid="JOB 15:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 15:28"/>Taai niiti ti woloai, miná ɠa é liini, é zei ná,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:28">é lɛ pɛlɛiti bu, niiti nu la ti wu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:28">niiti ti ʋaazu wolozu niina.<verse eid="JOB 15:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 15:29"/>É la mɔ zooga é ʋa ɠɛ ga naavolo nu, ná-sɔlɔɔgi la mɔ wuzeɠea,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:29">zeaɠɔligi ɠaa la mɔ wɔɔlɔa eteai zu.<verse eid="JOB 15:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 15:30"/>É la zooga ʋelazu kpidii ʋa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:30">Abuzogi ɠa ma ʋɔnɔbaiti fɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:30">Toɠa ɓɛ ga GALA daa viilɛi.<verse eid="JOB 15:30"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 15:31"/>Wafuun fai ɠa é ɠitogai ba. Kɛlɛ toɠa ɓɔɠɔ yaavazu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:31">mazɔlɔɔ nii a teʋe, naa ɠa ɠɛɛzu ga wafuun fai.<verse eid="JOB 15:31"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 15:32"/>Naa laa ɠa zeeli aisa sii ma voloiti ti ʋa ɓe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:32">ma ʋɔnɔbai la mɔ lɛnuga ʋolu.<verse eid="JOB 15:32"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 15:33"/>Toɠa ɓɔɠɔ maaɓezeɠele eɠɛ leezɛn ansaɠɔgi ma waa ɓiini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:33">eɠɛ wolive wului, toɠa ma ʋuaiti pu ya.<verse eid="JOB 15:33"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 15:34"/>Mazɔlɔɔ faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nui ná-pɛlɛyeɠei la ɓuɠua,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:34">lobɛani zo nui ná-pɛlɛi ɠa ɠɛ ga abuzogi laamianigi.<verse eid="JOB 15:34"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 15:35"/>Nii é ɠisiɛzu faa ɲɔi zu, toɠa sɔlɔɔ ga maanɔɠɔi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:35">Nii é ɠisiɛzu su ziimaʋɛ, naa ɠa é tɔ ɓɔɠɔi ɠakasu.»<verse eid="JOB 15:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JOB 16"/>
  <para style="s">Zɔɓe Elifaze wooɠaaʋote fai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 16:1"/>Zɔɓe gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma:<verse eid="JOB 16:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 16:2"/>«Gè naa ɠɛɠala vai ma mɔinmɔin gola mɛniga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:2">wo kpein wa ga gaanɛɛnɛ nu ɲɔiti.<verse eid="JOB 16:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 16:3"/>Siɛ kpɛgele ɠa wo ɓesu ɓɔɛzu la eɠɛ fiilɛi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:3">Leeni ɠa é è ɓɔlɔzu, è ɓɔɛzu ɠani?<verse eid="JOB 16:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 16:4"/>Nà ɓalaagi nà la zoo ɓɔɛzu ga wo ɠɛʋele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:4">ni wo ɠɛni pòtogi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:4">gè kpɔɛiti bo wo laalɔɠɔma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:4">gè nɔ̀ungi ɲiikpi wo maazu ga ɲɛɛɠulasui.<verse eid="JOB 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 16:5"/>Nà la wo iɲɔdɔ ga dàawooi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:5">gè dàkɔlɔgiti ɲiikpi, naa a la wo yiilɛi.<verse eid="JOB 16:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 16:6"/>«Anɛɛ naa ʋe, ni nà ɓɔɛzu, nà-kpɔlɔi ɠaa la yeizu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:6">ni nà maaɠɛna kpɔ, toɠa zeɠe bà ɓaa?<verse eid="JOB 16:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 16:7"/>Niizu, gaamai zu GALA ge zɛbɛi ɠula zèa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:7">é nà-pɛlɛyeɠei pɛ gaaleʋea.<verse eid="JOB 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 16:8"/>É kɔ̀lɔgi maaɓilikpiliga, é gòla vɔ ɠae ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:8">Naa ɠa pèelalazu, é kɛ̀ ga sɔba nui</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:8">niima vai zu é zeelizu mà.<verse eid="JOB 16:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 16:9"/>GALA ka bàlizu ga ná-ziiɠaawanai zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:9">é laalɛ bù, é ɗa ɲiigaiti siɛ ga dàalɔɠɔma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:9">Sìli nui gaazu ɗa volo su.<verse eid="JOB 16:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 16:10"/>Nuiti ta laa wolaiti daalaosu dàalɔɠɔma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:10">ti ɗa gòizuloɠa, ti ɗa gòla ʋoomu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:10">ti ɠili ʋa dàalɔɠɔma.<verse eid="JOB 16:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 16:11"/>GALA ge dɔ̀ɔni telebotala nuiti zeezu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:11">É kɛ̀ɛni ga faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nuiti daamianigi.<verse eid="JOB 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 16:12"/>GALA ge ʋaani, é ziilɛigi ɠula zèa, ʋɛ gè ɠɛni vulua ná.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:12">É sòni kɔ̀poluʋɛ, é sùɓezeɠele.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:12">Gè ɠɛa ga ná-mɛɛinti pilisuʋɛ,<verse eid="JOB 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 16:13"/>ta ɠoʋesu nɔ màaɠoolii pɛ su.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:13">Toɠa sàamaʋɛ zuvolosu, maawɔinɠa la su.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:13">Zìi ma wanai ʋua ya zooi ma.<verse eid="JOB 16:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 16:14"/>É ɗa palai loo bà, palai ʋoluma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:14">é ɗa ɓizɛ màazu eɠɛ kɔɔɠuluɓai.<verse eid="JOB 16:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 16:15"/>Gè saa wɔlɔ wo seɠei zɔlɔɔga, gè too ɠɔba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:15">Gè gàazu unfegi lɔa fufiligi zu.<verse eid="JOB 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 16:16"/>Gɔlɔ ɲɔuɲɔugi gàazuɠɛzɛiti kpɔiɗa su,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:16">saai ma niinigi ɠa gàazuɓedeɠagiti ba.<verse eid="JOB 16:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 16:17"/>Anɛɛ naa ʋe, suɲɔu vaa la zèeiti kɔzɔni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:17">wooveleda la ɠɛɛni nà-GALA falii zu.<verse eid="JOB 16:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 16:18"/>«Zooi mina mà ɲamai lɔɔɠu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:18">nà-kpee wooi ɠaa mina yei.<verse eid="JOB 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 16:19"/>Mazɔlɔɔ niizu niina zeele ɠa bɛ̀ geeɠɔlɔgi zu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:19">Ungo, nu ɠa zèema geezuʋɛ, nii a zeele wooi wo bɛ̀.<verse eid="JOB 16:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 16:20"/>Bɔ̀ɔlaiti ta ɲɛɛɠulazu sù,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:20">GALA ka nà ɗa wooɠula ma ga gàazuɗɛi.<verse eid="JOB 16:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 16:21"/>Nà-zeelei ɠɛ ga zaamazu lobo nui</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:21">gá GALA gi yɔɠɔzu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:21">eɠɛ nui nii é bɔɔla nu vului maalobosu.<verse eid="JOB 16:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 16:22"/>Sìi ma voloi ɠana ɓe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:22">nà ga li ga pelei naa, nii gè la mɔ ɠalega ma la pɛ.»<verse eid="JOB 16:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JOB 17"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 17:1"/>«Zɛ̀nvu vai ɠaa na ɓaa, sìi ma voloiti ta ɓe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:1">kabayeɠei ɠa màaɓɔunsu.<verse eid="JOB 17:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 17:2"/>Ɲɛɛɠulasu nuiti ti la màaɠoolizu ɓaa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:2">Ta-laazuɠɔlii la vaazu bu, gè ʋa ɲiimɛnii wo.<verse eid="JOB 17:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 17:3"/>Ee, GALA, ɗa ɓɔɠɔi ɠɛ bɛ̀ ga maalobo nui!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:3">É ɠula è ʋolu, ɓɛ ɠa é minazeɠezu ga nà-faa?<verse eid="JOB 17:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 17:4"/>Gaamazu, è ti yiilaaɠuluga kidafaawui luɠɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:4">è la vaa bu, ti ʋa zobo sɔlɔɔ.<verse eid="JOB 17:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 17:5"/>Zɔi é bɔɔlaiti kwɛɛzu ga ti naati zeavoo, toɠa ná-dointi dɔɔzu kpɔlɔi zu.<verse eid="JOB 17:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 17:6"/>«GALA ge kɛ̀ɛni ga nii ɛsɛ pɛ ge ɲɛɛɠulazu su,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:6">ti ɗa laaɗɛi ʋu gàazuʋɛ.<verse eid="JOB 17:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 17:7"/>Gàazuɠɛzɛiti ti la mɔ volozu, ti zaa su ga ziizoolɛi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:7">kpùsɛi kpein ge ɠɛa nɔ eɠɛ niini.<verse eid="JOB 17:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 17:8"/>Sɔle nuiti daavɔɔʋɛ ga nà-taɓai vaa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:8">ta sɔbalala nui ɠa wuzeɠezu nu ɲɔi laalɔɠɔma.<verse eid="JOB 17:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 17:9"/>Anɛɛ naa ʋe, telebo nui ɠaaɓa siɛ ʋelei ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:9">nui zeeiti ɲadegai, naa ta ɓɔ ná-gaaɓaai ʋa.<verse eid="JOB 17:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 17:10"/>Kɛlɛ wɔun bɔ̀ɔlaiti, à ʋa, wo pɛ à ɠale ma, wo ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:10">gè la ɠima nu ɠila kpalaa kaazu wo zaama!<verse eid="JOB 17:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 17:11"/>«Nà-foloiti ti leʋega, nà-faazeikpasuiti ti ʋua ya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:11">zìima vaiti ti la mɔ zolooni.<verse eid="JOB 17:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 17:12"/>Ta ɠɛɛzu ma: ‹Kpidii ɠa ga foloi, wozakalagi maaɓuɠa,›</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:12">tama kpidii ɠa dɛ é ná.<verse eid="JOB 17:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 17:13"/>Kɛlɛ leeni ɠa niina gè ɠitosu ba? Nà zeizu zɔlɔɔ gɔvɛalaazu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:13">kpidi yooi zu ɠa gè dàazuʋɛ ɓɛtɛzu ná.<verse eid="JOB 17:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 17:14"/>Gè ɓainni kabayeɠei ma, gè ɠɛ ma: ‹Ɗa ɠa è ga kɛ̀ɛ!›</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:14">Gè ɠɛ duulai ma: ‹Wa ga dèe ta nà-seelaiti!›<verse eid="JOB 17:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 17:15"/>Mini ɠa deɠɛmu nà-kitogi ná?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:15">Ɓɛ ɠa a zoo é nà-kitogi zuzo?<verse eid="JOB 17:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 17:16"/>Gá yeizu ga tɔ ʋɔɔma gɔvɛalaazu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:16">gi felegɔ gá loozu fufiligi zu.»<verse eid="JOB 17:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JOB 18"/>
  <para style="s">Ɓilidade ná-kpɔɛzuɠulai velesiɛi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 18:1"/>Suɠa nui Ɓilidade kpɔɛi zeɠeni, é ɠɛ ma:<verse eid="JOB 18:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 18:2"/>«Siɛgi ɓɛgele zu ɠa wo ɓesu la kpɔɛ mɔinmɔingi naati ba la?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:2">À ɠigaiziɛ su, naa ʋolu gá ɓɔɛ niina.<verse eid="JOB 18:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 18:3"/>Leeni vaa zu gi levezu ga suaiti?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:3">Toɠa wo ɠisu ga gá ga faaɠaaɠalala nuiti?<verse eid="JOB 18:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 18:4"/>Ee, ɗa ʋe, ɗɛi è ɓɔɠɔ ʋalizu ga ɗa-yiiɠaawanai zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:4">kɛni ɗɔun ɗa-vaa zu kɛlɛbai wo ga eteai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:4">fasai zeɠe tosuʋɛ?<verse eid="JOB 18:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 18:5"/>«Ungo, nu ɲɔi ná-wozakalagi ɠa za,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:5">ma abuzogi é ɠɛa ba, naa ɠa ɓe foloi ʋa.<verse eid="JOB 18:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 18:6"/>Wozakalagi zuɓidi ná-seɠe ɠotai wu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:6">zɛnvui ma zɔmɔgi ɠa za.<verse eid="JOB 18:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 18:7"/>Kɔɠɔi zɛbɛi ɠɛa ba, naa zu ɠa ɓɔlɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:7">tɔ ɓɔɠɔi lɛnɛ gooi ɠa ɠɛ ga too zaɓui.<verse eid="JOB 18:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 18:8"/>Mazɔlɔɔ piligɛ ya, kɔɠɔi lɔ tumɔi zu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:8">Toɠa ziɛzu galuiti zɔɠɔzuʋɛ.<verse eid="JOB 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 18:9"/>Bali sogɛ tibiligi ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:9">ta galuiti daalɔ ba.<verse eid="JOB 18:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 18:10"/>Galu ʋɔɛngi a zo da, naa lɔɔɠuʋɛ zooi wu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:10">balii ɠa maaɓɔunsu pelei zu.<verse eid="JOB 18:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 18:11"/>Maalua vai ɠa polu adaʋɛ pɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:11">é ʋilɛ kɔɠɔʋo ba.<verse eid="JOB 18:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 18:12"/>«Pului suvikɛi ɠula zea,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:12">nimizai maaɠoolia.<verse eid="JOB 18:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 18:13"/>Toɠa kɔlɔgi ma ɓulukpulugiti sumi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:13">Ɗɔfɔ zeeɓɛi ɠa baalobazuʋɛti sumi.<verse eid="JOB 18:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 18:14"/>Tɔɔɠulaʋɛ ná-seɠe ɠotai wu, ʋɛ é ɠɛa ɠalivaazu ná.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:14">É lia ga ɓɔɠɔ maalua masagi ʋɔ bɛ.<verse eid="JOB 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 18:15"/>Ti zei ná-seɠe ɠotai wu, é la mɔ ga nɔnɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:15">Timinigi vazaga seizuʋɛ.<verse eid="JOB 18:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 18:16"/>Ma zapeiti ti vɔa buu ʋelei,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:16">ma ɓeke koiti ti vɔa maazu ʋelei.<verse eid="JOB 18:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 18:17"/>Tɔɠɔi ɲɛɛlɛa eteai zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:17">daasei ge la mɔ etea.<verse eid="JOB 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 18:18"/>Daaʋiliga, é zeɠe wozakalagi ɠa, é ʋili kpidii zu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:18">Ti kpɛa, é ɠula eteai ʋa.<verse eid="JOB 18:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 18:19"/>É la dounɠa yɛni, ɓaa dounlounɠa ná-nuɓusɛiti saama.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:19">Nu vulu nɔpɛ ge la yɛni seizuʋɛ.<verse eid="JOB 18:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 18:20"/>Folo liizu ta folo ɠulazu, naa ɠa mɛni nii é zeizu ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:20">naa ɠa nuiti maalua, ti zasu ɗa ɓali.<verse eid="JOB 18:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 18:21"/>Zekana a ɠɛ la ga telebotala nui ná-pɛlɛi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:21">É ɗa wo ga, ʋɛ ɠɛa ga ada, ʋɛ ti la ɠɛni GALA kwɛɛ ná.»<verse eid="JOB 18:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JOB 19"/>
  <para style="s">Zɔɓe Ɓilidade wooɠaaʋote fai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 19:1"/>Zɔɓe gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma:<verse eid="JOB 19:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 19:2"/>«Wa yɛsu kpɔ̀lɔzu eyɛsu yeelɛ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:2">Ungo, wa yɛsu kpɔ̀lɔzu ga wa-ɓɔɛiti eyɛsu yeelɛ?<verse eid="JOB 19:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 19:3"/>Ná zeizu ɠɛa puu, wo ɗa kìgi zupu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:3">Wo la unfesu ga kpɔ̀lɔ vai?<verse eid="JOB 19:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 19:4"/>Ni kàkagɛ, nà-kaka fai ma ɠasɔi ɠa la ùnma.<verse eid="JOB 19:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 19:5"/>Ni wɔun wa kaana ga wo vizɔgɛ bà,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:5">ni wa ɠɛna zeliloga mà nà-unfe fai zu,<verse eid="JOB 19:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 19:6"/>à suɠwɛɛ ga GALA ka é tòsuʋɛ ɠoloɠologai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:6">é ná-tumɔi lo màaɠoolii zu.<verse eid="JOB 19:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 19:7"/>Ni nà kpee loona suɲɔu vai laalɔɠɔma, nu nɔpɛ ge la gòoɠaaʋotesu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:7">Ni nà kpɔbai maalolina, telebo faa la ɠɛɛzu.<verse eid="JOB 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 19:8"/>GALA ge pelei leʋeni tùɠɔ, gè la zooni gè ʋa leʋe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:8">É kpidii ʋɛɛni nà-peleiti su.<verse eid="JOB 19:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 19:9"/>É ɓaazeɠeni mà,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:9">é nà-lɛbiya wɔɔlɔgi ɠula ùnba.<verse eid="JOB 19:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 19:10"/>É tòka mini-o-mini, ta nà ga li.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:10">É nà-kitogi lɔɔɠula eɠɛ gului.<verse eid="JOB 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 19:11"/>Ná-ziiɠaawanai lokoleʋeni dàalɔɠɔma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:11">É dèveni eɠɛ sili nui ta.<verse eid="JOB 19:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 19:12"/>Ná-kɔɔɓɔgiti pilɛgɛ pelei ma ʋɔɔma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:12">ti ʋaa pɔ̀, ti ta-ʋelei laani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:12">ti ti-zeizuʋɛ ʋu sèizuʋɛ maaɠoolii zu.<verse eid="JOB 19:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 19:13"/>«É nà-nu ɓɔɔɓɔgiti maaɠoozani bà.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:13">Kwɛ̀ɛ nuiti ti vazani, ti maaɠooza bà.<verse eid="JOB 19:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 19:14"/>Nà-nu ɓɔɔɓɔgiti ti ɠɛlɛni bà,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:14">nɛ̀ɛɲɔɠɔiti ti ɠɛlɛni bà.<verse eid="JOB 19:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 19:15"/>Nà-pɛlɛ wu nuiti ta nà-botiɠɛ anzanuiti ɓɔɠɔi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:15">ta kɛɛzu eɠɛ nà ɠɛ ga wɛɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:15">Kɛ̀ɛʋɛ ti ɠaazu, eɠɛ nii nu la kwɛɛ.<verse eid="JOB 19:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 19:16"/>Nà nà-botiɠɛ zunui lolisu, é la gòoɠaaʋotega,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:16">anɛɛ ni nà maanɛɛnɛzu.<verse eid="JOB 19:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 19:17"/>Dàaʋɛ makugi ɠa ɠulazu ànzai ɓɔɠɔi zokpai zu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:17">Wɔ̀inzeɠea kòozu lointi ma.<verse eid="JOB 19:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 19:18"/>Anɛɛ doungoiti ti ɠɛlɛa bà.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:18">Siɛgi zu gè pɔ gè wuzeɠe la, ta ɲɛɛɠulazu sù.<verse eid="JOB 19:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 19:19"/>Bɔ̀ɔlaiti kpein ta luazu bà.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:19">Niiti gè ti nɛɛni ʋɛ gola, naati ti ʋoluavega bà.<verse eid="JOB 19:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 19:20"/>Gè vɔa ɠae ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:20">ta gè ʋalaga anii pɛ ma.<verse eid="JOB 19:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 19:21"/>À màawɔinɠa, à màawɔinɠa, wɔiti wo ga bɔ̀ɔlaiti!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:21">Mazɔlɔɔ GALA zeei ɠa é dòɠani.<verse eid="JOB 19:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 19:22"/>Leeni vaa zu wo ʋilɛsu pòlu, eɠɛʋelei GALA ge ʋilɛsu da pòlu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:22">Wo la dɛ ɓɔlɔni ɓaa ga kpùsɛi ɓɔlɔ vai?<verse eid="JOB 19:22"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 19:23"/>«Ee, ni nui ta ɠa dàawooiti sɛʋɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:23">Ni nui ta ɠa yeeʋozɛ ti ʋa, ti zɛʋɛ sɛʋɛi zu!<verse eid="JOB 19:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 19:24"/>Ti zoo ti kɔlu ɠaazoɓagi zeɠe, ti sɛʋɛ la fasai ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:24">ti kena kpui ziɛ su, sulɛi, é yɛ ná eyɛsu ɠɔ!<verse eid="JOB 19:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 19:25"/>Gè kwɛɛ gè ɠɛ ùnmɔɔ nui ɠa vulua,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:25">tɔ ɠa é wuzeɠezu ga gaaɓelagi eteai zu.<verse eid="JOB 19:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 19:26"/>Niima ɓusɛi ɠoloɠologa ʋoluma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:26">nà ɠɛ kpùsɛi zu, gè GALA ka.<verse eid="JOB 19:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 19:27"/>Nà ka nà ɓɔɠɔi ga gàazuʋɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:27">Nà ka ga gàazuʋɛ, nu ɠili nɔnɔ laade.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:27">Ee! Zìi ɠa ɠalazu kòozu ga maaɓɔungi naa wo fai.<verse eid="JOB 19:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 19:28"/>Wa ɓɔɠɔ ɠaazaɠasu ga, gá ʋilɛ polu ɠale?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:28">Goozuɠulagi ɓɛgele ɠa ada tukpɔ la?<verse eid="JOB 19:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 19:29"/>À lua boɠa zɔkpɔi ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:29">mazɔlɔɔ maaɠoloi ɲɔu ʋe, nii é ɠɛɛzu ga boɠa zɔkpɔi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:29">naa ɠa a kɛ wo suɠwɛɛ ga tukpɔɠaaleʋei ɠa ná!»<verse eid="JOB 19:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JOB 20"/>
  <para style="s">Sofaal ná-kpɔɛzuɠulai velesiɛi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 20:1"/>Sofaal nii é zeɠezu Naama, naa kpɔɛi zeɠeni, é ɠɛ ma:<verse eid="JOB 20:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 20:2"/>«Wɛlɛ niizu, nà-kisiɛiti ta ɓɔizu dà ga gè gooɠaaʋotegi ve,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:2">gè la zooga gè ʋa yiilɔɔ.<verse eid="JOB 20:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 20:3"/>Gè zeliiti mɛnigɛ, ti la zɔleni gàazu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:3">Nɔ̀nɔ ma gaamai ɠa gè losu ma, gè gooɠaaʋotegi ve.<verse eid="JOB 20:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 20:4"/>È la suɠwɛɛ ɓaa ga, siɛnɔpɛ su,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:4">kaipa nuɓusɛi ɠulani etea,<verse eid="JOB 20:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 20:5"/>nu ɲɔiti ta-vɔnifaamai zu la ɗa ga ɠooza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:5">ta nu ɲɔi ná-koozunɛɛi ɠa ga yeeɠɛɠala go nɔ?<verse eid="JOB 20:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 20:6"/>Anɛɛ siɛgi zu sɔligi zeizu la geei ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:6">ta nɔungi ɗa zei tonaɓiingiti ba,<verse eid="JOB 20:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 20:7"/>Toɠa ɲɛɛlɛ eyɛsu ɠɔ, eɠɛ tɔ ɓɔɠɔi koozu ɓooi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:7">Zɔiti ti ɠɛni kwɛɛ, naati ta ɠɛ ma: ‹Mini ɠa é ná?›<verse eid="JOB 20:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 20:8"/>Toɠa ɲɛɛlɛzu eɠɛ segi, kɔɠɔʋo ge loo ya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:8">é loo ya eɠɛ kulakɛlɛmai é wosu kpidii.<verse eid="JOB 20:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 20:9"/>Ti zunui naa ɠaani, kɛlɛ ti la mɔ kaa pɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:9">adaʋɛ é ɠɛni zeini ná, ná yeema ma.<verse eid="JOB 20:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 20:10"/>Ná-doun zunuiti ta bala nuiti zee ɠaaɠale ma, niiti é looni ti ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:10">Tɔ ɓɔɠɔi ɠa ti kpein potogi ve, é ɠula ná-naavoloi zu.<verse eid="JOB 20:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 20:11"/>Zɛbɛi ɠɛni ba ná-nu niinɛlai zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:11">naa kpein ka yeizu ma kabayeɠei zu.<verse eid="JOB 20:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 20:12"/>«Anɛɛ ni faa ɲɔi nɛɛʋɛ da,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:12">anɛɛ ni toɠa makɛsu nɛgi wu,<verse eid="JOB 20:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 20:13"/>é makɛ ba, é la ɠɛlɛa ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:13">é makɛ daa ɠoozuʋɛ,<verse eid="JOB 20:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 20:14"/>daamianigi ɠa valibo koozuʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:14">toɠa ɠɛ koozuʋɛ ga kɛlɛɓɛzɛi ma wanai.<verse eid="JOB 20:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 20:15"/>Naavoloiti é ti ɓɔleni zɔiti zea, toɠa unpili ga tiye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:15">GALA ka ti ɠula koozu.<verse eid="JOB 20:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 20:16"/>Toɠa kɛlɛɓɛzɛi ma wanaiti kpɔlezu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:16">Toɠa saai maazɔlɔɔ ga gozagi ná-ɲiigi.<verse eid="JOB 20:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 20:17"/>«É la mɔ ɠidia ná, ga toɠa kɔin gulɔi zɔlɔɔ mɔnɔ ga undaanɛɛi, eɠɛ ziɛ wolaiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:17">kɔtuɗɛiti ti ga nikɛ ɲiimiɗɛi ma wulɔi.<verse eid="JOB 20:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 20:18"/>Toɠa ɓɔlɔzu lɔnɔgi kpein pu ya, é la yiimaɠɛa su.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:18">Ná-naavoloi kpein é sɔlɔɔni ná-pɔdi loo vaiti su, é la ta wɔinɠulaa.<verse eid="JOB 20:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 20:19"/>Mazɔlɔɔ é bala nuiti koloɠoloni, é ɠɛlɛ ti ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:19">é ta-ʋɛlɛiti goloni, niiti é la ʋaazu ti losu ʋolu.<verse eid="JOB 20:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 20:20"/>Tɔɔzei ziima vai la ɠɛni ɠɛɛni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:20">é la zooga é ʋa ná-naavoloi taɠila kpalaa kizo.<verse eid="JOB 20:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 20:21"/>Toɠa maayii ɠɛ ga nui kpein,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:21">kɛlɛ ná-kulagaanɛɛzui zu la ɠoozaa.<verse eid="JOB 20:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 20:22"/>Anɛɛ ná-sɔlɔɔ golai naa kpein saama, toɠa ɠɛ kpalai zu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:22">Maanɔɠɔ ɓakɔi kpein ka zeeli ma.<verse eid="JOB 20:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 20:23"/>Siɛgi zu é ɓalazu la ga é ɠogi zulaave,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:23">GALA ka yeeɓe ná-ziiɠaawana wolai ʋa, é yei daalɔɠɔma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:23">é ʋu ma daamianigi ʋotogi zu.<verse eid="JOB 20:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 20:24"/>A ʋelana kɔɔɠɔ zɔɔlai ʋa é ga kɔlu gelei,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:24">kɔlu ɓɔi mɛɛin ɠa ʋa é bɔ.<verse eid="JOB 20:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 20:25"/>Mɛɛin é bɔai poluʋɛ, a naa ɠulana ɓɔɠɔ ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:25">kaegi é saamaʋɛ zuvologai, é naa ɠula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:25">saai ná-maalua vai ɠa lɔ unga.<verse eid="JOB 20:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 20:26"/>Kpidii makɛgɛ daalɔɠɔma ga ná-tɔnɔgi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:26">abui nii nu nɔpɛ ge la gaalɛɛni, naa ɠa kɔligiti gala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:26">é naati kpein gala niiti ti yɛsu ná-pɛlɛi wu.<verse eid="JOB 20:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 20:27"/>Geeɠɔlɔgi ɠa ná-faaɠaazagiti kula kɛlɛma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:27">eteai ɓalaa ka wuzeɠe daalɔɠɔma.<verse eid="JOB 20:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 20:28"/>GALA ná-ziiɠaawana voloi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:28">ani ʋagɔi kpein é gaalɛai ba ná-pɛlɛi wu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:28">naa ɠa ɓale, é zeɠe ná.<verse eid="JOB 20:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 20:29"/>Naa ɠa é ga kasɔi, GALA ge kɛʋele ɓɛtɛai nu ɲɔi ná-faa ma, maanɛai é sɔlɔɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:29">Naa ɠa GALA ge deveai tɔun bɛ.»<verse eid="JOB 20:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JOB 21"/>
  <para style="s">Zɔɓe Sofaal wooɠaaʋote fai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 21:1"/>Zɔɓe gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma:<verse eid="JOB 21:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 21:2"/>«À woilo, à woilo gòoi ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:2">Naa ɠa a ɠɛ ga gàanɛɛnɛai.<verse eid="JOB 21:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 21:3"/>À yeezei lɛɛ bu, wo va bu ga gè ɓɔɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:3">siɛgi zu gè ɓɔɛzu la, wa ɲɛɛi wo niina.<verse eid="JOB 21:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 21:4"/>«Nu ɠa gè ɓainsu ga tɔɠɔi ɓaa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:4">Ɓa! Leeni vaa zu deɠɛmu gè la ɓena zoo maaɓɔungi wosu?<verse eid="JOB 21:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 21:5"/>À ɠaaʋote dɛɛ mà, wo laavɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:5">wo yeelɔ la.<verse eid="JOB 21:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 21:6"/>Siɛgi zu nà ɓɔɠɔi gè ɠisiɛzu la naa kpein su, nii é zeelizu mà,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:6">toɠa gàaluazu, sàsu ɗa ɓali.<verse eid="JOB 21:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 21:7"/>«Leeni vaa zu faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nuiti ti eteai ziɛzu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:7">ti wɔlɔzaɠasu, ti zɛbɛi zɔlɔɔ ʋolu?<verse eid="JOB 21:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 21:8"/>Ti-mavofodai ɠa ɗa zei ʋele ɓɛtɛ ti ɠoba, ti ɠaazu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:8">ti-lounlointi pɛ ti ɗa li luɠɔma ti ɠaazu.<verse eid="JOB 21:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 21:9"/>Ziilɛigi ɠa é ta-ʋɛlɛi wu, dua vaa la ná,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:9">GALA ná-kpakɔi la ʋaazu, é ʋa zeeli ti ma.<verse eid="JOB 21:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 21:10"/>Ta-nikɛ zinɛiti ta ga kpuɠu geleiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:10">ta-nikɛ zaaiti ta yiʋoi ʋuuzu, ti-ɠo ge la ɠoloɠologa pɛ.<verse eid="JOB 21:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 21:11"/>Ta ɓesu ti-loungoiti ba, ti ɗa ɓizɛ eɠɛ togani ɓulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:11">ti-lounlointi ti ɗa kuai wo.<verse eid="JOB 21:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 21:12"/>Tamadegi ta kɔnigi, ta ɗa zei ta-wuyeiti bu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:12">ti ɠoozunɛ koole wooiti ma.<verse eid="JOB 21:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 21:13"/>Ti ta-eteai kpein siɛ ʋoluma undaanɛɛi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:13">ta yeizu ga ziilɛigi gɔvɛalaazu.<verse eid="JOB 21:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 21:14"/>«Kɛlɛ ti ɠɛni ɠɛɛzu GALA ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:14">‹Zeɠe gi ʋolu, wɔin la gi ma lago pa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:14">ga gi naama eteai ɠwɛɛ, nii è pɔ ga gi siɛ.<verse eid="JOB 21:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 21:15"/>Ɓɛ ɠa é ga Zɛbɛi-Pɛ-Maliɠii, ga gi dɛbi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:15">Nu a ɠɛna falia, leeni ɠa nu a sɔlɔɔ naa zu?›<verse eid="JOB 21:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 21:16"/>Niima nuiti ta-undaanɛɛi la tiya ɓɔɠɔ ti yeezu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:16">Naama ɠisiɛi maaɠooza bà, gè ʋa ʋilɛ ta-lɛnɛ gooi ʋolu!<verse eid="JOB 21:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 21:17"/>Anɠɛ nɛi nu ɠa ɗa ta-eteai ma wozakalagi ɠa, é ɗa za gaamago nɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:17">ɓaa faa zuɠoloɠologi ɗa zei ti ma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:17">GALA ka ɗa ná-ziiɠaawanai yei nɛi ti ma?<verse eid="JOB 21:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 21:18"/>Anɠɛ nɛi, yeeɠɛɠala mɔinmɔin su,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:18">ti ɠɛɛʋɛ eɠɛ muiin vɔɔi nii fiilɛi liizu la,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:18">ti ɠɛ eɠɛ tufa vɔɔi nii tɔngɔlɔ fiilɛi buzeɠezu?<verse eid="JOB 21:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 21:19"/>«GALA ka kpɔlɔi makɛsu faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nui ná-dointi bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:19">nii tɔ ɓɔɠɔi maanɛɛni ga é sɔlɔɔ ɓaa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:19">Maa la nɛɛni é ʋa naa la faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nui ɓɔɠɔi ma ɓaa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:19">nii a kɛ é ɠigi zɔlɔɔ?<verse eid="JOB 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 21:20"/>Kɛni faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nui ɠaazuʋɛ tɔ ɓɔɠɔi ná-maanɔɠɔi ɠa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:20">tɔ ɓɔɠɔi ɠa maanɛai ga é GALA Zɛbɛi-Pɛ-Maliɠii ná-ziiɠaawanai ɠɔɠɔ.<verse eid="JOB 21:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 21:21"/>Siɛgi zu ti-zii ma voloi a ɓena la,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:21">nii é ʋaazu ɠɛɛzu ga ti-lointi ti ʋoluʋelei, ta-vaa la mɔ naa zu.<verse eid="JOB 21:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 21:22"/>GALA ka nu a kala ga naama vaiti ɓaa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:22">GALAGI nii é geezuɠeelaiti tukpɔɠaaleʋezu?<verse eid="JOB 21:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 21:23"/>Nui tanigaa zɛbɛi ɠa yɛsu ti ʋa, ti za ziilɛigi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:23">ti yɛ gaanɛɛi zu, ziizoolɛ la ti ma.<verse eid="JOB 21:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 21:24"/>Ma nuiti ti-ɠɔlɔgi ti ma ga pagɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:24">ta-ɠaaɓaai pɛ ge ti zu.<verse eid="JOB 21:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 21:25"/>Taɠili ɓalaa ka za, ziizoolɛi ziimaʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:25">é la undaanɛɛi ɠɔɠɔni.<verse eid="JOB 21:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 21:26"/>Ti ɠilagilagi pɛ ti laani fufiligi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:26">koegi ma ɓulugi ɠa ʋɛɛzu ti ma mɛɛ.<verse eid="JOB 21:26"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 21:27"/>«Ungo, gè wa-ɠisiɛiti kwɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:27">naa ʋɛɛ kigaiziɛi ʋa wo bosu é lo bà, wo pèelalazu la.<verse eid="JOB 21:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 21:28"/>Wa gaazaɠasu ga: ‹Nu ʋaa nui ná-pɛlɛi ɠa mini?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:28">Faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nuiti ta-zeɠe ɠotai ɠa mini, ti ɠɛa bu?›<verse eid="JOB 21:28"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 21:29"/>«Wo la dɛ teʋe nuiti gaazaɠani ɓaa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:29">Wa ɠɛlɛzu naama vaiti ba, niiti ti ga ma zeeleiti?<verse eid="JOB 21:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 21:30"/>Siɛgi zu maanɔɠɔi ʋaazu la, toɠa ɗa ʋoola faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nui ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:30">GALA ná-ziiɠaawanai la vɔɔɠua ba.<verse eid="JOB 21:30"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 21:31"/>Ɓɛ ɠa a zelilo ma, é ʋilɛ ná-siɛ ʋelei ʋa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:31">Ɓɛ ɠa a sala, faa ɲɔi naa vaa zu nii é kɛɛni?<verse eid="JOB 21:31"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 21:32"/>Ti liini la kabamaʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:32">ti ɗa wɛlɛ ná-kabai ma.<verse eid="JOB 21:32"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 21:33"/>Ɛsɛ pɛ ge ʋilɛni ma ʋoomai ʋolu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:33">bɛbɛi nii gaa la luga, naa ɗa ziɛ kakalaʋɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:33">Nɛmɛi zu ʋɔlɔi la wuini kpusɛi ma.<verse eid="JOB 21:33"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 21:34"/>Leeni vaa zu wo gaanɛɛnɛ wafuungiti bosu ga ze?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:34">Mazɔlɔɔ, gaamazu nii é ɠulazu wa-wooɠaaʋotegiti su, naa ɠa nɔ ga zɛɛ vai.»<verse eid="JOB 21:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="JOB 22"/>
  <para style="s">Elifaze ná-kpɔɛzuɠulai zaʋasiɛi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 22:1"/>Teman nui Elifaze kpɔɛi lɔɔzeini, é ɠɛ ma:<verse eid="JOB 22:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 22:2"/>«Nui losu ɠa zoo nɛi é ɠɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:2">Ɠima nui ɠa botii ɠɛɛzu ɓɔɠɔ nɔ ʋɛ.<verse eid="JOB 22:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 22:3"/>Kɛlɛ Zɛbɛi-Pɛ-Maliɠii ná-kulanumai ɓɛgele ɠa é ɗa-lelebodai zu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:3">Leeni ɠa a sɔlɔɔ, ni è-ziɛ ʋelei a zɔlena?<verse eid="JOB 22:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 22:4"/>È laaʋɛ da, ga toɠa è maaɠolozu, é è lukpɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:4">tɔɔzei ɗa unmaayeizu ná-zobogi wu?<verse eid="JOB 22:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 22:5"/>È la ɓɔɠɔ ɠɛɛni ga sɔba nu tooma vaa mɔinmɔin su ɓaa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:5">Kwɛ ka nɛi ɗa-vaaɠaazagiti ba?<verse eid="JOB 22:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 22:6"/>È ɠɛni kpɔunmai ɠulazu è-zeiɲɔɠɔiti zea, un ge la ba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:6">È ɗa nuiti ta-zeɠeiti kula ti ma, eyɛsu è ti maaɲakai ʋilɛ.<verse eid="JOB 22:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 22:7"/>Nui kpɔɔle wɔin ma, è la ɠɛni ziɛ veeni naa ya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:7">Nui pului ɠɛni ma, è naa ɠomani ga daamianigi.<verse eid="JOB 22:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 22:8"/>È zooi lɔɔni tooma nui yeezu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:8">Nui nɛai è ʋɛ, naa nɔ ɠa è ɠɛni seizu ɓɛtɛzu.<verse eid="JOB 22:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 22:9"/>È ɠɛni yeeɓesu poanzaiti ba, ti li ga yeaɲaka.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:9">È ɠɛni podointi suvikɛi ɠulazu ti ya.<verse eid="JOB 22:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 22:10"/>Wɛlɛ, naa ɠa é ba, baliiti daai è maaɠoolizu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:10">gaamago nɔ, dualua golai è zogɛ.<verse eid="JOB 22:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 22:11"/>È la kpidii naati kaazu ɓaa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:11">ziɛi naati kpein ti è maaɓɔlesu?<verse eid="JOB 22:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 22:12"/>«GALA ge la geeɠɔlɔgi zu ɓaa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:12">Geezuʋɛ ʋɛtɛ, ná ɠaaɠoozaai, somideɠaiti ɲɛkpɛai ga!<verse eid="JOB 22:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 22:13"/>È woo ɠaaɓela ga: ‹GALA ka zoo nɛi é suɠwɛɛ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:13">Toɠa zoo nɛi, é ɓudɛ tonaɓiingi maazu, é tukpɔi ɠaaleʋe?<verse eid="JOB 22:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 22:14"/>Tonaɓiingiti gaaɠiligɛ gola GALA gaazu, é la ani nɔpɛ kaa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:14">siɛgi zu é ziɛzu la, é ɗa lati geeɠɔlɔgi ma.›<verse eid="JOB 22:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 22:15"/>«Ɗa pɔ è yɛ pele wɔlɔmai ʋolu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:15">nii telebotala nuiti ti ziɛni la?<verse eid="JOB 22:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 22:16"/>Ungo, ti leʋeni ga ma yeeluɠɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:16">eɠɛ siɠigi nii ziɛ ɓoigi yeizu la.<verse eid="JOB 22:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 22:17"/>Tɛi ti ɠɛni ɠɛɛzu GALA ma: ‹Maaɠooza gi ʋa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:17">Toɠa ga Zɛbɛi-Pɛ-Maliɠii, leeni ɠa a zoo é kɛ ga giye?›<verse eid="JOB 22:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 22:18"/>Anɛɛ naa ʋe, tɔ ɠa é ta-ʋɛlɛiti buulaaveni ga ani ʋagɔiti.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:18">Faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nuiti ta-lɛnɛ gooi maaɠoozani bà.<verse eid="JOB 22:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 22:19"/>Telebo nuiti ta ti-ɠoloɠolosuʋɛ ɠa, ti ɠoozunɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:19">Sɔbalala nuiti ta ɲɛɛɠula ti zu, ti ɠɛ ma:<verse eid="JOB 22:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 22:20"/>‹Ungo, ade zili nuiti pɛtɛ, ti ɠoloɠologa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:20">Nii dɔi ti zɛni, abui naati galani.›<verse eid="JOB 22:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 22:21"/>«À yɔɠɔzuɓɛtɛ wa GALA, ziilɛigi ɠaiziɛ wo yɔɠɔzu wa tɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:21">Ʋele ɠana undaanɛɛi a ɠaaɠale ma la è ma ʋolu.<verse eid="JOB 22:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 22:22"/>Kalagi zo tɔ ɓɔɠɔi bosu ga ɗe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:22">ɠizɛ daawooiti su.<verse eid="JOB 22:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 22:23"/>Ʋa ʋolu Zɛbɛi-Pɛ-Maliɠii ʋɔ, toɠa è zei ʋele ɓɛtɛ ʋolu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:23">telebotala vai kpein maaɠooza è-zeizuʋɛ ʋa.<verse eid="JOB 22:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 22:24"/>Zanugi é è ya, pili ya zooi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:24">ɓaa è zanu kitei yɛ kɔtuɗɛi ma ɠɔtui saama.<verse eid="JOB 22:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 22:25"/>Naazu Zɛbɛi-Pɛ-Maliɠii ɠa ɠɛ è ʋɛ ga zanugi, ta wali wola.<verse eid="JOB 22:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 22:26"/>Mazɔlɔɔ naazu, ɗa GALA Zɛbɛi-Pɛ-Maliɠii ná-fai ɠɛ ga è yiima vai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:26">ɗa ɠaazuʋɛ wuzeɠe, è to GALA ba ga ladalai.<verse eid="JOB 22:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 22:27"/>Ɗa wooɠula ma, toɠa è wooɠaaʋote,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:27">ta ɗa ɗa-minazeɠegiti daazeeli.<verse eid="JOB 22:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 22:28"/>Ni ɗa deve wona, naa laa ɠa zeeli è ʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:28">wozakalagi ɠa volo ɗa-ʋeleiti kpein su.<verse eid="JOB 22:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 22:29"/>Ni nui ta ɠa ná kpɔlɔai, ɗa buzeɠe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:29">Mazɔlɔɔ GALA ka ɗa ɓɔ naa ʋa, nii é ga ɓɔɠɔmaayei nui.<verse eid="JOB 22:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 22:30"/>Toɠa sɔba nui unmɔɔ ɓalaa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:30">È-yee ɲadegaiti saɓui zu ɠa zunui naa a ɠizo da.»<verse eid="JOB 22:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="JOB 23"/>
  <para style="s">Zɔɓe Elifaze wooɠaaʋote fai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 23:1"/>Zɔɓe gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma:<verse eid="JOB 23:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 23:2"/>«Za mɔnɔ nà-kpaazaɠa wooi ɠa ziiɠaawanai wuzeɠezu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:2">nà ɠaaɓaazu gè nà-kpee wooi zuzo.<verse eid="JOB 23:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 23:3"/>Ni nà la zoo gè kwɛɛ, ʋɛ nà GALA ka ná,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:3">nà la li, gè zeeli seizuʋɛ.<verse eid="JOB 23:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 23:4"/>Nà la nà-gaamai lɛɛ la,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:4">gè dàaʋɛ laave ga goozuɠulagi.<verse eid="JOB 23:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 23:5"/>Nà la ná-goozuɠulagiti kwɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:5">nà la kwɛɛ naazu nii é wɔinni é bo mà.<verse eid="JOB 23:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 23:6"/>Toɠa kpɔɛi ʋɛɛ bà, ga suvikɛi kpein ɓaa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:6">Ɓa, naa la ɠɛa! Kɛlɛ tɔun ka dama ga ze.<verse eid="JOB 23:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 23:7"/>Toɠa kwɛɛ ga zunu ʋe sɔlegai é woozuɠulasu tɔun bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:7">naazu, nà-tukpɔɠaaleʋe nui ɠa dɛɛ ga nà ga sɔbalala nu eyɛsu ɠɔ.<verse eid="JOB 23:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 23:8"/>Kɛlɛ nà liina folo ɠulazu ʋelei, é la miná.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:8">Ni nà liina folo liizu ʋelei, gè la kaazu ná.<verse eid="JOB 23:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 23:9"/>Ni nà gaiziɛna lɛkpɛmaʋɛ nu ɠɔʋɛzuʋɛ, gè la zooga pɛtɛsu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:9">Toɠa lɔɔɠuzu lɛkpɛmaʋɛ nu yeezazuʋɛ ɓaa? Gè la dɛ zooʋini ma pɛ!<verse eid="JOB 23:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 23:10"/>Anɛɛ naa ʋe, pelei nii gè ziɛzu la, é naa ɠwɛɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:10">Siɛgi zu é dɔ̀ɔzu la ʋoluɠulai zu, nà ɠula su ga ɲàdegai eɠɛ zanugi.<verse eid="JOB 23:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 23:11"/>Mazɔlɔɔ gè ziɛni siɛnɔpɛ su ga kɔɠɔ ʋogi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:11">Gè ziɛni ga ná-pelei nɔ, gè la zeɠeni ba pɛ.<verse eid="JOB 23:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 23:12"/>Gè la ɠɛlɛni ɠolozu ná-deveiti bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:12">Gè zìima vaiti zɛni ná, gè ɠolo daawooi ʋɛ.<verse eid="JOB 23:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 23:13"/>Kɛlɛ tɔun, siɛgi zu a devena la, ɓɛ ɠa a seɠe ma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:13">Nii kpein wɔinɗai la, toɠa ɗa naa ɠɛ.<verse eid="JOB 23:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 23:14"/>Ungo, devei é boga é ʋilɛ nɔ̀un ba, toɠa naa laazeeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:14">ta taɠiligaani ti kisu.<verse eid="JOB 23:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 23:15"/>Naa ɠa é ba, dàavegɛ ga dualuagi tɔun gaazu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:15">Nà ɠɛna ɠigaiziɛ su, nà ɗa nɔ wola lua.<verse eid="JOB 23:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 23:16"/>GALA ge ìɲɔteʋea,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:16">Zɛbɛi-Pɛ-Maliɠii dàavegɛ ga dualuagi.<verse eid="JOB 23:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 23:17"/>Mazɔlɔɔ kuai laade, é ʋa dɔ̀ maaɠɛkpɔgi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:17">ɓaa kpidii nii pɛai ma.»<verse eid="JOB 23:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="JOB 24"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 24:1"/>«Leeni vaa zu, Zɛbɛi-Pɛ-Maliɠii la yeeɠɛɠala leʋezu ba, é ʋa ná-tukpɔi ɠaaleʋe?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:1">Leeni vaa zu, niiti ti kwɛɛ, naati ti la naama voloiti kwɛɛ?<verse eid="JOB 24:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 24:2"/>Ta kwɛma ɠɔtuiti seɠezu ti-laazuʋɛti.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:2">Ta baala kpulugiti unmazu, ti ɗa ti lo.<verse eid="JOB 24:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 24:3"/>Ta podointi ta-zoovalegi zeɠezu ʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:3">ti poanzai ná-nikɛi zeɠe ga kpɔunmai.<verse eid="JOB 24:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 24:4"/>Ti ɗa bala nuiti kaka pelei ʋa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:4">Kɛni nɔ maanɔɠɔ nuiti ti zooi zu ti ɗa lɔɔɠu.<verse eid="JOB 24:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 24:5"/>Wɛlɛ, eɠɛ dɔɓɔ zoovalegiti ti ʋuuni teʋebai zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:5">maanɔɠɔ nuiti ta liizu sobuzobui boti ɠɛɛzuʋɛ, ti ɠɔnɔgi ɠaiziɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:5">Teʋebai zu nɔ ɠa daamianigi a zɔlɔɔ ná ti-lointi bɛ.<verse eid="JOB 24:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 24:6"/>Kɛni ti tufai leʋe ɓalaɠai zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:6">ti nu ɲɔi ná-leezɛn ɓelei ma waai ɠula.<verse eid="JOB 24:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 24:7"/>Ta laazu kpidii ga ti maaɲakai, seɠe la ti ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:7">pɛɛmazeɠe la ti ʋɛ ɲɛgɛlɛin kɔɔlɛi laalɔɠɔma.<verse eid="JOB 24:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 24:8"/>Gizeiti su lonai ti yɛɓɛni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:8">tɛi dɔɔɠuzu la ɠɛni ti ʋɛ, ti liɓini fasai ʋa.<verse eid="JOB 24:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 24:9"/>«Ti podoin volo dee ɠobu ga maaɓaai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:9">ti kpɔunmaiti kula maanɔɠɔ nuiti zea.<verse eid="JOB 24:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 24:10"/>«Ti ɗa li ga ti maaɲakai, seɠe la ti ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:10">Pului ti ma, ti ɗa molo ɠiliiti mɛɛn.<verse eid="JOB 24:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 24:11"/>Ti ɗa wolive wulɔi ɓɛtɛ nu ɠiligiti bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:11">ti ɗa dɔɔɓɔigi ɓɛtɛ, anɛɛ naa ʋe, kpɔɔle wɔin ɠa ti ma.<verse eid="JOB 24:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 24:12"/>«Nuiti ta kpalagi wosu taazuʋɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:12">Nuiti ti maawanaai, naati ta kpeei loozu, ti ɗa kpɔbai ɠaiziɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:12">Kɛlɛ GALA ge la daazu ma, é ʋa ɠidɔɔ kaka fai naa wu!<verse eid="JOB 24:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 24:13"/>«Foloi la nɛɛni faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nuiti bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:13">ti la ziɛ ga pelei suɠalagai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:13">ti la loga miná pɛ.<verse eid="JOB 24:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 24:14"/>Nu ʋaa nui ɠa ɗa wuzeɠe ga sobui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:14">é bala nui ʋaa ta maanɔɠɔ nui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:14">Kpidii é ɓɔɠɔ ɠɛ ga unma nui.<verse eid="JOB 24:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 24:15"/>Wɛɛnziɛ nui ɠaazuɠɛzɛi ɠa ɗa fitili pɛɛzuʋɛ maaʋɛɛnɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:15">é ɠɛ ma: ‹Nu nɔpɛ ge la kàazu,›</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:15">é ɠaazuʋɛ maalɔɔɠu ga seɠei.<verse eid="JOB 24:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 24:16"/>Kpidii ɠa unma nuiti ta ɗa pɛlɛiti baaɓota la,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:16">foloi, ti la, ti pɛlɛi laaɠulu ɓɔɠɔ ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:16">wozakalagi ma ɠisiɛ pa ge la ti ma.<verse eid="JOB 24:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 24:17"/>Nui niiti ta-voloi ɠa ɗa tɔɔzei ga kpidii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:17">ti ʋɔ ka kpidii ma maalua vai ʋa.<verse eid="JOB 24:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 24:18"/>«Kɛlɛ wɔun, wo vaa bu, ga faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nui ɠa veɠa ziɛi ɠa, é ɗa yei.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:18">Zooi é zea eteai zu, miná ɠa voovoo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:18">é la mɔ ziaa ga ná-leezɛn ɓelei ma ʋeleiti.<verse eid="JOB 24:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 24:19"/>Ʋelei foloi ma liegi a ɗa kɔɔlɛ vukɔi ma ɗɛi ɠaawuun da,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:19">zekana, kotoba nuiti ti ʋaazu ɲɛɛlɛzu la gɔvɛalaazu.<verse eid="JOB 24:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 24:20"/>Anzanui é gaazulaa etea ma, é kula su, naa ɠa yeema ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:20">koegiti ta ma ʋoomai ɠɛ ga laamiani pagɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:20">nu la mɔ ɠigaiziaa ná-faa zu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:20">Kotoi lɔɔ ɠa ɠula eɠɛ gulu wola.<verse eid="JOB 24:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 24:21"/>«Maalo anzanui, nii dounɠa ti la bɛ, ta naa zopele ɲɔuzu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:21">ti la ta-nuɓɔɠɔla ɠulazu kɛlɛma poanzaiti bɛ.<verse eid="JOB 24:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 24:22"/>Kɛlɛ zɛbɛi ɠa GALA ba ga é totuɠɔ nu ɲɔiti kpɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:22">Siɛgi zu GALA ge wuzeɠezu la,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:22">kito ge la mɔ naama nuiti bɛ ga ta yɛ vulua.<verse eid="JOB 24:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 24:23"/>GALA ka ɗa ti yɛ ná yeeta, ti ɓɔɠɔ ɠa ga ziilɛigi ɠa ti su,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:23">kɛlɛ gaazu ɠa ti-ziɛ ʋeleiti ba.<verse eid="JOB 24:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 24:24"/>Tiya ɠa yeeɠɛɠala go nɔ laawu, ti wuzeɠeni, naa ʋolu ti ɲɛɛlɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:24">Ti looni bu, eɠɛ nuɓusɛi kpein kɛʋele, wɛlɛ ti leʋea ga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:24">Ti leʋea ga, eɠɛ ani ɠɔpɔgi mɔai.<verse eid="JOB 24:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 24:25"/>Nii nɔ̀un gè bogai, toɠa ga ɠitei!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:25">Ɓɛ ɠa a zoo é kɛ̀ ga zɛɛ nu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:25">Ɓɛ ɠa a nà-kpɔɛzuɠulaiti ka ga wafuun faa?»<verse eid="JOB 24:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 24"/>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="JOB 25"/>
  <para style="s">Ɓilidade ná-kpɔɛzuɠulai zaʋasiɛi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 25:1"/>Suɠa nui Ɓilidade kpɔɛi zeɠeni, é ɠɛ ma:<verse eid="JOB 25:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 25:2"/>«Zobogi pɛ ka GALA zea, maayikiai.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 25:2">Toɠa ziilɛigi lɔɔzu geezuʋɛ, geeɠɔlɔgi zu.<verse eid="JOB 25:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 25:3"/>Ɓɛ ɠa a kɔɔʋɛbɛi liegɔi ɠaalu, nii é zeezu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 25:3">Ɓɛɛni ka ná-foloi la loozu ti ʋɛ?<verse eid="JOB 25:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 25:4"/>Nui ɠa lelebo ɠale GALA gaazu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 25:4">Nui nii sɔlɔɔgai anzanui ʋa, naa ɠa zoo ɲadesu ɠale?<verse eid="JOB 25:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 25:5"/>Ni GALA gaazu, alugi ma voloi ɠa tɔmɔzɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 25:5">somideɠaiti ti la ɲadeni,<verse eid="JOB 25:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 25:6"/>nuɓusɛi mu ka ga leeni kae, nii é nɔ ga kpeinɲaɠagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 25:6">nuɓusɛi ɓalaagi, é nɔ ga kpeinɲaɠa koi?»<verse eid="JOB 25:6"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 25"/>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="JOB 26"/>
  <para style="s">Zɔɓe Ɓilidade wooɠaaʋote fai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 26:1"/>Zɔɓe gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma:<verse eid="JOB 26:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 26:2"/>«Ee, è zoogɛ nɛi ɓɔsu naama nui ʋa, nii zɛbɛ la zea,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:2">ɗa ɓɔ naa ʋa nɛi, nii zeezu ɓɔlɔai!<verse eid="JOB 26:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 26:3"/>È zoogɛ naama nui lɛnɛsu ɓaa, nii balagai ɠimalai ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:3">ɗa ɠimalai ɠulanuma mɔinmɔingi lɛɛzu!<verse eid="JOB 26:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 26:4"/>Kɛlɛ ɓɛ ɠa ɗa-ɓɔɛiti ti wosu ma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:4">È ɓɔɛ wooi naati sɔlɔɔgɛ ɓɛ ya?<verse eid="JOB 26:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 26:5"/>Gɔvɛiti kpein ta ɓalizu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:5">kpoloɗɛiti bu munu ta fuluaniiti ti ʋuuni ná,<verse eid="JOB 26:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 26:6"/>mazɔlɔɔ gɔvɛalaazu ɠalagɛ GALA gaazu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:6">kwɛpele seɠe zuɠooza ge la zooga zɛlɛsu ma undaaʋili zeɠezaɠai ɠaazu luɠɔ, é ʋa maalɔɔɠu.<verse eid="JOB 26:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 26:7"/>GALA ge lɛkpɛmaʋɛ nu ɠɔʋɛzuʋɛ ma ɠeeɠɔlɔgi zuviegɛ ada zu ɲakai maazu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:7">É eteai zɛlɛgɛ ada ɲakai maazu.<verse eid="JOB 26:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 26:8"/>É ziɛiti gaalɛɛʋɛ ba tonaɓiin gaaɠiligiti su,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:8">tonaɓiingi la ɗa ga ɓotaga ti-wuɲɛgi wu.<verse eid="JOB 26:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 26:9"/>Toɠa ná-masa kpɔkpɔgi ɠaazu maalɔɔɠuzu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:9">é ná-tonaɓiingi ʋɛɛ gaazu.<verse eid="JOB 26:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 26:10"/>É kwɛpelemaʋɛ laaʋɛ ziɛi ɠa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:10">wozakalagi ta kuai ti yɔɠɔzu.<verse eid="JOB 26:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 26:11"/>GALA ga zelii lona,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:11">geeɠɔlɔgi ma lɔkpalaiti ta ɗa ɓali, ti laavɔ.<verse eid="JOB 26:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 26:12"/>GALA ná-zɛbɛi vɔniga kpoloɗɛi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:12">ta ná-keleɠelegi maaʋele ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:12">é vɔniga ziɛ wu zua ɲɔi Laɠaɓe ma.<verse eid="JOB 26:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 26:13"/>Sokpa zu viilɛi ɠa geeɠɔlɔgi ɠaaɓalesu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:13">zeei kaalii ɓota, nii é ʋelazu.<verse eid="JOB 26:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 26:14"/>Anɛɛ naa ʋe, ma go nɔ ɠana ná-botiiti saama, é ti ɠɛɛzu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:14">ti-lugi ta go nɔ ade mɛnisu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:14">Ɓɛ ɠa a zoo é ná-faa wolaiti tugi ɠaaɠa?»<verse eid="JOB 26:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 26"/>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="JOB 27"/>
  <para style="s">Zɔɓe ná-gooɠaaʋote gaaɓelagiti é ti veeni bɔɔla saʋagɔiti zea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 27:1"/>Zɔɓe ɓɔɠɔ liini ga luɠɔ ná-kpɔɛzuɠulai zu, é ɠɛ ma:<verse eid="JOB 27:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 27:2"/>«Gè ɠonaa Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ma, nii é vulua,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:2">tɔungi é ɠɛlɛzu ga é mina nà-gaamai ɠula kɛlɛma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:2">Zɛbɛi-Pɛ-Maliɠii, é zìi ɠoloɠologai,<verse eid="JOB 27:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 27:3"/>ni nɔ dɛ zɛnvui ɠa dɛ sù,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:3">GALA ná-zɛnvu viilɛi ɠɛ nɔ dɛ sòkpayeɠeiti su,<verse eid="JOB 27:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 27:4"/>dàkɔlɔgiti ti la telebotala vaa woga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:4">nɛ̀gi la zɛɛ ɓɔɛ woga.<verse eid="JOB 27:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 27:5"/>Naama ɠisiɛi maaɠooza bà, gè ʋa ɠɛ wo ma, gaama ɠa wo ya!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:5">Eyɛsu zìi loo, gè la zeɠea nà-sɔle fai ʋolu.<verse eid="JOB 27:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 27:6"/>Gè sogɛ kpaan ga sìɛ ʋelei zɔlegɛ, gè la yeeɠulaa naa wu pɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:6">Mazɔlɔɔ zìi la kpɔ̀lɔzu, é ʋilɛ nà-eteai ziɛ ʋelei ʋa.<verse eid="JOB 27:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 27:7"/>«Nii maanɛai é la faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nui ma, naa la sìli nui ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:7">Niiti ti laalɛɛzu bù, nii soloogai nu ɲɔiti ma, naa la naati ma.<verse eid="JOB 27:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 27:8"/>Lee ɠito ka a ɠɛ nu ɲɔi ʋɛ, siɛgi zu é leʋezu la ga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:8">GALA ga zɛnvui zeɠena?<verse eid="JOB 27:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 27:9"/>GALA ka woilosu nɛi ná-kpee wooi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:9">siɛgi zu kidaaʋiligi ʋaazu la, é zeeli ma?<verse eid="JOB 27:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 27:10"/>Toɠa zoo nɛi é Zɛbɛi-Pɛ-Maliɠii ɠɛ ga ná-ziilɛigi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:10">Toɠa yɛ nɛi GALA faliiti daazeelizu ma yeenɔpɛ?<verse eid="JOB 27:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 27:11"/>«Nà wo ɠalasu ga wo GALA ná-zɛbɛi ɠwɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:11">gè la Zɛbɛi-Pɛ-Maliɠii ná-faa ɓɛtɛaiti dɔɔɠuzu wo ʋa.<verse eid="JOB 27:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 27:12"/>Kɛlɛ wo pɛ, wo kaaʋɛ niina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:12">lee vaa zu deɠɛmu, wo ɓesu ɓɔɠɔ ʋa, wo ɗa ʋilɛ faa ɲakai ʋolu?<verse eid="JOB 27:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 27:13"/>Wɛlɛ, naa ɠa GALA ge makɛgai faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nui luɠɔ, é sɔlɔɔsu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:13">naa ɠa é ga sili masagi zɔlɔɔgi Zɛbɛi-Pɛ-Maliɠii ya.<verse eid="JOB 27:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 27:14"/>Ni a dounɠa zɔlɔɔna, ti wola mɔin, ta ɠɛ boɠa zɔkpɔi laawu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:14">dounlointi ta ɠɛ pului laawu yeenɔpɛ.<verse eid="JOB 27:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 27:15"/>Niiti ta yɛ vulua, ɗɔfɔ zeeɓɛi ɠa li ga naati,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:15">ta-ʋoanzaiti ti la zooga ti ʋa ta-zaa wɔlɔi wo.<verse eid="JOB 27:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 27:16"/>Ni ta naavoloi ɠaalɛɛna ba eɠɛ fufiligi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:16">ni ta seɠeiti gaalɛɛna ba eɠɛ palaʋalai,<verse eid="JOB 27:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 27:17"/>é ti ɠaalɛ ba deɠɛmu, telebo nui ɠa a ɓɔɠɔ maaɠili ga tiye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:17">ná-waliiti gaa ɠa ɠwɛ sɔle nuiti ba.<verse eid="JOB 27:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 27:18"/>«Pɛlɛi é togai ma yɛɠɛlɛ nɔ ʋe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:18">ada makɛ nu ɠota logai nɔ ɠa é kɛai.<verse eid="JOB 27:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 27:19"/>Toɠa laazu ná-kpɛtɛi zaama, ma ɠaaɓelagi ɠana ná.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:19">Siɛgi zu é ɠaazuzeɠezu ma la, é la mɔ ani nɔpɛ kaa.<verse eid="JOB 27:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 27:20"/>Kidaaʋiligi ɠa maaɓɔle, eɠɛ ziɛ wolai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:20">tɔngɔlɔ fiilɛi ɠa seɠe kua zaamai.<verse eid="JOB 27:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 27:21"/>Folo ɠulazu ʋele viilɛi ɠa seɠe, é lii la,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:21">toɠa tɔɔɠula ga zeeɠaaɓaai, é kula ʋɛ é ná.<verse eid="JOB 27:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 27:22"/>Ta mɛɛinti pilisu daalɔɠɔma, ti la maawɔinɠaazu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:22">Kɛni é ɓizɛ, é ʋa ɠula ti ya.<verse eid="JOB 27:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 27:23"/>Ti ɗa yealoɠa ma, tɔɔzei é ɠoloɠologa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:23">ti ɗa ɲɛɛɠula su, seizuʋɛ ɓɔɠɔi.»<verse eid="JOB 27:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 27"/>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="JOB 28"/>
  <para style="s">Ɓɛ ɠa a zoo é ɠimalai zɔlɔɔ?</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 28:1"/>Adaʋɛti ta náʋɛ, ta ɗa walii ɠula ná,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:1">adaʋɛ tanigaa ta ná, ta ɗa zanugi gba ná.<verse eid="JOB 28:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 28:2"/>Kɔlui ɠa ɗa ɠula fufiligi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:2">kɔtui ɠaawuungai ɠa kɔlu ɓɔigi a ɗa ɠula su.<verse eid="JOB 28:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 28:3"/>Zanu kula nuiti ta ɗa zeɠei wɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:3">ti yei zooi wu, wozakalagi lɔ ná,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:3">ti kɔtuiti kula niiti ti lɔɔɠuai kpidii zu, kpidi ɓɔii zu.<verse eid="JOB 28:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 28:4"/>Ta ɗa zeɠei wɔ zooi wu, maaɠooza nuiti seizuʋɛ ʋa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:4">Ʋɛ nu ɠɔɠɔlosu nɔpɛ ge la ná, zanu kula nuiti ti ɗa ɲiikpi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:4">Ti zɛlɛni ada ɲakai maazu, ti maaɠoozaai zɔɔma nuɓusɛiti ba.<verse eid="JOB 28:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 28:5"/>Zooi nii daamianigi zɔlɔɔsu ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:5">naa ɠa valibosu kpomaʋɛti eɠɛ abui.<verse eid="JOB 28:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 28:6"/>Ná-kɔtuiti ta miná ʋɛ, kɔtu zɔngɔ ɓaagi daa ga safiil,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:6">naa zɔlɔɔsu ná, ta zanu fukɔi.<verse eid="JOB 28:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 28:7"/>Seeʋei la naama ʋelei ɠwɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:7">sizigoi ɠaazuɠɛzɛi la dɛ ná ɠaani.<verse eid="JOB 28:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 28:8"/>Suai nii kpein daai ɓɔɠɔ la,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:8">naa tanɔpɛ ge la dɛ ziɛni ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:8">zalai la ɗa ga ziɛ ná.<verse eid="JOB 28:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 28:9"/>Nui ɠa zoosu é laalɛ fasa ɠɔtuiti golo vai wu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:9">é gizeiti kpusɛ eyɛsu ti zeeli ti ma wuulaagiti ma.<verse eid="JOB 28:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 28:10"/>Toɠa fasa ɠɔtui zuwɔɔzu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:10">gaazuɠɛzɛi ɠa zoo é ani ʋagɔi kpein ka su.<verse eid="JOB 28:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 28:11"/>Toɠa ziɛi luɠɔlo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:11">naavoloiti ti lɔɔɠuai, é naati kula kɛlɛma.<verse eid="JOB 28:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 28:12"/>Kɛlɛ, nii é ga ɠimalai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:12">mini ɠa nu a zoo é ka ná?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:12">Mini ɠa keleɠelegi zeini ná?<verse eid="JOB 28:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 28:13"/>Nui la sɔngɔi liegi ɠwɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:13">nu la ka fulu nuiti ta-yooi ɠa.<verse eid="JOB 28:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 28:14"/>Palii ɓomaʋɛ ɠɛ ma: «É la sù.»</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:14">Kpoloɗɛi ɠɛ ma: «É la pɔ̀ bɛ.»<verse eid="JOB 28:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 28:15"/>È la zooga è ʋa zanu kitei ve potogi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:15">ɓaa mu, è walii ɠɔɠɔ kiloi ɠa è ʋa geya la.<verse eid="JOB 28:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 28:16"/>É la ʋokɔɠɔga zanugi ma, nii é ga Wofiil gelei,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:16">ɓaa kɔtu zɔngɔ ɓaagi nii é ga wonikese, ɓaa safiil gelei.<verse eid="JOB 28:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 28:17"/>È la zooga è ʋa zanugi ɓaa sanugi ti pokɔɠɔ ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:17">È la zooga è ʋa aniɲakai maavalibo da, nii é ga zanu kitei.<verse eid="JOB 28:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 28:18"/>Anɛɛ nu la kpɔzɔi ta sanu ʋɛɛlɛi ti ta-vaa woni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:18">Ɠimalai zɔlɔɔ fai vizɔgɛ kɔtu zɔngɔ ɓaagi ʋa é ga pɛɛlegi.<verse eid="JOB 28:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 28:19"/>Kɔtu zɔngɔ ɓaagi é ga Etiyopi gelei, naa la ʋokɔɠɔga sɔngɔi ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:19">Zanu kitei la ʋokɔɠɔga sɔngɔi ma.<verse eid="JOB 28:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 28:20"/>Mini ɠa ɠimalai zeɠezu ná?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:20">Mini ɠa keleɠelegi zeini ná?<verse eid="JOB 28:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 28:21"/>Dɔɔɠuʋɛ nu vului kpein ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:21">dɔɔɠuʋɛ wɔniiti ba.<verse eid="JOB 28:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 28:22"/>Undaaʋili zeɠezaɠai ta saai ta ɠɛɛzu ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:22">«Gi ná-fai mɛnigɛ nɔ, é ɗa wo.»<verse eid="JOB 28:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 28:23"/>Mazɔlɔɔ GALA gila kpe ka é pelei ɠwɛɛ, nii é liizu pɔ bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:23">Ungo, GALA ka é seizuʋɛ ɠwɛɛ.<verse eid="JOB 28:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 28:24"/>Mazɔlɔɔ ná-wozaɠaai ɠa zeelizu eteai zu ná pɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:24">Nii kpein é ɠɛɛzu geeɠɔlɔgi wu, toɠa kaazu.<verse eid="JOB 28:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 28:25"/>Siɛgi zu é fiilɛi wuɲɛgi ɠɔɠɔni da,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:25">é kpoloɗɛiti kɔɠɔ,<verse eid="JOB 28:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 28:26"/>é tonai ná-fai zeikpasu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:26">é pelei ve mainmain ya, ta tona kpunɛ tugi,<verse eid="JOB 28:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 28:27"/>názu ɠa é ɠimalai ɠaani la, é kula kɛlɛma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:27">É ɠimalai ma wuulaagi laani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:27">é sumɔ, é fɛɠɛlɛfɛɠɛlɛ.<verse eid="JOB 28:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 28:28"/>Naa ʋolu, é ɠɛ nui ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:28">«Lua Maliɠii ʋa, è dɛbi, naa ɠa é ga ɠimala ɠitei!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:28">È ʋoluave faa ɲɔi ʋa, naa ɠa é ga keleɠelegi!»<verse eid="JOB 28:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 28"/>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="JOB 29"/>
  <para style="s">Zɔɓe ná-kpɔɛzuɠula ɠaaɓelagiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 29:1"/>Zɔɓe ɓɔɠɔ liini ga luɠɔ ná-kpɔɛzuɠulai zu, é ɠɛ ma:<verse eid="JOB 29:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 29:2"/>«Ee, wɔ̀inʋɛ ga gè ɓɔɠɔ ɠa nà-kɛʋele wɔlɔmai zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:2">siɛgi zu GALA ge ɠɛni ɓaazu la màazu, gè ɗa nà-eteai ziɛ,<verse eid="JOB 29:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 29:3"/>siɛgi zu ná-sɔmɔgi ɠɛni volozu la màazu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:3">ná-wozakalagi ɠɛni ɓɔsu bà, gè ɗa kpidii zuziɛ,<verse eid="JOB 29:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 29:4"/>eɠɛʋelei gè ɠɛni la mɔungi sɛ̀bɛi pɛ gaavɔnigai sù,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:4">siɛgi zu GALA ge ɠɛni la ga nà-pɛlɛyeɠei nɛɛɲɔɠɔi,<verse eid="JOB 29:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 29:5"/>siɛgi zu Zɛbɛi-Pɛ-Maliɠii ɠɛni bà la dɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:5">Naama ziɛgi zu, dòun zunuiti pɛ ti ɠɛni ɠɛɛzu màaɠoolii zu.<verse eid="JOB 29:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 29:6"/>Naama ziɛgi zu, gè ɠɛni lasesu undaanɛɛi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:6">gulɔ ɓoigi ɠɛni yeizu nà-gulɔ ɓɛtɛzuʋɛ.<verse eid="JOB 29:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 29:7"/>«Nà la ɠɛna ɠulaa, gè ʋa li taa ziɠidaʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:7">siɛgi zu gè ɠɛni liizu la, gè seizuʋɛ ɓɛtɛ maaɓɔ bosuʋɛ,<verse eid="JOB 29:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 29:8"/>nu niinɛiti ta la kàana, ti ɓena ʋoluazo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:8">kɛwola wɔlɔiti ti wuzeɠe, ti lo.<verse eid="JOB 29:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 29:9"/>Kundiɠiiti ti ɓena kpɔɛzuɠulai yɛ ná,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:9">ti yeeʋɛɛ la, ti maaɠɛ kpɔ.<verse eid="JOB 29:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 29:10"/>Nu wolaiti ti ɠɛni maaɠɛsu kpɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:10">ti-nɛgi ɠata ti-laaɠoozuʋɛ ʋa.<verse eid="JOB 29:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 29:11"/>«Zɔi a la gòoi mɛnina, naa ɠɛni ɠɛɛzu mà, undaanɛ nui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:11">Zɔi a la kàana, naa ɓena li, é nà-faa ʋagɔi wo.<verse eid="JOB 29:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 29:12"/>Gè ɠɛni maanɔɠɔ nuiti kulazu, niiti ti ɠɛni kpɔbai ɠaiziɛzu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:12">ta podoin ɓalaa, nii é la ɠɛni kpɔba zɔlɔɔsu.<verse eid="JOB 29:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 29:13"/>Niiti ta la ɠɛ saa yeɠei la, naati ti ɠɛni tuya loozu bɛ̀.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:13">Gè ɠɛni poanzaiti koozunɛɛzu.<verse eid="JOB 29:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 29:14"/>Telebodai ɠa é ɠɛni kɔ̀ba ga seɠei,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:14">faa zɔle fai ɠɛ kɔ̀ba ga seɠeungi, ta bɔɔlɔgi ùnba.<verse eid="JOB 29:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 29:15"/>Gè ɠɛni ga gaazuɠole nuiti gaazuɠɛzɛi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:15">ta kɔɠɔ ɠoloɠolo nuiti kɔɠɔi.<verse eid="JOB 29:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 29:16"/>Gè ɠɛni ga bala nuiti ti-ɠɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:16">gè ɠɛni wɛɛinti maavaiti gaaɠulazu ba.<verse eid="JOB 29:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 29:17"/>Gè ɠɛni nu ɲɔi ɓalɔɠaeiti galeɠalezu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:17">gè daamianigi ɠula ɲiigaiti ga.<verse eid="JOB 29:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 29:18"/>«Gè ɠɛni ɠɛɛzu ma naazu:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:18">‹Nà zaazu mà laɠagi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:18">sìi ma voloi ɠa mɔinzu eɠɛ ɲaɠaegi.<verse eid="JOB 29:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 29:19"/>Gè ɠɛa eɠɛ gulu wolai, kɔɠɔi ziɛi wu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:19">kpidii nɔɗagi ɠa yeizu, é ɗa ʋu mà ɓekegiti ga.<verse eid="JOB 29:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 29:20"/>Nà tɔɠɔɠula niinɛ zɔlɔɔ ʋolu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:20">ta zɛbɛ niinɛi, eɠɛ mɛɛin maalegai.›<verse eid="JOB 29:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 29:21"/>«Naama ziɛgi zu, ti ɠɛni wòilosu, ti ɗa maaɓɔun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:21">ti ɗa maaɠɛ kpɔ, ga ti woilo nà-tɛnɛ gooiti ma.<verse eid="JOB 29:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 29:22"/>Nà la ɓena ga ɓɔɛ, nu la ɠɛni maaɠaalia,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:22">dàawooi ɠɛni ʋilɛsu ti pɛ ma, pein, pein.<verse eid="JOB 29:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 29:23"/>Ti ɠɛni màaɓɔunsu, eɠɛʋelei nu a ɗa tonai maaɓɔun da.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:23">Ti-ɠigi loni bà, eɠɛʋelei a ɗa ɠɛ la foɠo lonai ʋa.<verse eid="JOB 29:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 29:24"/>Gè ɠɛni ɲɛɛzu ti ʋɔ, kɛlɛ ti la ɠɛni laani da,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:24">gàazuʋɛ ná ɠɛni volozu, ti la ɓena zoo ti ʋa naama voloi ɠaaʋa.<verse eid="JOB 29:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 29:25"/>Gè ɠɛni ti untuɠɔ, gè ɗa pelei lɛ ga tiye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:25">gè ɠɛ ti zaama eɠɛ masagi nii é ná-salaʋusu ɓulugiti saama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:25">eɠɛ nui nii é iɲɔteʋe nuiti gaanɛɛnɛzu.»<verse eid="JOB 29:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 29"/>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="JOB 30"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 30:1"/>«Kɛlɛ ee, za, wɛlɛ nà ʋa, gè ɠɛa ga ɲɛɛɠulasu anii nu niinɛiti zea,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:1">niiti gè ti-ɠɛɛni wɔinzeɠeni, gè la ɓena zoo gè ʋa ti ɓɔ nà-gilɛiti ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:1">ti ʋa ɠɛ ga nà-togani ɓulugi makɛ nua.<verse eid="JOB 30:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 30:2"/>Leeni ɠa ti-yeei ná-zɛbɛi a kɛ bɛ̀?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:2">Ti-zɛbɛi ɲɛɛlɛni.<verse eid="JOB 30:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 30:3"/>Ti-zuvikɛi ɠulaʋɛ ti ya, baladai ta pului ʋɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:3">Ta ani ɠaiziɛzu teʋebai zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:3">ʋɛ kaite ná ɠoloɠologai, ná ɠaaʋala ba.<verse eid="JOB 30:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 30:4"/>Ta tufa ɲɔiti tɔɔɠulazu, kpɔvɔ goiti saamaʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:4">ti-laamianigi ɠa nɔ ga gului daa ga zenɛ, naa ma zapei.<verse eid="JOB 30:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 30:5"/>«Ti ti ɓɛ nuɓusɛiti saama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:5">ti ɗa ɓain ti ma, eɠɛ ta ɠɛ unma nu ʋolu.<verse eid="JOB 30:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 30:6"/>Ti ɗa zeizu ɠaiziɛ pɛtu zeɠeiti su,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:6">ta zeɠeiti su, ti wɔai zooi ʋa, ta fasa yeɠeiti.<verse eid="JOB 30:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 30:7"/>Ti ʋu ɓɔɠɔ ma, ti lɔɔɠu ɠaingiti bu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:7">ta-ɓee wooi ɗa ɠula, kpɔvɔ goiti saamaʋɛ.<verse eid="JOB 30:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 30:8"/>Ɠimalala nuiti, nuiti daasei ge la ti ʋa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:8">Ti ɓɛai, ti ɠula zooi ʋa.<verse eid="JOB 30:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 30:9"/>«Wɛlɛ, niizu ti dàalɔa guye zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:9">gè ɠɛa ti-laa ga faalaalii.<verse eid="JOB 30:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 30:10"/>Wɔ̀inzeɠeʋɛ ti ma, ti ɗa maaɠooza bà,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:10">ti la inɛinɛsu ga ti-laaɗɛi ʋuu vai gàazuʋɛ.<verse eid="JOB 30:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 30:11"/>É zo niizu ma, GALA ge gàalɛɠɛga, é ùnfe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:11">ti la mɔ daazu ma kpɛ ga nà-faa.<verse eid="JOB 30:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 30:12"/>Maawɔin nui niiti ta wuzeɠezu zèezazuʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:12">naati ta pɔ ga ti kɔ̀ɠɔyɛʋɛ bù.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:12">Ti ɗa maanɔɠɔ ʋeleiti to bà.<verse eid="JOB 30:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 30:13"/>Ta nà ɓɔɠɔi nà-peleiti teʋezu tùɠɔ, ti ùndaaʋili botii ɠɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:13">tɛiti nu nɔpɛ ge la ɠɛni ɓɔsu ti ʋa.<verse eid="JOB 30:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 30:14"/>Ta zeelizu mà ga zeɠe wolai laa ʋelei,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:14">ta ɠaazuvilɛzu, ti lɔ ani ɠoloɠologaiti bu.<verse eid="JOB 30:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 30:15"/>Maalua vai ma zii pɛ ka seeliai mà,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:15">gàazu unfegi ɲɛɛlɛa eɠɛ fiilɛi lugi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:15">Nà-undaanɛɛi leʋega eɠɛ tonaɓiingi é ɓizɛzu.<verse eid="JOB 30:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 30:16"/>«Niizu, zɛ̀nvui ɠa na ɠula zèa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:16">Mazɔlɔɔ kpɔlɔi ma voloiti ti zeelia nà ɓɔɠɔi ma.<verse eid="JOB 30:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 30:17"/>Kpidii ɠa mà ɠaeiti bɔɔzu dùɠuzuʋɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:17">Taɓai nii é mìizu, naa la ɓɔlɔzu.<verse eid="JOB 30:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 30:18"/>É nà-seɠei zogɛ ga maaɓaai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:18">é ɗa kpàkpa eɠɛ seɠei nii kɔgizu lɔiɗɛi.<verse eid="JOB 30:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 30:19"/>GALA ge pìlini ya palaʋalai zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:19">gè ɠulaa ga fufiligi ta zuʋui.<verse eid="JOB 30:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 30:20"/>«GALAGI, gè è lolini ga è ɓɔ bà, è la gòoɠaaʋoteni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:20">Gè loga è ɠaazu, è ɗa wɛlɛ bà nɔ.<verse eid="JOB 30:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 30:21"/>Kɛlɛ ɗa-vai ɓaa nɔ̀un tetema!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:21">È laalɛa bù ga è-yeei zuɲɛgi pɛ.<verse eid="JOB 30:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 30:22"/>È fiilɛi ɠɛa ga sooi, è li ga ze kɔma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:22">Fiilɛ wolai ɲìikpiga mini-o-mini.<verse eid="JOB 30:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 30:23"/>Mazɔlɔɔ gè kwɛɛ ga pagɔ ga ɗa liizu ga ze saai ʋɔ bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:23">ʋɛ ná ɓɛtɛai ga fuluaniiti kpein koinsuʋɛ.<verse eid="JOB 30:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 30:24"/>Kɛlɛ zɔi undaaʋilisu, é la ɗa ga yeelɛa ɓaa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:24">Zɔi é faaɓaagi laawu, é la ɗa ga kpeei loa ɓaa?<verse eid="JOB 30:24"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 30:25"/>«Anɛɛ naa ʋe, mɔungi zu, gè la ɠɛni wɔlɔni naati bɛ ɓaa, niiti eteai ɓaani ti ma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:25">Zìi la ɠɛni kpɔlɔzu ɓaa, nà la bala nui ɠaana kpɔlɔi zu?<verse eid="JOB 30:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 30:26"/>Mazɔlɔɔ kìgi ɠɛni undaanɛɛi ʋa, maanɔɠɔi ɠa paai.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:26">Gè ɠɛni wozakalagi maaɓɔunsu, kpidii ɠa paai.<verse eid="JOB 30:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 30:27"/>Sàsu ɠa ɓalizu nɔ ɠɔ, kwɛ ge la ba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:27">Kpɔlɔi ma voloiti ti ʋaa, ti zeeli mà.<verse eid="JOB 30:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 30:28"/>Nà ziɛzu gɔlɔɗɛi zu, gè la ɠaazu laazu foloi ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:28">Nà wuzeɠezu kpɔgi zu, gè kpeei loo.<verse eid="JOB 30:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 30:29"/>Gè ɠɛa ga koʋeiti ti-ɠɛɛloin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:29">ta saa wɔnigiti siɛpoluɲɔɠɔi.<verse eid="JOB 30:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 30:30"/>Kɔ̀lɔgi lɛiɗa mà tiintiin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:30">kàeiti ti ɗa ɠala ga kɔɔlɛɓadii.<verse eid="JOB 30:30"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 30:31"/>Nà-kɔnigi ɠa zeizu gɔlɔ wo nuiti gooi wu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:31">nà-koolei ɓalaa ɠa gɔlɔ wo nuiti gooi loozu ma.»<verse eid="JOB 30:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 30"/>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="JOB 31"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 31:1"/>«Gè tɔgi zeini gàazuʋɛ ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:1">ga é mina gaazuɠulapɔ wɛlɛ wo anzalopo ʋa.<verse eid="JOB 31:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 31:2"/>Ni naa laade, leeni ɠa nà la sɔlɔɔ faa maaɓɔun</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:2">GALA Zɛbɛi-Pɛ-Maliɠii ya, nii é geezuʋɛ?<verse eid="JOB 31:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 31:3"/>Tɔɔzei maanɔɠɔi la makɛni telebotala nuiti bɛ ɓaa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:3">ta nimizai naati bɛ, niiti ti faa ɲɔi ɠɛɛzu?<verse eid="JOB 31:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 31:4"/>GALA ge la sìɛ ʋelei ʋɛtɛsu nɛi ɓaa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:4">É la kɔ̀ɠɔlo daa ɠilagilagi pɛ gaalusu ɓaa?<verse eid="JOB 31:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 31:5"/>«Zɛɛi ɠa nɛi gè ɠɛa ziɛzu su?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:5">Kɔ̀ɠɔ zu ɠɛa vilɛzu ga gè li kakama vaa ɠɛɛzuʋɛ?<verse eid="JOB 31:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 31:6"/>GALA ge kɔ̀ɠɔ telebo kilo ɠa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:6">é ɠɛ nà-sɔledai ɠwɛɛ!<verse eid="JOB 31:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 31:7"/>Ni kɔ̀ɠɔi zeɠeni pele ʋagɔi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:7">ni zìi ʋilɛni nà-gaazuɠulapɔ vaiti polu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:7">ni zèeiti kɔzɔʋɛ ga kɛɛwoti ɲɔi ta,<verse eid="JOB 31:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 31:8"/>naazu nii gè fazasu, taɠili ge naa mi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:8">niiti gè ti ziinni, taɠili ge naati tɔɔɠula.<verse eid="JOB 31:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 31:9"/>Ni gè looni anzanu lɛga zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:9">gè li, gè ɗa maaʋɛɛnɛ seiɲɔɠɔi ná-pɛlɛlaʋɛ,<verse eid="JOB 31:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 31:10"/>naazu ànzai boti ɠɛ nu ɠili bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:10">nuiti ti-yiimai ɠɛ su!<verse eid="JOB 31:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 31:11"/>Mazɔlɔɔ maaɓoo vaa ɠana, ɲamaba vaa ɠana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:11">nii tukpɔɠaaleʋe nuiti ta ɗa ma lukpɔi ɠaaleʋe.<verse eid="JOB 31:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 31:12"/>Nà-faaɠaazagi a la ɠɛ ga abui, a la gàla, eyɛsu é kòloɠolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:12">é naa kpein koloɠolo, nii gè sɔlɔɔni.<verse eid="JOB 31:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 31:13"/>«Nà-botiɠɛ zunui ta, ɓaa nà-botiɠɛ anzanui ta, a la ɓaazaɠana mà,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:13">gè ɓena gaaɠula ba, gè maalobo.<verse eid="JOB 31:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 31:14"/>Ni naa laade, leeni ɠa nà kɛ, siɛgi zu GALA ge wuzeɠezu la ga é tùkpɔ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:14">Gè la zooga gè ʋa gooɠaaʋote, ni a ɠɛna gè ʋoluvaawo ma.<verse eid="JOB 31:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 31:15"/>Zɔi é kpɛ̀tɛai dèe ɠoozu, tɔun taade é ʋa ti ɓɛtɛ ɓalaa ɓaa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:15">Ungo, ma GALAGI ɓɔɠɔi nɔ ɠa é gi kpein kpɛtɛni gi-lee ɠoozu.<verse eid="JOB 31:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 31:16"/>«Yeelɛ ɠa gè ɠɛlɛni la maawɔin nui ná-kpɔba vaa ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:16">ɓaa gè poanzai yɛ ná-kitotalai zu?<verse eid="JOB 31:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 31:17"/>Anɠɛ nɛi nà ɠila ka gè ɠɛni nà-daamianigi miizu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:17">podoin la ta miini?<verse eid="JOB 31:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 31:18"/>Tɔun é zo mà loungo ziɛgi zu ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:18">bɔɔlɔʋɛ zèa, eɠɛ ɠɛɛɠɛi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:18">Siɛgi kpein su gè ɠɛni poanzai lɛnɛ nui.<verse eid="JOB 31:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 31:19"/>Kaipa gè maawɔin nu ɠaa ʋɛ, gè zɛ seɠe ʋalagi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:19">ta bala nui gè naa yɛ pɛɛmazeɠe ʋalagi zu?<verse eid="JOB 31:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 31:20"/>Ɓa-o, tɔun ti ɠɛni tuya loozu bɛ̀,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:20">tɔɔzei gè ɠɛni seɠei veezu ti ya nii su ɓadiai, kpɛtɛai ga nà-baalagiti maaleɠai.<verse eid="JOB 31:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 31:21"/>Ni nà ɠɛna podoun maaluani tukpɔɠaaleʋezuʋɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:21">tɔɔzei gè kwɛɛ ga tukpɔɠaaleʋe nuiti ta ga nà-poluzeigiti,<verse eid="JOB 31:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 31:22"/>kpàkigi ɠula pòluzaamaʋɛ ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:22">ta zèei ɠula zeeɓoɓolaʋɛ ʋa, é ɠaleɠale!<verse eid="JOB 31:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 31:23"/>Mazɔlɔɔ nà luazu maanɔɠɔi ʋa, nii GALA ge teʋeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:23">maayikiʋɛ, gè la zooga gè ʋa lo tuɠɔ.<verse eid="JOB 31:23"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 31:24"/>«Gè ɠitoni nɛi zanugi ʋa? Ɓaa gè ɠɛ ma: ‹Dɔ̀ɔɠuzuʋɛ ɠa!›<verse eid="JOB 31:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 31:25"/>Gè la ɠɛni ɠoozunɛɛni nɔ zèaɠɔligiti mɔin vai zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:25">naavoloiti gè ti zɔlɔɔgai ga zèei.<verse eid="JOB 31:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 31:26"/>Siɛgi zu gè foloi ʋɛtɛni da, é ɗa volo ná-keɠaaɓaai zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:26">ɓaa siɛgi zu gè alugi ɠaani la, é ɗa ziɛ geezuʋɛ ná-maayikii zu,<verse eid="JOB 31:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 31:27"/>gè ɠakani zìimaʋɛ dɔɔɠuzu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:27">gè ʋa yeeʋɛɛ la, ga gè nɔkɔ ti wu ɓaa?<verse eid="JOB 31:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 31:28"/>Kaka faa ɠana, nii maanɛai é lukpɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:28">Nà la ɠɛlɛ GALA ba, nii é geezuʋɛ.<verse eid="JOB 31:28"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 31:29"/>«Yeelɛ ɠa gè ɠɛni ɠoozunɛɛzu la, ga gè sìli nui ɠaa dɔai maanɔɠɔi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:29">kòozunɛ, tɔɔzei faaɓaagi zeelia ma,<verse eid="JOB 31:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 31:30"/>nɛ̀i gè la vaani bu pɛ nɛ̀gi ʋa koto ɠɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:30">ga gè ʋa foovo, gè ɠɛ GALA ma, é za.<verse eid="JOB 31:30"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 31:31"/>Ɓɛ ɠa gè la kɔnɔkulani ga suai, é ʋa yiɠo?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:31">Niiti kpein gè ti laazuʋɛɛni, naati ta naama zeele wooi wo.<verse eid="JOB 31:31"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 31:32"/>Wɛɛn la ɲiini etea,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:32">gè nà-pɛlɛi laalaoni siɛ wo nuiti bɛ.<verse eid="JOB 31:32"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 31:33"/>Eɠɛʋelei nuɓusɛ mɔinmɔin ga ɗa kɛ la,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:33">gè nà-tɔ koloɠologi lɔɔɠuni nɛi ɓaa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:33">Gè ɠɛlɛ ga gè mina nà-faaɠaaza golai ɠwɛɛ?<verse eid="JOB 31:33"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 31:34"/>Kaipa gè la luani nui zɔiti ta-lukpɔɠaaleʋei ʋa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:34">Ti ɠɛni zoosu ti ɲɛɛɠula sù, naa la ɠɛni màaluazu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:34">naa la dàaɠuluni kaipa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:34">ɓaa é ʋa pele ɓesa tùɠɔ ga gè mina ɠula.<verse eid="JOB 31:34"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 31:35"/>«Ee, ni nu ɠɛni bɛ̀, nii é woilosu gòoi ma!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:35">Gòo ɠaaɓelagi ɠana!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:35">GALA Zɛbɛi-Pɛ-Maliɠii ná-gooɠaaʋotegi ve zèa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:35">Nii é ga maalɔɔ vai sìli nui sɛʋɛai,<verse eid="JOB 31:35"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOB 31:36"/>nà naa laazu ɠɔma, gè dɔ ùnba eɠɛ masa bɔɔlɔgi.<verse eid="JOB 31:36"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOB 31:37"/>Nà ʋoluvaawo ma ga nà-kɛɛwotii ɠilagilagiti pɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:37">gè li tɔun pɔ bɛ eɠɛ masa!<verse eid="JOB 31:37"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOB 31:38"/>Ni nà-zooiti ti pèelalani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:38">ni gè ta-wozawoliaiti gaawɔlɔni,<verse eid="JOB 31:38"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOB 31:39"/>ni gè ti-ʋaalɔnɔgiti miini nɔ, gè la ti ɠeyani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:39">ni gè naati nimizani, niiti ti ɠɛni ti botii ɠɛɛzu,<verse eid="JOB 31:39"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOB 31:40"/>adaʋɛ moloi naa ná, nii é ga ɓeleegi, ɠaingiti ti ʋɔnɔ miná,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:40">ta moloi nii daa ga wɔɔlezegi, gui ɲɔi ʋɔnɔ naa ʋotogi zu!»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 31:40">Zɔɓe ná-kpɔɛiti kwɛsuʋɛ ɠa.<verse eid="JOB 31:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 31"/>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="JOB 32"/>
  <para style="s">Eliyu ná-kpɔɛzuɠulai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 32:1"/>Niima nu saʋagɔiti, Elifaze, Ɓilidade ta Sofaal, ti ɓeni Zɔɓe wooɠaaʋote fai ʋa, tɔɔzei naa laani ɓɔɠɔ la ga telebogɛ. <verse eid="JOB 32:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 32:2"/>Naa Ɓalakele ná-doun zunui Eliyu yiiɠaawanani gola, Ɓuze mavofodai, Lame ná-pɛlɛyeɠei wu nui. É yiiɠaawanani Zɔɓe ma, tɔɔzei naa ɠɛni ɓɔɠɔ ɠaazu ga telebogɛ é leʋe GALA ba. <verse eid="JOB 32:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 32:3"/>É yiiɠaawanani ɓalaa Zɔɓe bɔɔla saʋagɔiti ma, tɔɔzei naati ti la ɠɛni faa nɔpɛ kaani, nii ta gooɠaaʋote da, ti Zɔɓe ʋeelalani wafuun ga naa maaʋele. <verse eid="JOB 32:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 32:4"/>Eliyu maaɓɔungi woni, aisa é ʋa ɓɔɛ Zɔɓe ʋɔ, tɔ ɠa é ɠɛni ga doungoi Zɔɓe bɔɔla saʋagɔiti saama. <verse eid="JOB 32:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 32:5"/>Kɛlɛ Eliyu kaai ma ga kpɔɛ nɔpɛ ge la mɔ ɠɛni bɔɔla nu saʋagɔiti da, ti ʋa bo, é yiiɠaawanani.<verse eid="JOB 32:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 32:6"/>Ɓuze mavofodai Ɓalakele ná-doun zunui Eliyu kpɔɛi zeɠeni, é ɠɛ ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:6">«Nà dɛ ga doungo, wa ga kpakologiti.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:6">Naa ɠa é ba, dùaʋɛ, ungo, ìnɛinɛgɛ gè ʋa naa wo wo ma, nii gè kwɛɛ.<verse eid="JOB 32:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 32:7"/>Gè ɠɛni ɠɛɛzu:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:7">‹Niiti ti eteai ta ziaai na sɛ, naati ta zoo ɓɔɛzu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:7">niiti ti ziaa faa mɔinmɔin su, naati ta ɠimalai lɛ.›<verse eid="JOB 32:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 32:8"/>Gaamai zu, nii é nui ɠɛɛzu ga keleɠele nui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:8">naa ɠa é ga zɛnvui, GALA Zɛbɛi-Pɛ-Maliɠii ná-kulakɛlɛmai.<verse eid="JOB 32:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 32:9"/>Ɗa-ɠonagiti mɔin vai laade, a è ɠɛ ga ɠima nui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:9">Kɛwola wɔlɔiti nɔ laade, ti ʋa ɠɛ faa zɔlegai ɠwɛɛ.<verse eid="JOB 32:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 32:10"/>Naa ɠa é ba, nà è maanɛɛnɛzu, woilo gòoi ma, nà ɓalaa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:10">Nà kìsu vai lɛɛzu.<verse eid="JOB 32:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 32:11"/>«Zaaɠaza, gè ɠɛa maaɓɔungi wosu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:11">gè woilo wo ɓɔɛ wooiti ma, ta wa-ɠigaiziɛiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:11">gè wo yɛ ná, wo wa-ɠisiɛiti dɛɛ.<verse eid="JOB 32:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 32:12"/>Gè woilogɛ wo-wooiti ma gola ga pagɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:12">kɛlɛ wo tanɔpɛ ge la zooni Zɔɓe la,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:12">wo tanɔpɛ ge la gooi ta zeɠeni daazu.<verse eid="JOB 32:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 32:13"/>À mina ɠɛ ma: ‹Gi ɠimalai ɠaaʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:13">GALA gila kpe ka a vɔni ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:13">kɛlɛ nu ɠila kpalaa taade.›<verse eid="JOB 32:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 32:14"/>Anɛɛ naa ʋe, Zɔɓe ná-kpɔɛiti ti la sakpani, ti ʋa lo bà.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:14">Gè la gooɠaaʋotesu, eɠɛʋelei wɔnɔ ma wooɠaaʋotegiti ti la.<verse eid="JOB 32:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 32:15"/>«Ti ʋɛtɛ, ti ɠoozuʋiliga, ti la mɔ gooɠaaʋote feezu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:15">Wooiti ti ʋalaga ti la!<verse eid="JOB 32:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 32:16"/>Gè maaɓɔungi woga, kɛlɛ ti la mɔ ɓɔɛzu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:16">ti loga kpɛ, ti la mɔ gooɠaaʋote feezu.<verse eid="JOB 32:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 32:17"/>Nɔ̀un tetegi, nà pɔ nà ɓalaa gè gooɠaaʋotegi ve,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:17">gè nà-faaɠaaɠai lɛ.<verse eid="JOB 32:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 32:18"/>Mazɔlɔɔ ɠi mɔinmɔin ka bɛ̀,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:18">zɛ̀nvui ɠa kpɔ̀lɔzu kòozu, ga gè ɓɔɛ.<verse eid="JOB 32:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 32:19"/>Toɠa zɔsu kòozu, eɠɛ dɔɔi puai kɔlɔ woole niinɛi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:19">é daavegai, é ɠɛɛzu é ʋu ya.<verse eid="JOB 32:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 32:20"/>À zɛ̀na gè ɓɔɛ, naa ɠa a kɛ gè yɛnvu ga pagɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:20">nà laalaosu deɠɛmu, gè gooɠaaʋotegi ve.<verse eid="JOB 32:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 32:21"/>Gè la losu nu nɔpɛ polu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:21">gè la nu nɔpɛ tɛɛzu su.<verse eid="JOB 32:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 32:22"/>Gè la zooni nu lɛɛzu su,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:22">Kpɛ̀tɛ Nui ɠa sèɠena gaamago nɔ.»<verse eid="JOB 32:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 32"/>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="JOB 33"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 33:1"/>«Niizu, Zɔɓe, woilo dɛɛ kìsu vaiti ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:1">woilo gòoiti kpein ma.<verse eid="JOB 33:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 33:2"/>Wɛlɛ, nà laalaosu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:2">nɛ̀gi ɓɔɛ è ʋɔ.<verse eid="JOB 33:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 33:3"/>Zìi ná-sɔledai ɠa nà-kpɔɛiti ti ɠulazu su.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:3">Kala kitei ɠa dàaʋɛ bosu.<verse eid="JOB 33:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 33:4"/>GALA Zɛnvui ɠa é kpɛ̀tɛai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:4">Zɛbɛi-Pɛ-Maliɠii ná-fiilɛi ɠa é zɛ̀nvuzu.<verse eid="JOB 33:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 33:5"/>Ni ɗa zoo, gòoɠaaʋote,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:5">ɗa-ɠɛʋele ɓɛtɛiti kɛ, è lo gàazu!<verse eid="JOB 33:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 33:6"/>GALA gaazu, nà ga è ɠɛʋele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:6">kpɛ̀tɛʋɛ ga pɔlɔi.<verse eid="JOB 33:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 33:7"/>Naazu è la ɓalia ga dualuagi nɔ̀un gaazu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:7">ɓaa è ʋa ɠisiɛ ga nà-zobogi ɠa è ɠoloɠolosu.<verse eid="JOB 33:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 33:8"/>«È boni, é loo gòizu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:8">gè è-laawooiti mɛnini ga:<verse eid="JOB 33:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 33:9"/>‹Ɲàdegɛ, tɔ koloɠolo ge la bà.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:9">Kòleʋɛ, gè la faa nɔpɛ gaazani.<verse eid="JOB 33:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 33:10"/>Anɛɛ naa ʋe, GALA ka faiti kpɛtɛzu dàalɔɠɔma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:10">é ɗa pɛ̀tɛ ga zili nu.<verse eid="JOB 33:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 33:11"/>É kɔlui ʋiliga kɔ̀ɠɔiti ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:11">é ɠaazulo kɛ̀ɛ vaiti kpein ba.›<verse eid="JOB 33:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 33:12"/>«Nà è wooɠaaʋotesu ga, gaama la è ya naa zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:12">mazɔlɔɔ GALA bɔɔlɔʋɛ nuɓusɛi ʋa.<verse eid="JOB 33:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 33:13"/>Leeni vaa zu è pɔ è tɔun maaɠaali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:13">tɛi é la ɗa ga ɗa-ɠaazaɠagiti gaaʋotesu vai ʋe, è ti ʋilisu ma?<verse eid="JOB 33:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 33:14"/>Anɛɛ naa ʋe, GALA ka ɗa ɓɔɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:14">ná ta ga pelei nii, ɓaa nuuma ʋelei,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:14">kɛlɛ nuɓusɛi la ɗa ga ɠida bu.<verse eid="JOB 33:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 33:15"/>Toɠa ɗa ɓɔɛ ga segi ta kulakɛlɛmai kpidii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:15">siɛgi zu ɲiimɛni wolai nuiti kpein sosu da,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:15">siɛgi zu ti ɲiizu la ta-ʋeteiti su.<verse eid="JOB 33:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 33:16"/>Názu ɠa a ɗa kulakɛlɛmai ɠɛ la nuiti bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:16">kalagi é bosu, é maaɓakpa,<verse eid="JOB 33:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 33:17"/>nii a kɛ é nuɓusɛi zeɠe ná-kɛɛwotiiti polu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:17">é ti makɛ, ti mina loo wasogi zu.<verse eid="JOB 33:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 33:18"/>Zekana é ti-yɛnvui ɠizosu da kabai ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:18">toɠa pele leʋesu ti luɠɔ ga ti mina ʋilɛ pelei naa ma é liizu gɔvɛalaazu.<verse eid="JOB 33:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 33:19"/>«Nui ɠa ɗa yɛ daazuʋɛ ga taɓai maaʋele, é ɠigi zɔlɔɔ, é lɛnɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:19">siɛgi zu seeɓɛi kaeiti kpalizu la, dooɠo ge la ba.<verse eid="JOB 33:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 33:20"/>Naazu ɓului ɠa ɗa ɲɔu da,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:20">anɛɛ daamianigi niiti wɔinɗai ga tiye gola.<verse eid="JOB 33:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 33:21"/>Kɔlɔgi ɠula ma, é ɠaɲa, nu ɠaazulosu la ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:21">kaeiti nu la ɠɛa ti ɠaazu, naati ti ɠula kɛlɛzu.<verse eid="JOB 33:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 33:22"/>É maaɓuɠaa kabai ʋa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:22">Zɛnvui ɠa niina saa ɠeezuɠeelaiti zea.<verse eid="JOB 33:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 33:23"/>Kɛlɛ ni GALA ná-geezuɠeelai gila ga ɠɛna zunui naa ɠoba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:23">é ɠula waagiti saama, é pele zɔlegi lɛɛ la,<verse eid="JOB 33:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 33:24"/>naazu toɠa zaalai la ma, é maawɔinɠa, é ɠɛ GALA ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:24">‹Mina zɛ ná, é ʋa yei kabai zu, gè unmɔɔ ganii zɔlɔɔga,›<verse eid="JOB 33:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 33:25"/>názu ɠa kpusɛi niinɛzu la eɠɛ ná-doungo ziɛgi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:25">é ɠale ma ná-doungoyai ma voloiti ma.<verse eid="JOB 33:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 33:26"/>Toɠa wooɠula GALA ma, naa yeezei bu ga pagɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:26">é lo gaazu ga koozunɛ wooi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:26">Mazɔlɔɔ GALA ka kwɛɛsu ga niinɛ ga telebo nui.<verse eid="JOB 33:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 33:27"/>Toɠa too ga guyei ɛsɛ pɛ gaazu, é ɠɛ ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:27">‹Gè koto ɠɛɛni, gè tɔgi ɠoloɠolo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:27">Kɛlɛ GALA ge la sòni ga nà-faaɠaazagi, é ʋa dòɠa.<verse eid="JOB 33:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 33:28"/>GALA ge kùlani kabai zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:28">zɛ̀gɛ vulua, gè wozakalagi ɠa.›<verse eid="JOB 33:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 33:29"/>Pɛtɛ, GALA ka naa kpein kɛɛzu nui ʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:29">ná ɠɛ fele, ná ɠɛ saʋa,<verse eid="JOB 33:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 33:30"/>nii a kɛ é zɛnvui ɠula ʋolu kabai zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:30">é fulu nuiti ta-wozakalagi ve zea.<verse eid="JOB 33:30"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 33:31"/>Lo dɛɛ, Zɔɓe, woilo gòoi ma!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:31">Maaɠɛ kpɔ, gè zoo gè ɓɔɛ è ʋɔ.<verse eid="JOB 33:31"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 33:32"/>Anɛɛ naa ʋe, ni gooɠaaʋote ka è ya, bo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:32">mazɔlɔɔ kòozu ɠa nɛɛ, gè ɠɛ è ma, gaamai ɠa è ya.<verse eid="JOB 33:32"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 33:33"/>Ni faa la è-la, è ʋa bo, maaɠɛ kpɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:33">è woilo gòo ma, nà è ɠalasu ga ɠimalai.»<verse eid="JOB 33:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 33"/>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="JOB 34"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 34:1"/>Eliyu kpɔɛi zeɠeni ʋolu, é ɠɛ ma:<verse eid="JOB 34:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 34:2"/>«Ɠima nuiti, à woilo gòoiti ma!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:2">Wɔiti wo ɠigai, à woilo gòoiti ma!<verse eid="JOB 34:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 34:3"/>Mazɔlɔɔ nu woiyeɠei ɠa ɗa wooiti zɔɠɔzuɠa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:3">eɠɛʋelei nu laaɠoozuʋɛ daamianigiti ta-nɛɛi yɔɠɔzuɠaazu la.<verse eid="JOB 34:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 34:4"/>Fai sɔlegai, de naa yeeɠaaɠwɛ lɛɛ da ɓɔɠɔi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:4">Nii pagai, de ɠɛ naa ɠwɛɛ da ɓɔɠɔi.<verse eid="JOB 34:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 34:5"/>«Wɛlɛ nii Zɔɓe ɠisiɛzu su:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:5">‹Nà ga telebo nu, kɛlɛ GALA ge la nà-sɔle fai tanɔpɛ pɛtɛsu.<verse eid="JOB 34:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 34:6"/>Anɛɛ tèlebogɛ, gè levea ga zɛɛ nu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:6">Gè la tɔ koloɠoloni, kɛlɛ gè wɔa ga mɛɛinti.›<verse eid="JOB 34:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 34:7"/>«Nu ɠa ná nɛi nii kulaai ga Zɔɓe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:7">nii é ɲɛɛɠulasui ɓɔlezu, eɠɛʋelei nu a ziɛi ɓɔle la,<verse eid="JOB 34:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 34:8"/>ta faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nuiti ka ti siɛpolui zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:8">ti ɗa ziɛ ʋɔɔma ta nu ɲɔiti?<verse eid="JOB 34:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 34:9"/>Mazɔlɔɔ tɔ ɓɔɠɔi boni, é ɠɛ ma: ‹Toɠa ga wafuun faa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:9">nu ʋa ɠaaɓa ga é GALA ɛnɛkɛ.›<verse eid="JOB 34:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 34:10"/>«Wɔi ɠi pagɔi wo ma, à woilo gòoi ma!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:10">GALA ge la zooga faa ɲɔu ɠɛɛzu pɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:10">Zɛbɛi-Pɛ-Maliɠii la zooga ɠɛɛzu ga telebotala ɠɛ nu.<verse eid="JOB 34:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 34:11"/>Mazɔlɔɔ toɠa ɗa nui ɠilagilagi zala é zoloo ná-kɛɛwotiiti ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:11">é ɛsɛ gilagilagi zo eɠɛʋelei siɛ ʋelei la.<verse eid="JOB 34:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 34:12"/>Gaamai zu, koleʋɛ ga GALA ge la ɗa ga faaɠaaza kɛa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:12">kaipa, Zɛbɛi-Pɛ-Maliɠii la ɗa ga telebotala ɠɛa.<verse eid="JOB 34:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 34:13"/>Taɠili ka ná, bɔɔlɔai, é eteai ma masadai vea GALA zea ɓaa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:13">Ɓɛ ɠa é eteai ɠalivaai ma?<verse eid="JOB 34:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 34:14"/>Ni GALA ge ɠɛni ɠigaiziɛzu ɓɔɠɔ nɔ zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:14">é ná-Zɛnvui ta ná-fiilɛiti gaaʋote ɓɔɠɔ nɔ ma,<verse eid="JOB 34:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 34:15"/>kpɛtɛaniiti pɛ undaa ɠa ʋili ʋɔɔma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:15">nuɓusɛi ɠale ma fufiligi zu.<verse eid="JOB 34:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 34:16"/>«Ni è ɠeleɠelegɛ, woilo dɛɛ nii ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:16">ɠida lɛɛ dàawooiti bu.<verse eid="JOB 34:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 34:17"/>GALA ka zoo nɛi, é zei eteai unda ɓaa, ni é la wɔinni ga sɔledai?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:17">Ɗa yiilɔɔzu è naa ʋeelala, nii zobogi tɔ ɠila kpe zea, sɔlegai?<verse eid="JOB 34:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 34:18"/>Ɗa zoo è ɠɛ masagi ma: ‹Nu ɲakai,›</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:18">è ɠɛ nu wolaiti ma: ‹Faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nuiti›?<verse eid="JOB 34:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 34:19"/>GALA ge la ɗa ga loga kundiɠia ʋolu yɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:19">é la kpɛtɛ nu vizɔga bala nu ʋa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:19">Tɔɔzei tɔ ɠa é ti felegɔ pɛ kpɛtɛa.<verse eid="JOB 34:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 34:20"/>Gaamago nɔ, saai ʋaa, kua zaamai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:20">nuɓusɛi ɓakaga, undaaʋili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:20">ti zobobɛ nui ɠula ɓɔɠɔ zaama lɛilaa nɔ.<verse eid="JOB 34:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 34:21"/>Mazɔlɔɔ GALA ka wɛlɛzu nuiti siɛ ʋeleiti ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:21">toɠa ti-ziɛzuʋɛti pɛ pɛtɛsu.<verse eid="JOB 34:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 34:22"/>Ma ɓidii la ná, ɓaa kpidi ɓɔii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:22">nii a pele leʋe tuɠɔ ga é mina faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nuiti ka.<verse eid="JOB 34:22"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 34:23"/>«Ungo, GALA kpɛdɛ la ba ga é lɛbi nui zumɔsu ɠeke, é ʋa leɠa tukpɔ.<verse eid="JOB 34:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 34:24"/>Toɠa ɗa zobobɛ nuiti koloɠolo, kpɛdɛ la ba ga é faa wuuɓɛ naazu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:24">é taɠiligaa zei ti-ʋotogi zu.<verse eid="JOB 34:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 34:25"/>Mazɔlɔɔ é ta-ɠɛɛwotiiti zɔɠɔzuɠwɛɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:25">Toɠa ti lokasu, é ti lɛɛvɛ kpidi ɠila nɔ.<verse eid="JOB 34:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 34:26"/>Toɠa ɗa ti loɠa kɛlɛzu eɠɛ nu ʋaa nua.<verse eid="JOB 34:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 34:27"/>Ti ʋoluavega tɔun ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:27">ti ná-kala gooiti kɛ ga ɠwɛɛtala zu vaa.<verse eid="JOB 34:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 34:28"/>Mazɔlɔɔ ti yɛga su, bala nuiti kpain gooi lɛa naa ʋɔ bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:28">é maanɔɠɔ nuiti ta-ɓee wooi mɛniga.<verse eid="JOB 34:28"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 34:29"/>«Zenɔ ɠana é la, ni GALA ka maaɠɛna kpɔ, ɓɛ ɠa a peelala?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:29">A ɠɛna pɔ é lɔɔɠu, ɓɛ ɠa a ka, anɛɛ naa ʋe?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:29">Naa ɠa ga gaama zii ɠiligiti faa ma, ta nuiti kpein,<verse eid="JOB 34:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 34:30"/>nii a kɛ telebotala nui mina masada ɠɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:30">é ʋa ɠɛ ga balii nuɓusɛiti bɛ.<verse eid="JOB 34:30"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 34:31"/>«Tanisu nui ɠa nii wo GALA ma ga:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:31">‹Gè nà-maaɠoloi zɔlɔɔga, gè la mɔ ɠɛa ga faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nu eyɛsu pɛ.<verse eid="JOB 34:31"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 34:32"/>Nii gè la dɛ kaani, ɗɔun naa lɛɛlɛ ga ze.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:32">Ni gè faaɠaazagaa ɠɛɛʋɛ, gè la mɔ naa ta ɠɛa ʋolu pɛ.›<verse eid="JOB 34:32"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 34:33"/>GALA maanɛɛʋɛ é sala?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:33">È ɠisu vai ɠa ga leeni, deɠɛmu? Ɗa ɲɛɛɠulazu GALA su.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:33">Tɔɔzei ɗa ɠa è devei wosu, nà laade, è ɠisu vai wo!<verse eid="JOB 34:33"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 34:34"/>«Gi zoloogɛ ma gá ɠi pagɔ nuiti, ta ɓɔga ɠima nui, niiti ti woilosu gòoi ma:<verse eid="JOB 34:34"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 34:35"/>‹Zɔɓe ɠa ɓɔɛzu, é la gaaɠaazu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:35">ná-kpɔɛ wooiti ta keleɠeletalai lɛɛzu.<verse eid="JOB 34:35"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOB 34:36"/>Ná-ʋoluɠulai maanɛɛʋɛ é zeeli kwɛgi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:36">tɔɔzei toɠa gooɠaaʋotegi veezu eɠɛ telebotala nu.<verse eid="JOB 34:36"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOB 34:37"/>Toɠa kpakagi ɓɔsu ná-faaɠaazagi ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:37">é inɛinɛgi lɔ ade zu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:37">Ná-kpɔɛzuɠulai mɔinʋɛ GALA daalɔɠɔma.› »<verse eid="JOB 34:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 34"/>
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="JOB 35"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 35:1"/>Eliyu kpɔɛzuɠulani ʋolu, é ɠɛ ma:<verse eid="JOB 35:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 35:2"/>«Zɔɓe, ɗa-ɠaama ɠa è su ɓaa, siɛgi zu è bosu la ga:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:2">‹Ungo, tèlebogɛ GALA ba›?<verse eid="JOB 35:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 35:3"/>Mazɔlɔɔ ɗa ɠɛɛzu ma: ‹Lee ɠulanuma ɠa é naa zu è ʋɛ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:3">Toɠa leeni ʋaa mà, ni gè la koto ɠɛɛni?›<verse eid="JOB 35:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 35:4"/>Nà ɠa gè è wooɠaaʋotesu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:4">wa ɓɔga è-wɔɔlaiti ʋɔɔma.<verse eid="JOB 35:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 35:5"/>«Geeɠɔlɔgiti pɛtɛ dɛɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:5">Tonaɓiingiti pɛtɛ, ta zɛlɛni è maazu poun!<verse eid="JOB 35:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 35:6"/>Ɗa faa ɲɔi ɠɛɛna, naa ɠa GALA kpɔlɔzu ɠale?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:6">Siɛgi zu è tɔ koloɠologi zuwɔɔlɔzu la, naa ɠa leeni ɠɛɛzu la?<verse eid="JOB 35:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 35:7"/>Ɗa ɠɛna ziaa ga pagɔ, leeni ɠa è feezu zea naazu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:7">Leeni ɠa é sɔlɔɔsu è ya?<verse eid="JOB 35:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 35:8"/>Kɛlɛ ɗa-nu ɲɔulai è kɛɛzu, naa ɠa è-wɔɔla nuɓusɛi tanɔ ɓɔlɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:8">ɗa-lelebodai ɠa ɓɔ è-wɔɔla nuɓusɛi tanigaa nɔ ʋa.<verse eid="JOB 35:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 35:9"/>«Wɔinzeɠemai a wɔɔlɔna, nuiti ta ɗa kpeei loo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:9">ti ɓɔɠɔ maaloli bo zɛbɛsu nuiti ta-zeiungai laalɔɠɔma.<verse eid="JOB 35:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 35:10"/>Kɛlɛ nu nɔpɛ ge la ɠigaiziɛzu, é ʋa ɠɛ ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:10">‹GALA ka mini, nii é kpɛ̀tɛni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:10">nii é koozunɛ wuyeiti feezu zèa kua zaamai?<verse eid="JOB 35:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 35:11"/>Tɔ ɠa é de ɠalasu, é leʋe dɔɓɔ zuaiti ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:11">é ɠimalai ve de ʋɛ, é leʋe wɔniiti ba.›<verse eid="JOB 35:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 35:12"/>Naazu kpeei ɠa loozu, kɛlɛ GALA ge la gooɠaaʋote feezu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:12">faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nuiti ta-wasogi maaʋele ma.<verse eid="JOB 35:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 35:13"/>Ungo, ta kpeei loozu wafuun, GALA ge la woiloga ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:13">é la Zɛbɛi-Pɛ-Maliɠii ɠaazu ga faa nɔpɛ.<verse eid="JOB 35:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 35:14"/>Toɠa è wooɠaaʋote ɠale, ɗɛi è ɠisiɛzu ga è la kaazu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:14">ɗa maaɓɔunsu yeenɔpɛ, tɔɔzei è è-maavaiti daa bɛ.<verse eid="JOB 35:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 35:15"/>Tɔɔzei ná-ziiɠaawanai la dɛ losuʋɛ ɠɛɛni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:15">kɛai eɠɛ ná-faa la kpaka fai zu,<verse eid="JOB 35:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 35:16"/>Zɔɓe ná-kpɔɛzuɠulai kpein ka nɔ ga fiilɛi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:16">toɠa kpɔɛzuɠulai mɔinzu, é la kwɛɛ nii é bosu.»<verse eid="JOB 35:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 35"/>
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="JOB 36"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 36:1"/>Eliyu liini luɠɔma ga kpɔɛi, é ɠɛ ma:<verse eid="JOB 36:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 36:2"/>«Màaɓɔun dɛɛ, Zɔɓe, gè faiti zɔɠɔzulɛ ga ɗe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:2">mazɔlɔɔ faa mɔinmɔin kana dɛ a wo GALA ná-faiti su.<verse eid="JOB 36:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 36:3"/>Nà nà-faaɠaaɠai zeɠezu ɠoozama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:3">gè gaamai ve Kpɛ̀tɛ ƓALAGI ya.<verse eid="JOB 36:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 36:4"/>Nii gè bosu, gaama ɠitei ʋe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:4">ɠima nu ɓɔɠɔɓɔɠɔ ka é è ɠoba.<verse eid="JOB 36:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 36:5"/>«Ungo, GALA bɔɔlɔʋɛ gola, é ʋa li nui ʋɛlɛʋɛlɛsu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:5">zobobɛ ƓALAGI ʋe, ná-devei la valiboga.<verse eid="JOB 36:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 36:6"/>É la nu ɲɔi yɛga vulua,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:6">kɛlɛ toɠa ɗa maanɔɠɔ nui ná-gaamai maalobo.<verse eid="JOB 36:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 36:7"/>É la ɗa ga ɠaazu zeɠe telebo nuiti ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:7">kɛlɛ toɠa ɗa ti zei masa kpɔkpɔgi ɠa masagiti koba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:7">Toɠa ɗa ti ʋilɛ ná, ga ti zei ná eyɛsu ɠɔ, é ti wɔɔlɔ.<verse eid="JOB 36:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 36:8"/>Ni ti ɠiliʋɛ ga yɔlɔɠɔiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:8">ni ɠiliʋɛ ga maanɔɠɔ ɠaluiti,<verse eid="JOB 36:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 36:9"/>naa ɠa ga, toɠa ta-ɠɛɛwotiiti poluɠulazu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:9">tɔ koloɠologiti ti ti ɠɛɛni ta-wasogi zu.<verse eid="JOB 36:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 36:10"/>Tɔ ɠa é ti lɛnɛsu, é ti ɠala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:10">ga ti ɓeteʋe ta-vaa ɲɔiti ba.<verse eid="JOB 36:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 36:11"/>Ni ta woilona, ti ɠolo GALA bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:11">ta ta-voloiti gaaɓela undaanɛɛi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:11">ta-ɠonagiti gaa ɠa ɓela gaanɛɛi zu.<verse eid="JOB 36:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 36:12"/>Ni ti la woiloni, ta ʋilɛ pelei naa ma é liizu gɔvɛalaazu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:12">ti undaa ɠa ʋili ta-faaɠwɛtalai zu.<verse eid="JOB 36:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 36:13"/>«GALA gaazuluabalala nuiti ta ɗa ta-yiiɠaawanai makɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:13">ti la wooɠula kpɔba ɠaiziɛ vaa zu, siɛgi zu GALA ge ti ɠilizu la ga yɔlɔɠɔiti.<verse eid="JOB 36:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 36:14"/>Ta yɛsu nu niinɛlai zaamaʋɛ, ti za,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:14">ta-eteai ɠaaɓela koloɠolo nuiti saama.<verse eid="JOB 36:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 36:15"/>GALA ka ɗa maanɔɠɔ nui unmɔɔ ga ná-maanɔɠɔi maaʋele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:15">ta é kpɔlɔi zeɠe, é kɛ ga zaɓui naa woilo goo ma.<verse eid="JOB 36:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 36:16"/>«Ɗa ɓalaagi, toɠa è ɠula kidaaʋiligi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:16">é undaanɛ wolai ve è ʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:16">é ɗa-laamii wo taɓalii ɠaalaave ga daamiani nɛɛnɛgiti.<verse eid="JOB 36:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 36:17"/>Kɛlɛ niizu, faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nuiti ta-maaɠoloi zeelia è ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:17">tukpɔi ta faawogi ti è zoga.<verse eid="JOB 36:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 36:18"/>Ziiɠulagi mina è li ɲɛɛɠulasui ma!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:18">Mina ɓɔɠɔ ɠaka ga kisiɛi, ga ɗa ɠaaɓaana è faanɛɛi ɠɛ, ɗa GALA geya.<verse eid="JOB 36:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 36:19"/>È ɓain gooiti ta ɗa-ɠaaɓaaiti ta kula ɠɛ nɛi ɓaa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:19">ti ʋa è ɠula kidaaʋiligi zu?<verse eid="JOB 36:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 36:20"/>Mina ɠito kpidii ʋa gola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:20">a ɗa nuiti suvaza, ti zeɠe ti-losuʋɛ.<verse eid="JOB 36:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 36:21"/>Dama ga ɓɔɠɔ, è mina ɠaaʋote faa ɲɔi ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:21">Mazɔlɔɔ naa ɠa é kɛa, è kpɔlɔi zu.<verse eid="JOB 36:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 36:22"/>«GALA bɔɔlɔʋɛ, zobogi ɠa bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:22">kalagi wo fai zu, kɛɠala la ná.<verse eid="JOB 36:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 36:23"/>Ɓɛ ɠa a ɗa pelei lɛɛ la?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:23">Ɓɛ ɠa é zooga é ɠɛ ma: ‹Nii è kɛɛzu, é la zolooni›?<verse eid="JOB 36:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 36:24"/>Mina yeema, è maamusɛ kɛɛ vaiti faa zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:24">nii nuɓusɛi kpein ge dɛbizu ma vaa zu ga guyeiti.<verse eid="JOB 36:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 36:25"/>Nuɓusɛi kpein ka wɛlɛzu ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:25">nui kpein ka yɛsu ɠoozama, é ɗa ka.<verse eid="JOB 36:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 36:26"/>Wɛlɛ ʋelei GALA bɔɔlɔai la, ná-bɔɔlɔi ɓudɛʋɛ da-ɠisiɛiti maazu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:26">Nu nɔpɛ ge la zooga é ʋa ná-konagi liegɔi ɠaalu.<verse eid="JOB 36:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 36:27"/>Toɠa ɗa nɔɗa koiti mɛɛn ʋɔ pelei,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:27">é ɠɛ ga diegi, é ɠaaɠale ma, é ɠɛ ga tonai.<verse eid="JOB 36:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 36:28"/>Tonaɓiingiti ti faza, é ʋu nuɓusɛiti ma.<verse eid="JOB 36:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 36:29"/>Ɓɛ ɠa a zoo é tonaɓiingiti siɛ ʋeleiti gaaɠa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:29">ta ʋelei tona kpunɛ tugi ɠulazu la geezuʋɛ?<verse eid="JOB 36:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 36:30"/>Wɛlɛ maaɠoolii zu, ʋelei mainmain saɠazu la,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:30">é ʋɛɛ kpoloɗɛi ma ʋali wolai ɠaaʋɛ.<verse eid="JOB 36:30"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 36:31"/>Nuɓusɛiti ta yɛnvuzu ga tonai maaʋele, é puuzu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:31">é daamianigi ve ti ya ga bɔɔlɔa.<verse eid="JOB 36:31"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 36:32"/>Toɠa ɗa mainmain zo yee felegɔi ɠa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:32">naa ʋolu, é diizuʋɛ lɛɛ la.<verse eid="JOB 36:32"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 36:33"/>A ɠɛna ʋaa, toɠa ɗa dɛɛ ga ná-tona kpunɛ tugi maaʋele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:33">toganiiti ta looga ná ga maaɓuɠa.»<verse eid="JOB 36:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 36"/>
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="JOB 37"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 37:1"/>«Naama vaiti pɛtɛga laawu, zìi ɠa ɲiikpisu kòozu, eɠɛ a ɠɛ ɠɛɛzu é ʋili, é ɠula tosuʋɛ.<verse eid="JOB 37:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 37:2"/>À woilo, à woilo dɛɛ GALA gooi lugi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:2">sikɔ gooiti kpein ti ɠulazu daaʋɛ.<verse eid="JOB 37:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 37:3"/>GALA ka ɗa ná-mainmain zaɠa mini-o-mini geezuʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:3">mainmain naa ɠa ɗa leʋe eteai zu mini-o-mini.<verse eid="JOB 37:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 37:4"/>Tɔun poluʋelei, GALA gooi ɠa ɗa ɠula, é ɗa zikɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:4">daawoo maayikiai lugi ɗa ɠula.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:4">Gaamago nɔ, GALA ka ɗa mainmainti teʋe ʋolu ga niinɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:4">tama nu ɠa ɗa goomɛni.<verse eid="JOB 37:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 37:5"/>Maayiki vaa ʋe, ʋelei GALA ge zikɔzu la ga gooi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:5">toɠa faa wolaiti kɛɛzu, de la ti ɠaaɠaazu.<verse eid="JOB 37:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 37:6"/>Toɠa ɗa ɠɛ kɔɔlɛ vukɔi ma: ‹Ʋu eteai zu,›</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:6">é sabalagi ʋu, ta tona zɛbɛlɛgi.<verse eid="JOB 37:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 37:7"/>Naama ziɛgi zu, nuɓusɛiti ti la mɔ zooga faa nɔpɛ kɛɛzu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:7">naa ɠa a kɛ, nuiti kpein ti kwɛɛ ga naa ɠa é ga ná-kɛɛwotii.<verse eid="JOB 37:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 37:8"/>Anɛɛ dɔɓɔ zuaiti ta ɗa ɓɔɠɔ maalɔɔɠu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:8">ti li, ti la ta-yeɠeiti su.<verse eid="JOB 37:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 37:9"/>Tɔngɔlɔ fiilɛi ɠa ɗa zeɠe ga lɛkpɛma ʋelei nu yeezazuʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:9">kɔɔlɛi zeɠe lɛkpɛmaʋɛ nu ɠɔʋɛzuʋɛ viilɛiti pɔ.<verse eid="JOB 37:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 37:10"/>Ziɛi ɠaa ɠa ɗa ɲi ga GALA daa viilɛi maaʋele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:10">gaaʋɛ ɓaa eɠɛ kɔlui.<verse eid="JOB 37:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 37:11"/>GALA ka ɗa tonaɓiingiti kasɔɠili ga dɛilɛigi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:11">é ti leʋe mini-o-mini, mainmain ɗa saɠa ti zu.<verse eid="JOB 37:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 37:12"/>Zekana a ɗa ti ziɛziɛ da adaʋɛ pɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:12">nii a kɛ ti naa ɠɛ eteai zu ná pɛ, nii é ti leʋesu ma.<verse eid="JOB 37:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 37:13"/>Kɛɛʋɛ eɠɛ kpakɔi ɠa é eteai loɠazu la,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:13">ɓaa kɛɛʋɛ eɠɛ ná-wooɠɛɠiladai ɠa é dɛɛzu ga tiye.<verse eid="JOB 37:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 37:14"/>«Zɔɓe, woilo dɛɛ niima vaiti ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:14">Lo dɛɛ, è ɠigaiziɛ GALA ná-faa maanɛɛnɛgiti su.<verse eid="JOB 37:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 37:15"/>È kwɛɛ nɛi ɓaa, ʋelei GALA ge losu da niima vaiti untuɠɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:15">ta ʋelei tonaɓiingiti ti mainmainti saɠazu la?<verse eid="JOB 37:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 37:16"/>È kwɛni ɓaa, ʋelei tonaɓiingiti ta lo da kpɛ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:16">Laavɔɔ vai naati ta naa yeezu, nii ná-faaɠwɛgi laazeeliai.<verse eid="JOB 37:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 37:17"/>Ɗɔun ɗa kaazu ga è maaɠiliʋɛ gola, die golai zei è ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:17">siɛgi zu lɛkpɛmaʋɛ nu yeezazu viilɛi zooi zuvikɛi ɠulazu la zea.<verse eid="JOB 37:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 37:18"/>Ɗa la zoo nɛi è ɓɔ GALA ba, siɛgi zu é ɠɛni geeɠɔlɔgi ɓɛtɛzu la,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:18">é ɓaa, eɠɛ pɛtɛgi puai kɔlu ɓɔigi zu?<verse eid="JOB 37:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 37:19"/>«Ɗa zoo nɛi, è naa lɛ ga giye, nii gá bo ma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:19">Faa nɔpɛ ge la ná, nii gá tɔun kala da,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:19">ti pɛ suɓidiʋɛ gi ɠaazu.<verse eid="JOB 37:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 37:20"/>Siɛgi zu gè kpɔɛi wosu da, kɛni é loo ɠisu ɓaa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:20">Ɓaa kɛni é wo ma, ga nui ta ɓɔɛʋɛ?<verse eid="JOB 37:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 37:21"/>«Wɛlɛ, gaamago nɔ, nu la mɔ wozaɠaazu fɔɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:21">foloi lɔɔɠua tonaɓiingiti poluʋɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:21">Názu ɠa fiilɛi wuzeɠezu la, é geei ɠaaɓale.<verse eid="JOB 37:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 37:22"/>Wozakalagi é volozu, naa ɠa wuzeɠezu ga lɛkpɛma ʋelei nu ɠɔʋɛzuʋɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:22">Wozakalagi é volozu GALA maaɠoolii zu, maayikiʋɛ!<verse eid="JOB 37:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 37:23"/>Toɠa ga Zɛbɛi-Pɛ-Maliɠii, de la zooga vɔɔɠuzu ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:23">bɔɔlɔʋɛ ná-zɛbɛi ta ná-telebodai maaʋele ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:23">kɛlɛ é la ɗa ga sɔledai ta teleboda laazeeliai ʋɛlɛʋiliga.<verse eid="JOB 37:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 37:24"/>Naa ɠa é ba, nuiti maanɛɛʋɛ ti lua ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:24">kɛlɛ tɔun, maavaa la naati ba, niiti ti ɓɔɠɔ ɠaazu ga ɠima nuiti.»<verse eid="JOB 37:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 37"/>
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="JOB 38"/>
  <para style="s">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-gooɠaaʋotegi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 38:1"/>Názu, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI yɛni fiilɛ wolai zu, é Zɔɓe wooɠaaʋote, é ɠɛ ma:<verse eid="JOB 38:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 38:2"/>«Ɓɛ ɠa ga ɗe, è ʋa nà-deveiti gaaʋala ba ga ɠimalala ɓɔɛzuɠulaiti?<verse eid="JOB 38:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 38:3"/>Ɗa-zaamaɠiligi ɠili eɠɛ ziilo nui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:3">nà ʋaazu è ɠaazaɠasu, ɗa kàlasu.<verse eid="JOB 38:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 38:4"/>Mini ɠa è ɠɛni ná,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:4">siɛgi zu gè ɠɛni eteai ɓɛtɛzu la?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:4">Dɛɛ lɛɛ nii è kwɛɛ ga ɗa-ɠeleɠelegi.<verse eid="JOB 38:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 38:5"/>Ɓɛ ɠa é ma ɠɔɠɔgiti toni, è kwɛni ɓaa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:5">Ɓɛ ɠa é kɔɠɔ bo galui laani maazu?<verse eid="JOB 38:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 38:6"/>Ná-tɔkpalaiti kɔɠɔi lɔɔʋɛ ɓɛgele zu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:6">Ɓɛ ɠa é ma sokoga ɠɔtui laani,<verse eid="JOB 38:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 38:7"/>siɛgi zu sobui somideɠaiti ti ɠɛni guyei loozu la ʋɔɔma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:7">siɛgi zu GALA ná-geezuɠeelaiti ti ɠɛni ɠoozunɛɛzu la, ti ɗa zɔngɔ?<verse eid="JOB 38:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 38:8"/>«Ɓɛ ɠa é daaɠuluni kpoloɗɛi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:8">kɛai ma ɠulazu dee ɠoozu,<verse eid="JOB 38:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 38:9"/>siɛgi zu gè tonaɓiingi ɠɛɛni la ga maazeɠei,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:9">gè maavelevele ganii ɠɛ ga kpidii,<verse eid="JOB 38:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 38:10"/>gè pele ɓesani ná-kpizɛi luɠɔ, gè kwɛteʋe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:10">gè daaɠuluni ma, gè sɔɠɔgi loo?<verse eid="JOB 38:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 38:11"/>Gè boni ma ga:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:11">‹Ɗa ɠwɛsu ʋɛ, è la ɓudɛa ná maazu, è ʋa li munu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:11">ɗa-ɗɛ lakpatakpagiti ta-wasogi ɠa ɠwɛsu ʋɛ!›<verse eid="JOB 38:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 38:12"/>«Kaipa è ɠulani etea, è sobui levea ná ɠɛ liele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:12">è seizu ve bɛ, a zei ná geelaabosuʋɛ,<verse eid="JOB 38:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 38:13"/>é zooi lakɔlɔgi zo, é suɓukpunɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:13">é faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nuiti sulua?<verse eid="JOB 38:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 38:14"/>Naazu zooi ɠa valibo, eɠɛ penɛi nu zoo è yeeʋozɛ ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:14">anii pɛ kɛʋele ɓɛtɛai, eɠɛ seɠe a ɠɛ ti ɠɔba.<verse eid="JOB 38:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 38:15"/>Kɛlɛ faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nuiti balagɛ ta-wozakalagi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:15">ti-yeei buzeɠeai doɠa wo fai ma, naa ɠa ɠaleɠale.<verse eid="JOB 38:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 38:16"/>«È zeelia nɛi kpoloɗɛi nɔungi zu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:16">È ziɛziɛga nɛi kpoloɗɛi ma ʋalii ɓomaʋɛ?<verse eid="JOB 38:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 38:17"/>Saai ma ziɠidaʋɛti, ti ɠulani nɛi è ʋɛ kɛlɛma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:17">È kpidi ɓɔii ma ziɠidaʋɛti ka ɓaa?<verse eid="JOB 38:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 38:18"/>È eteai ɠaawɔɔlɔ ʋelei ʋɛtɛga nɛi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:18">Bo dɛɛ, ni è naa kpein kwɛɛ.<verse eid="JOB 38:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 38:19"/>«Pelei ɠa mini, nii é liizu wozakalagi zeizuʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:19">kpidii ma, mini ɠa seizuʋɛ ná,<verse eid="JOB 38:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 38:20"/>ga è zoo è gaaɠa, ʋɛ ti yeeɠaaɠwɛɛzu ná,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:20">è peleiti kwɛɛ ga pagɔ, é li ti-zeizuʋɛ?<verse eid="JOB 38:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 38:21"/>È maanɛɛʋɛ è naati kpein kwɛɛ, mazɔlɔɔ è zɔlɔɔni niina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:21">ɗa-voloiti mɔinʋɛ gola!<verse eid="JOB 38:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 38:22"/>«È lia kɔɔlɛ vukɔi makɛsuʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:22">è sakɔtui makɛsuʋɛ ɠaa nɛi ɓaa,<verse eid="JOB 38:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 38:23"/>nii gè puai ɠoba, maanɔɠɔ voloi ʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:23">ɲɛpi ɠɔɔ voloi vaa zu, ta kɔɔɠɔ voloi?<verse eid="JOB 38:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 38:24"/>Pelei ɠa mini, wozakalagi a ɗa ɠula la, gaa ɗa ɠwɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:24">mini ɠa folo ɠulazu ʋele viilɛi a ɗa zeɠe ná, é ʋa ʋu zooi ma?<verse eid="JOB 38:24"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 38:25"/>«Ɓɛ ɠa é pelei laani sabalagi ʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:25">é mainmain ta tona kpunɛ tugi ziɛ ʋelei la,<verse eid="JOB 38:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 38:26"/>ga tonai pu zooi ma, ʋɛ nu la ná,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:26">é ʋu teʋebai zu, ʋɛ nu vulu la ná,<verse eid="JOB 38:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 38:27"/>ga é zou vɔɔi yɛɓɛ, adaʋɛ náti fɔai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:27">nii a kɛ gui ʋɔnɔ, tufa wundui ɓaɠa?<verse eid="JOB 38:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 38:28"/>Kɛɛɠɛ ɠa nɛi tonai ʋɛ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:28">Ɓɛ ɠa é nɔɗagi ɠilagilagi ɓɛtɛni?<verse eid="JOB 38:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 38:29"/>Ɓɛ ɠoozu ɠa kɔɔlɛi ɠulaai ná?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:29">Geeɠɔlɔgi ma ɠolegi zɔlɔɔ nui ɠa ga ɓɛ?<verse eid="JOB 38:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 38:30"/>Siɛgi zu é ziɛi ɓuunsu da, naa ɠa ɓaa kpekpe eɠɛ kɔtui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:30">ziɛi ɠaaʋɛ ma vuɠeiti ti ɠili ʋa kpe eɠɛ fasai.<verse eid="JOB 38:30"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 38:31"/>«Geezu ʋoogi daa ga ‹Peleyadegiti›, ɗa zoo è galui lo ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:31">ɓaa nii daa ga ‹Wɔliyɔn›, è naa vie?<verse eid="JOB 38:31"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 38:32"/>Ɗa zoo è poogiti kula kɛlɛma ta-yeeɠɛɠalaiti ma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:32">Poogi daa ga ‹Wuluse Golai›, ɗa lo naa luɠɔ ta ná-somideɠa ɠiligi zɔiti?<verse eid="JOB 38:32"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 38:33"/>È geeɠɔlɔgi zu lɔgiti kwɛɛ nɛi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:33">Ɗa ɠidaazu nɛi zooi ná-fai wu, ta ná-seikpasui?<verse eid="JOB 38:33"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 38:34"/>«Ɗa wooɠula tonaɓiingi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:34">nii a kɛ sabalagi ʋu è ma?<verse eid="JOB 38:34"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 38:35"/>Ɗa ɠa ɗa ɗa mainmain leve,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:35">é ʋa leɠa ziɛ, é ɠɛ è ma: ‹Giya ɠaa›?<verse eid="JOB 38:35"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOB 38:36"/>Ɓɛ ɠa é ɠimalai lɔa nuɓusɛi yiimaʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:36">ta faa yɔɠɔzuɠwɛɛ zɛnvui?<verse eid="JOB 38:36"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOB 38:37"/>Ɓɛ ɠa a zoo é tonaɓiingi ɠaalu ga ɠimalai maaʋele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:37">é geeɠɔlɔgi ma ɠɔlɔ liɠiiti maala,<verse eid="JOB 38:37"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOB 38:38"/>siɛgi zu fufiligi ɓaazu la kpe eɠɛ kɔtu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:38">zooi ma ʋɔlɔ ɓuiti ti ɗa ɓɔɠɔ zo?<verse eid="JOB 38:38"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOB 38:39"/>«Ɗa zoo è dosoi ɠɛ, è zala zaai laamianigi zo bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:39">è pului zeɠe zala ɓokpagiti ma,<verse eid="JOB 38:39"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOB 38:40"/>siɛgi zu ti ʋɛɛni la ta-yeɠei zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:40">siɛgi zu ti ʋuuni la kpifɔ, tufai maazu?<verse eid="JOB 38:40"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JOB 38:41"/>Ɓɛ ɠa a ɗa kalawɔnii ná-daamianigi ɓɛtɛ bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:41">siɛgi zu ná-ziʋoiti ti wɔlɔzu la GALA goizu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:41">ti ɗa ziɛziɛ, daamiani ge la ti ya?»<verse eid="JOB 38:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 38"/>
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="JOB 39"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 39:1"/>«È naama yeeɠɛɠalai ɠwɛɛ nɛi, nii fasa woliiti ta ɗa yiʋoi ʋilɛ da?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:1">Ɗa ɗa dopaiti pɛtɛ nɛi, siɛgi zu ti yiʋoi ʋilɛsu da?<verse eid="JOB 39:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 39:2"/>Ɗa ɗa alugi ɠaalu nɛi, nii é kɛɛzu koozu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:2">È ta-yiʋoi zɔlɔɔ yeeɠɛɠalai ɠwɛɛ nɛi ɓaa?<verse eid="JOB 39:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 39:3"/>Ta ɗa zuɓili, ti ti-yiʋoi ʋilɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:3">názu taɓai zeɠea ti ʋa.<verse eid="JOB 39:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 39:4"/>Ti-yiʋoiti su ɠa ɗa lo, ti ɗa wɔɔlɔ fiilɛi ɠa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:4">ta maaɠoozana ti-lee ʋa, ti la mɔ ʋaa pɔ ʋolu.<verse eid="JOB 39:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 39:5"/>«Ɓɛ ɠa é dɔɓɔ zoovalegi ʋilɛgai ɓɔɠɔyeemai zu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:5">Ɓɛ ɠa é dɔɓɔ zoovalegi viegai, ga é li?<verse eid="JOB 39:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 39:6"/>Gè seizuʋɛ ɠɛɛʋɛ ga teʋebai zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:6">kpolo nɛmɛiti ka a ɗa ɲi ti zu.<verse eid="JOB 39:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 39:7"/>Toɠa ɗa ɲɛɛɠula taazuʋɛ ma zɔngɔ wooi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:7">é la sooi ná-totuɠɔ nui ná-kpee wooi mɛniga.<verse eid="JOB 39:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 39:8"/>Toɠa gizeiti suɓizɛ, é ʋa ná-daamianigi zɔlɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:8">tufa wundui kpein ka é gaiziɛzu.<verse eid="JOB 39:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 39:9"/>«Teɠui wɔinʋɛ nɛi ga é lɔ ɗa-wotii zu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:9">Toɠa ɲi nɛi ɗa-logani zasai ɠobaʋɛ?<verse eid="JOB 39:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 39:10"/>Ɗa galu lo nɛi teɠui ʋa, ga é wozawoli è ʋɛ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:10">Toɠa ʋilɛ nɛi è ʋolu, é ɗa kalii ɓokpo nɛmɛi zu?<verse eid="JOB 39:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 39:11"/>Ɗa ɠito nɛi tɔun ba, tɔɔzei ná-zɛbɛi wɔɔlɔʋɛ gola?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:11">Ɗa ɗa-wotii zulɔnɔgi yɛ zea ɓaa?<verse eid="JOB 39:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 39:12"/>Ɗa ɠito ba nɛi, ga toɠa ɗa-moloi leʋe è ʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:12">é ʋaa la, é pu molo loɠazuʋɛ?<verse eid="JOB 39:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 39:13"/>«Sokei ɠoʋegiti ta ɗa ʋɛɛ su ga koozunɛɛi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:13">Kɛlɛ nu la ti ʋokɔɠɔga wɔnii naa nɔnɔi ma, nii daa ga sigɔɲe.<verse eid="JOB 39:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 39:14"/>Mazɔlɔɔ sokei ɠa ɗa ɠain la fufiligi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:14">é zou ɓadii yɛ ná, é ʋɛɛ ma bɛ,<verse eid="JOB 39:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 39:15"/>é yeema ga nua ta ziɛ ma, ti golowolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:15">ɓaa dɔɓɔ zuaiti ta ziɛ ma.<verse eid="JOB 39:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 39:16"/>Ná-dointi ti la loni zii ʋa, eɠɛ ti la ga nɔnɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:16">é la yiizoolɛzu ga é mina ɓɔlɔ wafuun.<verse eid="JOB 39:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 39:17"/>Mazɔlɔɔ GALA ge balani ɠimalai ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:17">é la nɔnɔ zɔlɔɔni keleɠelegi zu.<verse eid="JOB 39:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 39:18"/>Kɛlɛ a wuzeɠena, é kpizɛi lɔɔzei,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:18">toɠa ɗa ɲɛɛɠula sooi ta kpizɛ nui zu, é ti yɛ ɠoozama.<verse eid="JOB 39:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 39:19"/>«Ɗa ɠa è zobogi veezu sooi ʋɛ ɓaa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:19">è maaɠili ga kɔma leɠai, nii a ɗa ɲiikpi?<verse eid="JOB 39:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 39:20"/>Ɗa ɠa ɗa ɗa kɛ é ɗa ʋili fafa eɠɛ kotogi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:20">A ɠɛna ɓɔɠɔ lɛa su ga kpɔzɔ wooi, sasuɓalii ɠa ɗa lɔ nuiti su.<verse eid="JOB 39:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 39:21"/>Toɠa ɗa pɛtugi zuziɠa ga polokagi, koozunɛai ná-zɛbɛi ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:21">É ɗa li ga siliɲɔɠɔi ná-kɔɔɓɔgi laaɠomi ga.<verse eid="JOB 39:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 39:22"/>É ɗa ɲɛɛɠula dualuagi zu, ani la maalua.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:22">É la ɠula ʋolu boɠa zɔkpɔi ʋɛ.<verse eid="JOB 39:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 39:23"/>Kɔɔɠɔ zɔɔlaiti tugi ɠa lɛɛzu maazu:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:23">mɛɛn zeɠe ɓɔlɔi, kpɛɛin é volozu ta kpɛɛn goi.<verse eid="JOB 39:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 39:24"/>É ɗa ɓali ga maaɓɔuntalai, é ɗa ʋili ga kpizɛ wolai.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:24">É la mɔ yɛga loni kpɛ, a puʋugi wooi mɛnina.<verse eid="JOB 39:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 39:25"/>Siɛgi zu puʋugi vɛɛzu la, toɠa ɗa ɓain, é ɠɛ ma: ‹Ee!›,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:25">é yɛ ɠoozama, é kɔɔi ɠugi mɛni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:25">ta kundiɠiiti sikɔ wooi, ta kɔɔ ɓeei.<verse eid="JOB 39:25"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 39:26"/>«Ɗa-ɠeleɠelegi zaɓui ɠa é kɛɛzu seeʋei ɠoʋesu da ɓaa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:26">é ɠoʋe, é li lɛkpɛmaʋɛ nu yeezazu ʋelei?<verse eid="JOB 39:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 39:27"/>Ɗa ɠa è koɠɛi levezu, ga é lɛ fiilɛi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:27">é laɠagi lo gizeiti maazuʋɛti?<verse eid="JOB 39:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 39:28"/>Toɠa ɗa fasa ɠizei ɠɛ ga seizuʋɛ, é ɗa ɲii ná kuai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:28">kɔtu laaʋalizuʋɛ ɠɛ bɛ ga siɠigi.<verse eid="JOB 39:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 39:29"/>Ná ɠa é ná-daamianigi maaɓɔunsu ná,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:29">naa ɠa yɛsu ɠoozama, gaazuɠɛzɛiti ti ka.<verse eid="JOB 39:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 39:30"/>Ná-doungoiti ta ɗa ɓɔɔle ga ɲamai.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:30">Ʋɛ nɔpɛ ani ʋoomaiti ti ná, miná ɠa a ɗa ɠɛ ná.»<verse eid="JOB 39:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 39"/>
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="JOB 40"/>
  <para style="s">Zɔɓe ná-gooɠaaʋote mɔungi vee vai GALA zea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 40:1"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI Zɔɓe ɠaazaɠani, é ɠɛ ma:<verse eid="JOB 40:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 40:2"/>«Ɗa ʋe, GALA Zɛbɛi-Pɛ-Maliɠii maaɠaali nui, ɗa zoo nɛi è va ma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:2">Zɔi é GALA maaɠaalizu, gooɠaaʋote ka zea, ɓaa?»<verse eid="JOB 40:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 40:3"/>Zɔɓe Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma:<verse eid="JOB 40:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 40:4"/>«Wɛlɛ, gè la ga ani nɔpɛ, leeni ɠa nà è wooɠaaʋote da?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:4">Gè yeeʋɛa la deɠɛmu.<verse eid="JOB 40:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 40:5"/>Gè ɓɔɛa, ná ɠɛ ɠila, gè la mɔ gooɠaaʋote bosu ʋolu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:5">Ná ɠɛa fele, gè la mɔ ta laazu ma.»<verse eid="JOB 40:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">GALA ná-kpɔɛzuɠulai velesiɛi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 40:6"/>Názu, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI yɛni fiilɛ wolai zu, é Zɔɓe wooɠaaʋote, é ɠɛ ma:<verse eid="JOB 40:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 40:7"/>«Ɗa-zaamaɠiligi ɠili eɠɛ ziilo nui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:7">nà ʋaazu è ɠaazaɠasu, ɗa kàlasu.<verse eid="JOB 40:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 40:8"/>È wɔinʋɛ gaamazu, è dɛɛ ga gè la leleboni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:8">Ɗa pèelalazu nii a kɛ è ɓɔɠɔ maalobo?<verse eid="JOB 40:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 40:9"/>È yeezuɓaaʋɛ ga GALA kɛʋele?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:9">È-wooi ɠa zoo nɛi é zizi eɠɛ ga tona kpunɛ tugi ɠɛʋele, ga nɔ̀nɔi ɠɛʋele?<verse eid="JOB 40:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 40:10"/>Li, è ɓɔɠɔ ɓɛtɛ ga unfemai ta bɔɔlɔi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:10">è ɓɔɠɔ maaɠili, è ɗa volo, è maayiki!<verse eid="JOB 40:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 40:11"/>Ɗa-yiiɠaawana wolai ɠula ɠɔbu ga nuɓusɛiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:11">wɛlɛ nɔ ná ɠɛ ɠila kpe, è waso nuiti gaayei.<verse eid="JOB 40:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 40:12"/>Waso nuiti kpein pɛtɛ, è ti ʋɛɛ ɠɔɠɔwu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:12">Faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nuiti dɛɛvɛ gaamago nɔ.<verse eid="JOB 40:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 40:13"/>Ti lɔɔɠu ʋɔɔma fufiligi wu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:13">Daaɠulu ti pɛ ma, saai ma ɠasoi ɠa.<verse eid="JOB 40:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 40:14"/>Názu, nà ɓɔɠɔi nà è maamusɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:14">mazɔlɔɔ è-yeei ɠa a ɠɛ ga ɗa-zobo sɔlɔɔ fai.<verse eid="JOB 40:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 40:15"/>«Wɛlɛ maalegi ʋa, nà ɠa gè ga kpɛtɛ nui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:15">eɠɛʋelei gè ga è ɓɛtɛ nui la.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:15">Toɠa ga tufa mii zuai nɔ, eɠɛʋelei nikɛi la.<verse eid="JOB 40:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 40:16"/>Wɛlɛ ba! Ná-zɛbɛi ɠa saamaʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:16">ná-suɓaai ɠɛ koozuʋɛ ma ɲataiti zea.<verse eid="JOB 40:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 40:17"/>Toɠa wɔɔngi maalesu, é kpa kpe, eɠɛ gului daa ga sɛdelegi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:17">Kɔɠɔʋolu ɲataiti fɛlɛʋɛ, ti lɔ kpalai zu.<verse eid="JOB 40:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 40:18"/>Kaeiti kpaaʋɛ eɠɛ kɔlu ɓɔi kalii maaɓiligi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:18">kaka ɠaeiti kulaʋɛ ga kɔlu ɓiligiti.<verse eid="JOB 40:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 40:19"/>Toɠa ga GALA ná-kpɛtɛanii ma ɓii golai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:19">zɔi é kpɛtɛa, naa ɠila kpe ka zobogi bɛ ga é vɔni ma.<verse eid="JOB 40:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 40:20"/>Gizeiti ka ta ɗa ná-daamiani tufai ve,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:20">ʋɛ dɔɓɔ zuaiti kpein ti ɠaɠosu ná.<verse eid="JOB 40:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 40:21"/>Ná-dooɠo bosuʋɛ ɠa ga dɔɓɔ goi ma niinigiti bu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:21">toɠa ɗa lɔɔɠu kpoigi laaʋɛ ma lufaiti su.<verse eid="JOB 40:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 40:22"/>Maa ɠa ɗa lɔɔɠu ga dɔɓɔ goi ma niinigi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:22">kɔtuɗɛi ma wulu wolaiti ti laa ga pepiliye, naati ta ɗa maaɠaku.<verse eid="JOB 40:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 40:23"/>Ni ziɛi a vena, é la ɲiikpiga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:23">Ni Zuludɛn a ʋuuna daaʋɛ, maaɠɛgɛ kpɔ, ziilɛi.<verse eid="JOB 40:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 40:24"/>Nu ɠa zoo é so ɓaa, siɛgi zu é ɠaazuzeɠeai ma la?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:24">Nu ɠa zoo nɛi, é so ga balii ɓaa, é dakulugi ɓota?<verse eid="JOB 40:24"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 40:25"/>«Ɗa li nɛi, è sua maayikiai ɠula ga kalagi ɓaa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:25">Ɗa zoo è nɛgi ɠili ga galui?<verse eid="JOB 40:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 40:26"/>Ɗa zoo è sokpayeɠei ɓota ga tɛmui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:26">è kpalɔɠaei ɓota ga kalagi?<verse eid="JOB 40:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 40:27"/>Toɠa è maanɛɛnɛ ga gola ɓaa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:27">Toɠa woo ʋagɔa wo è ma nɛi ɓaa?<verse eid="JOB 40:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 40:28"/>Toɠa minazeɠe bo è ʋɛ ɓaa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:28">Ɗa so, é yɛ è ya ga duɔi eyɛsu ɠɔ ɓaa?<verse eid="JOB 40:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 40:29"/>Ɗa ɠaɠo da nɛi, eɠɛ wɔni goi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:29">Ɗa gili nɛi ɓaa, ga è-loun anzanu goiti ti ɗa ɠaɠo da?<verse eid="JOB 40:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 40:30"/>Wa ɓɔna su, wa pɔdi nɛi ɓaa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:30">Pɔdi loo nuiti ta zoo ti gaaɠwɛ ʋa ɓaa?<verse eid="JOB 40:30"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 40:31"/>Ɗa zoo è ma ɠɔlɔi ɓota ga doɠai ɓaa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:31">ɓaa nɔungi ga kale ɠula ɠalagi?<verse eid="JOB 40:31"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 40:32"/>Yeeʋɛɛ lɛɛ ba, è la yeema naama ɲɛpii ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:32">è la mɔ ta ɠɛa, eyɛsu pɛ!»<verse eid="JOB 40:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 40"/>
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="JOB 41"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 41:1"/>«Wɛlɛ, kitogi kpein é nu ya ga ɗa vɔni ma, ɗa ɠɛna loni tuɠɔ, naa ɠa nɔ ga dualuagi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:1">Ɗa tɔ ɠila kpe kaana, ɗa lokasu.<verse eid="JOB 41:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 41:2"/>Nu nɔpɛ ge la litini ga é ʋa ziiɠaawana vaa ɠɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:2">Ɓɛ ɠa mu a zoo losu dàawu?<verse eid="JOB 41:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 41:3"/>Ɓɛ ɠa é ani vea bɛ̀, gè ʋa potogi zala?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:3">Geeɠɔlɔgi wu, anii kpein ka ga nɔ̀nɔ.<verse eid="JOB 41:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 41:4"/>«Gè la pɔ gè ʋa maaɠɛ kpɔ kpusɛi ʋaalobazuʋɛti faa zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:4">nà ná-zɛbɛi vai wosu, nu la pokɔɠɔ ga taɠili ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:4">ná-pagi, ta kpusɛi ɓɛtɛ ʋelei.<verse eid="JOB 41:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 41:5"/>Ɓɛ ɠa é ná-seɠei ɠulaa ma ga kakala ʋelei?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:5">Ɓɛ ɠa é ziaa ɲiiga ɲɛkpɛ felegɔiti saama?<verse eid="JOB 41:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 41:6"/>Ɓɛ ɠa é ɓɔiɗa da, é ʋa daalao?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:6">Ɲiiga ɠaazoɓagiti ta ga maalua aniiti.<verse eid="JOB 41:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 41:7"/>Kɔɔɠɔ zɛpɛgi ma ɲɛkpɛ mɔinmɔin ka é ʋɛɛni poluʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:7">ga kpaamaazu aniiti ti wola ɓatagai ɓɔɠɔ ʋa.<verse eid="JOB 41:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 41:8"/>Ti ɠatagai ɓɔɠɔ ʋa, ti ɠilagila pɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:8">fiilɛ la zooga leʋesu ti yɔɠɔzu.<verse eid="JOB 41:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 41:9"/>Ti ɠiliʋɛ ɓɔɠɔ ʋa, ti ɠilagilagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:9">ti ɓɔɠɔ zo, ti la zooga ɠaaɠwɛɛzu.<verse eid="JOB 41:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 41:10"/>«A lisomana, wozakalagi ɠa ɗa ɠula.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:10">Gaazuɠɛzɛiti kulaʋɛ ga geelaalaosuʋɛ ma wozakalagi.<verse eid="JOB 41:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 41:11"/>Sɔmɔ abuiti ti ɗa ɠula daaʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:11">abuɓeɓelaiti ti ɗa ɠula ná.<verse eid="JOB 41:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 41:12"/>Duului ɠa ɠulazu sokpayeɠeiti su, eɠɛ ɠain kpɔvɔi abui ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:12">eɠɛ diɠii é nɛsu.<verse eid="JOB 41:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 41:13"/>Sokpa zu viilɛi ɓadiʋɛ, é ɗa so tiɠi ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:13">abuzogi ɠa ɠulazu daaʋɛ, é ɗa vaza.<verse eid="JOB 41:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 41:14"/>Ná-zɛbɛi ɠa zeini kɔgi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:14">nu nɔpɛ a kaana, kɛni é lua ba.<verse eid="JOB 41:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 41:15"/>Kɔlɔgi ɓilikpiligɛ ma, é mɔin ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:15">Anɛɛ ni nu ɠa ɓadɔzu ma gola, é la faa nɔpɛ kɛa la.<verse eid="JOB 41:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 41:16"/>Kikpaaʋɛ eɠɛ kɔtui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:16">kpaaʋɛ eɠɛ kɔtui ti kpooloi ɲɔfɔsu ma.<verse eid="JOB 41:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 41:17"/>Siɛgi zu é wuzeɠezu la, suɓaa nu wolaiti ta ɗa lua.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:17">Ti ɠɛ unga wuulee, dualuagi vɔni ti ma.<verse eid="JOB 41:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 41:18"/>Boɠa zɔkpɔi a ʋilina ma, po ge la ɠaa ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:18">kpɛɛin ɓalaa, ta mɛɛin ta kpɛɛn goi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:18">naati ti la ga ani nɔpɛ zea.<verse eid="JOB 41:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 41:19"/>Kɔlui ɠa gaazu nɔ eɠɛ tufa vɔɔi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:19">kɔlu ɓɔigi ɠɛ gaazu, eɠɛ gulu luulai.<verse eid="JOB 41:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 41:20"/>Nu la zooga é ʋa kpɛ ga mɛɛin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:20">fɛlɛvɛlɛ kɔtuiti ta zea nɔ ga kaʋai.<verse eid="JOB 41:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 41:21"/>Kpakɔi ɠa gaazu nɔ ga kpaku vɔɔi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:21">a kpɛɛn ʋili tugi mɛnina, é ɗa ɲɛɛ wo.<verse eid="JOB 41:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 41:22"/>Gulu ɠaazoɓagiti ka ti koozuʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:22">a ɠɛna ziaa, é ɗa zooi woli, eɠɛ kaʋa loɠa wulu zɛpɛgi a ɠɛ palaʋalai zu.<verse eid="JOB 41:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 41:23"/>À lɔɔna ziɛi wu, toɠa ɲiikpi eɠɛ diɠi a ɠɛ nɛsu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:23">toɠa kpoloɗɛi valibo, eɠɛ ʋɛ gulɔ maku nɛɛnɛgi ɠalazu ná.<verse eid="JOB 41:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 41:24"/>Toɠa wozakalagi yɛsu ʋoluʋelei pelei zu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:24">Kpoloɗɛi ɠɛ eɠɛ undeɠa ɠolegi.<verse eid="JOB 41:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 41:25"/>Kɛɠala la eteai zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:25">kpɛtɛʋɛ ga é mina lua ɲɛgɛlɛin.<verse eid="JOB 41:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 41:26"/>Toɠa ɗa ɠaazulo sakpeɲɔɠɔiti pɛ ba, é la lua.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:26">Toɠa ga masagi filɛ zuaiti kpein unda.»<verse eid="JOB 41:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 41"/>
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="JOB 42"/>
  <para style="s">Zɔɓe ná-gooɠaaʋote gaaɓelagi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 42:1"/>Zɔɓe Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma:<verse eid="JOB 42:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 42:2"/>«Gè kwɛni ga ɗa zoo é fai pɛ kɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 42:2">faa nɔpɛ ge la pele ɓesaga è luɠɔ, è ʋa ɓe ɗa-leveiti kɛɛzu.<verse eid="JOB 42:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 42:3"/>È ɠɛni ɠɛɛzu mà: ‹Ɓɛ ɠa ga ɗe, è ʋa nà-deveiti gaaʋala ba ga ɠimalala ɓɔɛzuɠulaiti?›</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 42:3">Ungo, gè ɠɛa ɓɔɛzu é ʋilɛ faiti ba, gè la ɠɛni ti ɠaaɠaani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 42:3">ti ɓudɛai màazu, gè la ɠɛni ti ɠwɛɛni.<verse eid="JOB 42:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 42:4"/>È ɠɛni ɠɛɛzu mà: ‹Woilo, nà ɓɔɛzu è ʋɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 42:4">nà ʋaazu è ɠaazaɠasu, ɗa kàlasu.›<verse eid="JOB 42:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 42:5"/>Gè ɠɛa ɗa-vai mɛnisu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 42:5">kɛlɛ niizu gè ɠaazulaa è ma.<verse eid="JOB 42:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 42:6"/>Naa ɠa é ba, gè ɓɔɠɔ ʋeelalaa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 42:6">gè nimiza, gè la fufiligi zu ta zuʋui.»<verse eid="JOB 42:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zɔɓe ná-fai ɠaaɓela ʋelei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 42:7"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓegai ma ga niima ɓɔɛiti bo Zɔɓe ma, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠɛni Teman nui Elifaze ma: «Zìiɠaawanaʋɛ è ma, wa è-wɔɔla felegɔiti, wo la ɓɔɛni ga gaamai é ʋa ʋilɛ bà, eɠɛʋelei nà-botiɠɛ nui Zɔɓe kɛai la. <verse eid="JOB 42:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 42:8"/>Niizuʋɛ, à nikɛ zinɛ lɔfela zeɠe, ta baala sinɛ wola lɔfela, wo lii la nà-botiɠɛ zunui Zɔɓe ʋɔ bɛ, wo ti ɠula ga gala zalaɠai. Nà-botiɠɛ zunui Zɔɓe ɠa GALA fali wo ʋɛ, ʋelei gè unfesu ma la, gè la wo zoga eɠɛʋelei wa-ɠimalala vai la, mazɔlɔɔ wo la ɓɔɛni ga gaamai é ʋa ʋilɛ bà, eɠɛʋelei nà-botiɠɛ zunui Zɔɓe kɛɛni la.»<verse eid="JOB 42:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 42:9"/>Elifaze nii é ga Teman nui, ta Ɓilidade nii é ga Suɠa nui, ta Sofaal nii é ga Naama nui, ti liini, ti naa ɠɛ, nii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI boni ti ma. Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI woiloni Zɔɓe ná-fali wooi ma.<verse eid="JOB 42:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 42:10"/>Naa ʋoluma Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI Zɔɓe wuzeɠeni ʋolu, siɛgi zu é GALA falini la bɔɔlaiti bɛ. Nii kpein Zɔɓe ʋalani ma, é naama ʋɛɛda felegɔi veeni zea vɔlɔ. <verse eid="JOB 42:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 42:11"/>Zɔɓe kɛɛɠɛlointi kpein, zunu geleiti, ta anzanu geleiti, ta bɔɔla ʋagɔiti, ti ʋaani pɔ bɛ ná-pɛlɛi wu, ti laami ʋɔɔma. Ti ta-wɔinlai ɠulani bɛ kɛlɛma, ti gaanɛɛnɛ, tɔɔzei maanɔɠɔi kpein faa zu nii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI seini ma. Ti ɠilagilagi ti wali ɠaei veeni zea, ta zanu balaɠaegi.<verse eid="JOB 42:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 42:12"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI tuya looni Zɔɓe ʋɛ ná-eteai ma ɠaaɓelagi zu, é leʋe ma mɔungi ʋa. Togani goiti é ti zɔlɔɔni, naa ɠɛni ga waapuugɔ maazu naani (14.000), ɲɔmɛi ɠɛni ga waadɔzita (6.000), nikɛi ɠɛni ga waafelegɔ (2.000), ta soovale saai ɠɛni ga waagila (1.000). <verse eid="JOB 42:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 42:13"/>É doun zunu lɔfela zɔlɔɔni, ta doun anzanu saʋagɔ. <verse eid="JOB 42:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 42:14"/>É anzanu loun mɔungi laasei pɛɛni ga Yemima (nii poluʋɛ ga «kpumagoi»). É felesiɛi laasei pɛɛni ga Kezia (nii poluʋɛ ga «gulɔ maku nɛɛnɛgi ma wului ma ʋuai»). Saʋasiɛi laa ɠɛni ga Kelɛn-Ɠapuke (nii poluʋɛ ga «gaazuɠɔpolu ʋodai»). <verse eid="JOB 42:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 42:15"/>Pa anzanuiti kpein ti ɠɛni zooi ná zu, tanɔpɛ ge la ɠɛni ʋani ga Zɔɓe ná-doun anzanuiti kɛʋele. Ti-ɠɛɛ tɔnɔ veeni ti ya poganii zu, ga ti-ʋaazeelaiti kɛʋele.<verse eid="JOB 42:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 42:16"/>Naama vaiti teʋe ga ʋoluma, Zɔɓe yɛni vulua, é kɛ ga kona ungila kona ʋuunaani (140), é ná-dointi ka, ta ná-doun zunuiti ti-lointi, eyɛsu ɠɛɠalama naanigɔ. <verse eid="JOB 42:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 42:17"/>Naa ʋoluma, Zɔɓe zii zuɠoozani, é wɔlɔzaɠa gola é ʋa leɠa za.<verse eid="JOB 42:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 42"/>
</usx>
